<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="EZK" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">EZEKIEL</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="toc2">EZEKIEL</para>
  <para style="toc3">Eze</para>
  <para style="mt1">EZEKIEL</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">Ezekiel tuh BC 586 kum kya Jerusalem aro maw te aro kou lyakhe Babilon ram kya a um. Kyng hae zah Babilon um hae paw te Jerusalem khua um hae paw hanlan hynh-e bya hynh a hopaw nynh thua. Ezekiel ccauh kyahin abyapipaw akonglang ccangtaruh a um: (1) Pachia nynh Ezekiel kha profeh lang konaw; (2) A minphuin hae nynh Pachia byapianaw a teing lan hae paw kong te Jerusalem aronaw lanpaw kong raeringnaw pyanaw; (3) A ccungccaw hae kha vawsawnaw pya hae zah a cciakhaesei hae paw minphuin ccangpaw hae tungvaw byapianaw te asekuhpaw Bawipaw bya; (4) Jerusalem aroh koute Israel hae hanlan lungtangnaw bya te malang ccyh ahoypaw hanlan byakinpyakunaw; (5) Gog siapharan kha rawsenawpaw profehbya; (6) Raethui lanpaw Beikinn te Israel minphuin muinsan kha Ezekiel nynh muihdaenaw.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ezekiel tuh Pachia kha myarya a zynpaw te tuanaw-roihnaw aphuinphuin a hoipaw ccungccaw nynh thua. A muihpaw patae kha vizin pungsan te hopah hae zah a ho rypaw bya kha ccaerarihpaw muihsahnaw ryalaw te a langsahpya hae. Ezekiel nynh alungkhu lang e thinlung thawpaw te tuanaw thawpaw abyapi athuanaw kong te pyn raveih seinaw hanlan pyn raveih kya tavuan a um cipaw kha a langsah. Aning nynh Israel minphuin hiinnaw a thawthui lanpaw a ngaehoinaw kong kha a ho. Ranpibawi thua zah profeh mah athua keiccuze Beikinn te thyaa ahonaw kong kha myarya a peki.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abyalupi hae</para>
  <para style="io1">Ezekiel kha konaw 1.1—3.27</para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalem aro lanpaw kong 4.1—24.27</para>
  <para style="io1">Minphuin ccangpaw hae tungvaw Pachia byapianaw 25.1—32.32</para>
  <para style="io1">Pachia nynh a minphuin hae kha byakinpyaku hae 33.1—37.28</para>
  <para style="io1">Gog siapharan rawsenawpaw profehbya 38.1—39.29</para>
  <para style="io1">Malang ccyh Beikinn te Israel ram elang vizin 40.1—48.35</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Marangle Vizin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sung thum kum, sawpaw sah palinaw, nin pangaw nin kya Khebar vawkhu kin khe kyngte ramccang lang a cciakhae hae paw kya ka um lyakhe vaawlui tuh yn hungkuh zah Pachia kya-e vizin kha ka muih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:11">Bya 19.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuh-e sawpaw nin pangaw nin khe (tuin nin tuh Jehoiakhin Siapharan kha kyngte ramccang lang a cciakhaenaw hae kum pangawnaw kum nynh thua),<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:10-16">2Si 24.10-16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:9-10">2Sh 36.9-10</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Khaldi ram, Khebar vawkhu kin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Buzi ccapaw ranpibawi Ezekiel kalan yn thua; te tuin kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih tuh a tungvaw khe a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngawran ka do lyakhe, myarya rupaw khise tuh thahlang te yn zaw: tuh-e khise kyakhe phaephae akpaw nynh phang koihlupaw myarya lepaw maeking te dalahdalah awpaw maee a um, te maee lungkhu tuin sohin hawte a awpaw awnaw a um. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuh-e maee lungkhu tuin ahiinpaw ahysuepaw ccangpali a um. Tuh-e hae mih muinsan tuh: ccungccaw muinsan lo hae zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:6">Bya 4.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />ccangkheit ze mitmae ccangpali hoi hae zah sake ccangpali cci a hoi hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Mih ccu tuh lawbabin lan cih zah mih ccukaw tuh vaetuataw ccukaw nynh alo; phaephae akpaw sohin hawte a ak hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Mih sake kaw, mih pyn san pali khe ccungccaw kuih a hoi hae. Tuh-e ccangpali hae nynh mitmae hae te sake hae a hoi hae: <verse number="9" style="v" />mih sake hae tuh ccangkheit te ccangkheit a tungkuh hae; tuh-e hae tuh a ccia hae ze maeku leite malang lawbabin lan a cceih hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Mih mae muinsan tuh: ahiinpaw ahysuepaw ccangpali hae maesue tuh ccungccaw maesue hoi hae zah, mih ranglang khe chindeih maesue, mih voilang khe tangnuapaw maesue, mosipi maesue a hoi hae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:14">Eze 10.14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:7">Bya 4.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />tuh hawte nynh mih maesue tuh athua hae. Mih sake kha mih luki langkhe tharae a daw hae; ahiinpaw ahysuepaw ccangkheit cci nynh sake bua ning cci a hoi hae, mih sake bua kheit tuh ccangpaw ahiinpaw ahysuepaw sake te tungsakuh hae zah ccangpaw bua kheit nynh mih pyn kha a bong. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahiinpaw ahysuepaw ccangkheit cci tuh muisaw nynh a ccianaw miakaw langkhe ccanglang maeku leite malang khe lawbabin lan a cceih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuh-e ahiinpaw ahysuepaw hae ngaelung khe maee-e aruapaw alopaw, ahiinpaw ahysuepaw hae laku kya nulang malang a nuekuh bungthungpaw maeekhua alopaw a um; maee tuh phaephae ak zah maee kyate khozaw alaekuh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahiinpaw ahysuepaw hae tuh khozawlaekuhpaw hawte nulang malang rangtareih lan a ccue bungthung hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahiinpaw ahysuepaw hae kha ka do lyakhe, tuh-e ccangpali hae mih pepan raveih khe leccu ccangkheit cci kha laekhu khe ka muih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.15-21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:9-13">Eze 10.9-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Leccu hae muinsan te a raenaw hae paw tuh hynhte nynh thua: mih muinsan tuh phaephae akpaw, aphutepaw lung te lokuh zah, ccangpali mawte mih muinsan pong lokuh hae; a raenaw hae paw tuh leccu ccangkheit lungkhu a umpaw leccu ccangkheit te nynh aloku. <verse number="17" style="v" />He a ccia hae ze, leccu ccangpali hae tuh ccanglang pawpaw kalan mah maeku leite pynkheit lan a cceihthya hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Leccu hae tuh hang hae zah ri lan a um hae, pawccecize tuh-e leccu hae ccangpali mawte po voilu lan mit a hoi hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:8">Bya 4.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahiinpaw ahysuepaw hae tuh he a ccia vae hae ze, mih pe khe leccu hae tuh a cceihbua hae; ahiinpaw ahysuepaw hae tuh laephi kyate he a hangku vae hae ze, leccu hae mah a hangkuh bua hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Muisaw nynh a ccianaw miakaw langkhe minmin tuh cceihbua hae zah, minmin ryte leccu hae tuh a hangkuh bua hae; pawccecize ahiinpaw ahysuepaw hae muisaw tuh leccu hae kya a um. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahiinpaw ahysuepaw hae tuh a ccia hae ze, leccu hae mah cceihbua hae zah, a thadyn vae hae ze leccu hae mah a thadynbua hae; laephi kyate he a hangku hae ze, leccu hae mah a hangkuh bua hae; pawccecize ahiinpaw ahysuepaw hae muisaw tuh leccu hae kya a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahiinpaw ahysuepaw hae lu luki khe adawkuhpaw te lokuh zah muinsado hawte a akpaw, mih lu luki tharae dawkuhpaw a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:6">Bya 4.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" />Adawkuhpaw zakaw khe mih sake hae kha ccangkheit nynh ccangpaw ccangkheit kalan khe lawbabin lan a daw hae, tuh-e ahysuepaw hae ccangkheit cci nynh mih pyn abongpaw sake ccangning cci a hoi hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />He a ccia hae ze, tui alepaw roi hawte thuasah, Alesaepaw kya-e kholungthyhpaw hawte thuasah mih sake roi kha ka thae, ngaluin-ngaluin accaepaw roi tuh rhawkaw hae roi hawte nynh athua; he a thadyn hae ze, mih sake kha a sawbung hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:15">Bya 1.15</ref>, <ref loc="REV 19:6">19.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v" />Te mih lu luki umpaw adawkuhpaw kyate roi roikheit yn ccae; he a thadyn hae ze, mih sake kha a sawbung hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mih lu luki umpaw adawkuhpaw vawlan khe nilar lung alopaw, bawitungkhung tahawpaw a um; tuh-e bawitungkhung vawlan tuin ccungccaw muinsan alopaw tuh a haung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:1">Eze 10.1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:2-3">Bya 4.2-3</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v" />Atae alopaw kyate palung lang kyakhe phaephae akpaw sohin te alokuhpaw, po voilu lan maee te alokuhpaw kha ka muih; atae alopaw kyate alia lang kyakhe maee te alokuhpaw, po voilu lan dalahdalah akpaw kha a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:2">Eze 8.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuhte po voilu lan dalahdalah akpaw muinsan tuh khuaaraw ccyh lya maeking kya alangkuhpaw sawdoih te nynh aloku. E hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phu-enaw te alokuhpaw muinsan nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">Tuh-e tuh he ka muih te, ka mae ka sahbung, te lukhakheit nynh bya a hopaw roi kha ka thae.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ccakue Vizin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aning nynh kae yn hopyapaw tuh: Pou ccungccapaw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hebru bya kya ccungccaw ccapaw cite a um.</char></note>, thadyntua, bya kae hopah cih. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te aning nynh bya he yn hopah te, muisaw tuh ka lungkhu lang tee zah ka ccu te yn thadynsah; te bya yn hopyapaw kha ka thae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Aning nynh yn hopyapaw tuh: Ccungccapaw, nang kha Israel hae kalan, kae yn doutu dou a mangpaw minphuin kalan kae saw cih; minmin te mih minpaaw hae nynh atunin cia ka tungvaw a sei vae hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />E ciihan tuh a bunglepaw te a lungkhungpaw nynh thua. Nang kha minmin kalan kae saw cih zah minmin kyakhe, “Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho,” cite na hopah cih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />(Minmin tuh dou a mangpaw phin thua hae zah), a ngae hae zemah thuasah, a ngae khyh hae zemah thuasah minmin laku kya profeh lu kheit a um cipaw a nyh cih hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Pou ccungccapaw, thabu hae te hinpaw hae nynh nang kha ae koihlu hae zah zekang hae laku kya na um zemah minmin kha rih nan hae, mih bya kha mah rih nan; mih maesue keiccuze na lungroh nan sah, pawccecize minmin tuh dou a mangpaw phuin nynh thua hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin tuh dou a mangpaw phuin thua hae zah, a ngae hae zemah thuasah, a ngae khyh hae zemah thuasah ka bya hynh na hopah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama, pou ccungccapaw, nang tuh kae hopyapaw hynh ngae lah, khah-e dou a mangpaw phuin hawte dou a mangpaw thua nan; na khalang aw lah, kae pyapaw hynh aetua, yn ci. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka do zah, ccaw azeikuhpaw ccakue kha phang a ccyngpaw kuih nynh ka kalan yn dyngkupaw kha ka muih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.9-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:1">Bya 5.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Aning nynh tuh-e ccakue tuh ka malang khe a daw; nulang malang te azeikuhpaw tuh-e ccakue kyakhe rawnaw bya, khuinaw bya te ngaethyanaw bya kha azeikuh.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aning nynh yn hopah zah, pou ccungccapaw, na kalan pya athuapaw kha aetua; e ccakue hynh aetua, te cceih lah, Israel phin kha hopah hae, yn cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.1-3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 10:9-10">Bya 10.9-10</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka khalang tuh ka aw zah, ae lanpaw ccakue kha aning nynh yn pya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Aning nynh kae kha yn hopah zah, Ccungccapaw, kae pyapaw e ccakue hynh ae lah, bynsaku tua, yn cipya. Tetuh ccakue tuh ka ae zah, ka khalang kya khoitui hawte a e.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aning nynh kae kha yn hopah zah: Ccungccapaw, Israel phin kalan cceih lah, ka bya hynh hopya tua hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Thaethya arupaw bya a ho hae paw kalan te arupaw bya a ho hae paw kalan nang kha kae saw khyh, Israel phin kalan nynh kae saw— <verse number="6" style="v" />mih bya na thaepya kho lei hae paw, thaethya arupaw bya a ho hae paw te arupaw bya a ho hae paw minphuin patae kalan nang kha kae saw khyh. Thanccingte, tuh-e hae kalan kae la saw lanze, na bya kha ae ngaepah cih hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama Israel phin nynh na bya kha ae ngaepah lan khyh hae, pawccecize Israel phin balyn tuh mih bungle zah mih lungkhung keiccuze ka bya kha ngae ry khyh hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Minmin hawte a bunglepaw te a lungkhungpaw lang kae rae vae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Na terui kha rihlung laeze a tang huapaw, lung a tang huaccepaw lang kae rae vae; minmin kha rih nan hae, mih maesue keiccuze na lungroh nan sah, pawccecize minmin tuh dou a mangpaw phin nynh thua hae, yn cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Aning nynh kae yn hopyapaw tuh: Ccungccapaw, kae hopya lanpaw ka bya balyn hynh na nakaring te thae lah, na thinlung kya lawku tua; <verse number="11" style="v" />te kyng hae zah ramccang lang a cciakhae hae paw na ccungccaw hae kalan cceih lah, hopah hae. Minmin nynh a ngae hae zemah thuasah, a ngae khyh hae zemah thuasah, “Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho,” cite hopah hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Khebar Vawkhu kya Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tetuh muisaw nynh kae kha yn hangthung zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phu-enaw tuh a umnaw kyate he a hangku lyakhe, myarya ccaepaw siho kha ka nulang khe ka thae; <verse number="13" style="v" />tuh-e siho tuh ahiinpaw ahysuepaw hae nynh ccangkheit te ccangkheit mih sake a nuihkuh hae paw siho, mih pe umpaw leccu hae roi te siho myarya ccaepaw nynh thua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Muisaw nynh kae kha yn hang zah ccaring yn cciakhae; kae tuh ka thinlungccih zah ka bungzou, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih tuh ka tungvaw myarya a kuihlungccih. <verse number="15" style="v" />Kyngte ramccang lang a cciakhae hae paw Khebar vawkhu pe, Tel-abib khua um hae paw kya ka thua zah, nin sari lungkhu ngaeangthuate minmin kya ka um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nin sari koute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua: <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, nang kha Israel phin a rintu lang kae rae vae; ka bya na thae takyhte, ka kyate yn thuapaw raeringnaw kha na pya cih hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />“Na chih ccaccing cih,” cite ccungccaw hoyleipaw ka hopyapaw kha nang nynh raeringnaw na pya khyh ze thuasah, ccungccaw hoyleipaw kha a hiinnaw khum khylan raeringnaw bya na hopya khyh ze thuasah, tuh-e ccungccaw hoyleipaw tuh a hoyleinaw keiccu a chih cih; thuasalama a chiise kha nang kae ngia cih. <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuasalama ccungccaw hoyleipaw kha raeringnaw na pya zah, a hoyleinaw kyate thuasah, ahoy leipaw a cyisahnaw kyate thuasah a maeleihku khyh lanze a hoyleinaw keiccu aning tuh a chih cih, thuasalama nang na hiinnaw tuh na khumku vae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukoute miding tuh a dingnaw kyate maeleihkuh zah hoyleinaw kha a rae ze thuasah, a malang khe thykupawkunaw kha ka nungkhaw ze thuasah aning tuh a chih cih; aning kha raeringnaw na pya khyh keiccuze a seinaw hanlan a chih cih, a la rae vae paw a dingnaw kha liathuipya thua lan khyh; thuasalama a chiise kha nang kae ngia cih. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuhzemah, miding kha a sei khyh nawlan raeringnaw na pya zah a sei khyh lanze, raeringnaw kha a lawku keiccuze a hiin ccaccing cih, te nang na hiinnaw tuh na khumku vae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ezekiel tuh A Makhaete Um zah Yccae Khyh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih tuh ka tungvaw a um; te aning nynh kae kha, Thokuh lah, accya langkhe cciatua, tuin kya nang kha bya kae hopah cih, yn cipya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka thokuh zah accya lang ka cceih; tuin kyakhe Khebar vawkhu kin ka muih boi paw phu-enaw te alokuhpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phu-enaw tuh a thadyn; te ka mae kha ka sahbung. <verse number="24" style="v" />Muisaw tuh ka lungkhu lang tee zah kae kha yn thadynsah; te kae kha bya yn hopah zah: Cceih lah, na inn lungkhu khe khawsungku tua. <verse number="25" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, ccungccaw hae kalan na ccia kho khyh nawlan arui te khii na thua cih; <verse number="26" style="v" />bya na ho khyh nawlan te minmin kha na thuihei khyh nawlan hae, na lae kha na dankhaling kya kae besakuh cih; pawccecize minmin tuh dou a mangpaw nynh thua hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Thuasalama bya kae hopya ze, na mung kha kae hungpah cih zah, nang nynh minmin kha, “Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho,” cite na hopah cih hae; a ngae rypaw nynh ngae sah lah, a ngae ry leipaw nynh ngae nan sah; pawccecize minmin tuh dou a mangpaw nynh thua hae.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem Koihlunaw Muihsahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pou ccungccapaw, ohkhe kha lah lah, na malang khe nungtua. A vawlan khe Jerusalem khuapi zuh kha soiitua; <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem kha rawsenawpaw rhawvianawpaw bu, khualungrua, laekarung, rhawkaw ryahmin te rhawlungrua tingnawpaw uccaw kha po voilu lan raenua tua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te sivaw aphepaw kha lah lah, nang te khuapi laku khe sivaw pang hawte thungtua, na mae kha khuapi kalan khe hawitua, khuapi tuh koihlu thua sah, nang tuh khuapi a koihlutu na thua cih. E hynh Israel phin hanlan muihsahnaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Te na voilang pahaekute ih lah, Israel phin tungvaw detahnaw tuh na tungvaw khe khangku tua; tuhcite na i nin aninlu thyhte minmin tungvaw detahnaw kha na teing cih. <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize nin kheit tuh mih tungvaw detahnaw kum kheit te alokuh lante ria thua zah, mih tungvaw detahnaw aninlu za thum sung takua kha na tungvaw ka khang vae; tuhcite Israel phin kya-e detahnaw kha nang nynh na teing cih. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuh-e aninlu tuh he na ccingsah te, vae ningnaw na ih cih zah na ranglang khe na pahaekuh cih, te Judah phin tungvaw detahnaw kha nin sung pali lungkhu teingtua; nin kheit tuh kum kheit hanlan ria athua cih. <verse number="7" style="v" />Koihlupaw Jerusalem langkhe na mae na hawi cih, te na kuih na dyngnua cih zah rawsete profehbya na honua cih. <verse number="8" style="v" />Na teingnaw ccyh kha na ccingsah mawlaezung voikheit langte voikheit langkhe na paleihku kho khyh nawlan, arui te kae khii cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Te chanvuih, barli, pei hae, bia hae, ccaw te pangccaw kha lah hae; ang angkheit lungkhu khe pyde hae lah, sanlou kha raeku tua. Voikheit lang pahaekute na i nin aninlu za thum sung takua lungkhu tuh-e sanlou tuh na ae cih. <verse number="10" style="v" />Nin kheit ze shekel ccangkuin aripaw looh kha na ae cih; amaw accyh te na ae cih. <verse number="11" style="v" />Toukute tui kha mah na neih cih, nin kheit ze paling ling kheit kha amaw accyh te na neih cih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Sanlou kha ccungccaw hae muihnaw khe ccungccaw ia khate na rua cih zah, barli sanlou kha ae hawte na ae cih, a ci. <verse number="13" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Ka dee cihnaw hae minphuin hae laku khe Israel ccungccaw hae nynh anungsikuhpaw mih sanlou kha tuhcite a ae cih hae,” a ci. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tetuh kae nynh, “Pou Bawipaw PACHIA, kamaw te kamaw papin ka thusakuh boi khyh; amaw chi lan chihpaw thuasah, sarangpaw nynh a teipaw thuasah, athuhpaw saw thuasah ka di lyate atu cia ka ae boi khyh,” ka ci. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tetuh aning nynh kae kha, “Ccungccaw ia ccelang vaetua ia kha mang lan kae ua cih, tuh-e khate na sanlou kha na ruakuh cih,” yn ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Te aning nynh kae kha, Ccungccapaw, Jerusalem hanlan looh bawmnaw kha ka paetaw vae cih; minmin nynh looh kha toukute thinphang biate a ae cih hae; tui kha mah toukute lungrote a neih cih hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tui te looh um leite, lu kheit te lu kheit lungrote a dokuh cih hae, mih tungvaw detahnaw keiccuze mih ngethah cih.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem Rawsepaw Thaloi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pou ccungccapaw, thaloi hepaw kha lawku tua; sang ngotu kya-e sangteih hawte mang lah, na sang te na khawming kha ngoku tua; te khin nawlan zawccu kha lawkuh lah, na sang kha pum thum lang phia lah nungtua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Khuapi koihlu ccyh he accing te, na sang pum thum pum kheit kha khuapi lungkhu khe maee te na u cih; pum thum pum kheit kha na lah cih zah khuapi lungkhu phe lekuh lan thaloi te na aw cih; pum thum pum kheit kha khivae kya na vua cih zah, kae nynh mah tuh-e sang nulang khe thaloi te ka zui cih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te tuh-e sang kya-e beihtaraw kha na lah cih zah na angkiccua adung khe na tungde cih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh-e sang kya-e abang kha bua na lah cih zah, maee kya phungte na u cih; tuin kyate maee nynh Israel phin balyn kha a pounua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: E hynh Jerusalem nynh thua; minphuin hae ngaelung khe ka nung cih zah, ram hae nynh po a koihlu cih hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Aning tuh minphuin ccangpaw hae te a pepan po koihlu hae paw ram hae laeze hoyleinaw a rae huapaw lang tang zah, ka phungzae te ka phungbya hae kha a dou, ka phungzae hae kha vua zah ka phungbya hae kha zui khyh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Nae pepan po ae koihlu oh paw minphuin hae laeze vawsawnaw na thuakhaehua oh zah, ka phungbya hae kha zui leite ka phungzae hae kha mah na kyngkuh khyh oh, thuasalama nae pepan po ae koihlu oh paw minphuin hae kya-e phungzae hae kha na zui oh; <verse number="8" style="v" />tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Kamaw ccaccei nynh kae ccianua cih oh; minphuin hae nynh a muihnaw hae khe, nae kya byapianaw ka rae cih. <verse number="9" style="v" />Nae nungsikunaw balyn keiccuze papin ka rae boi leipaw te bua ka rae vae cih leipaw byapianaw kha nae tungvaw ka rae cih. <verse number="10" style="v" />Thanccingte, pou Jerusalem, nang na ngaelung khe nungpaaw hae nynh mih ccaaw hae kha a ae cih hae zah, ccaaw hae nynh nungpaaw hae kha a ae cih hae; na tungvaw byapianaw ka rae cih zah, na kya ahiinhypaw miakaw kha teitei lang balyn phiariphiarae pong ka nung cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 4:10">Raw 4.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw tuh, kae tuh ka hiin thyhte, thanccingte, athupaw na uccaw balyn te thuasah, na nungsikunaw balyn te thuasah ka beikinnthyaa kha na thusah vae keiccuze kae theih cih; nang kha kae haang lan khyh zah ngaethya kae umsah lan khyh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Na ccungccaw hae pum thum pum kheit tuh shethya khate a chih cih hae, tuhkhyhze na ngaelung kyakhe ccakanccinaw khate maemih athua cih hae; pum thum pum kheit tuh na pepan khe thaloi te a chih cih hae; pum thum pum kheit kha teitei lang balyn pong ka phiasakuh cih hae zah, mih nulang te thaloi khate ka zui cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh ka thinrianaw tuh accing cih, ka bungpawnaw kha mih tungvaw ka langsakuh cih zah, ka lungrya achih cih; mih tungvaw ka thinrianaw he accing te, kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh tuathyanaw te nynh ka ho cipaw kha a nyh cih hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuhpiaze na pepan umpaw minphuin ccangpaw hae laku thuasah, na pe po cceih hae paw balyn muihnaw kya thuasah nang kha ccungccaw adaenaw te saryapaw uccaw lang kae rae cih. <verse number="15" style="v" />Thinria bungpaw te thuasah, myarya ccihpaw detahnaw te thuasah na tungvaw khe byapianaw he ka rae te, nang tuh na pepan umpaw minphuin ccangpaw hae kyakhe saryapaw te nuinsepaw, raeringnaw pyanawpaw te ri lan umpaw lang na tang cih. E bya hynh kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka ho vae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Nanning kha ro khylan, ka kaw cih paw ronawpaw the, chinawpaw ccakanccinaw the te kae kaw cih oh; ccakanccinaw kha nae tungvaw houhouh ka thuasah cih zah, nae looh bawmnaw kha ka paetaw cih. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccakanccinaw te sarepaw hae kha kae sawnua cih oh zah, nae ccaaw hae kha ae luade cih oh; shethya te chiise luanaw nynh ae teenua cih oh; nae tungvaw kya thaloi rhaw ka thuasah cih. Kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka ho vae, a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:8">Bya 6.8</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zohtuh Beikpaw Israel kha Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />Pou ccungccapaw, na mae kha Israel kya-e mua hae kalan khe hawi lah, profehbya honua hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pou nanning Israel mua hae, Bawipaw PACHIA bya hynh thaetua oh! Bawipaw PACHIA nynh mua hae te sangpyng hae kalan te vahya te accya kyakhe hynhte a ho: Kae, kamaw ccaccei nynh nae tungvaw kya thaloi ka thuasah cih zah, nae kya-e ahangpaw hmin hae kha ka roh cih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Nae silawhang hae tuh ccungccaw adae cih zah, nae kya-e mynkhuhpaw unawpaw tung hae tuh khya athua cih; chiapaw nae ccungccaw hae tuh nae zohtuh hae malang khe ka khulia cih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel hae rhua kha mih zohtuh hae malang khe ka nung cih; nae ru hae kha nae silawhang pepan khe phiariphiarae ka nung cih. <verse number="6" style="v" />Teitei na um oh zemah nae khua hae tuh ccungccaw adae cih zah, ahangpaw nae hmin hae tuh aroh cih, tuhteze nynh nae silawhang hae tuh a umhan cih zah aroh cih, nae zohtuh hae tuh akhya cih zah aroh cih, nae kya-e mynkhuhpaw unawpaw tung hae tuh bae athua cih zah nae ryalaw tuh azo cih. <verse number="7" style="v" />Chiapaw ccungccaw hae tuh nanning laku khe a khuliakuh cih hae; tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama abang kha ka haang cih hae. Nanning laku e abang tuh minphuin ccangpaw hae laku khe thaloi rhaw kyate a lue cih hae zah, ram hae kalan khe pong a phiakuh cih hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka kyate a maeleihkuhpaw mih thinlung sei rynaw keiccu thuasah, mih zohtuh hae nulang a maeleihkuhpaw, sei rynaw mih mitdae keiccu thuasah kae hynh pawtemou yn ro hae cipaw kha a lue hae paw nynh kyng athuanaw hae minphuin hae laku khe kae kha yn liathui cih hae. Tetuh minmin nynh a cyisei hae paw hoyleinaw te mih nungsikunaw balyn keiccuze mimaw toulou nynh mih nungsikunaw kha a rihkuh cih hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha minmin nynh a nyh cih hae; mih tungvaw kya e shethya thuasah lanpaw hynh alakaw lan ka sii huataw khyh hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Israel phin kya-e athupaw anungsikuhpaw balyn hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! cite ho oh lah, nae kuih biate nae ccu te suakuh oh. Pawccecize minmin tuh thaloi, ccakan te shethya khate a chih cih hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Asawnaw kya um hae paw tuh shethya te a chih cih hae zah, anaenaw kya um hae paw tuh thaloi te a chih cih hae; ahiinhypaw miakaw te haang athua hae paw tuh ccakanccinaw te a chih cih hae. Tuhcite ka thinrianaw kha mih tungvaw ka ccingsah cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Silawhang hae pepan, zohtuh hae laku kya, ahangpaw sangpyng miakaw vawlan, mua dung hae balyn vawlan, hinlalyhpaw thingku kaw miakaw, anaw bungpaw phaesi thing miakaw kaw te minmin nynh mih zohtuh hae balyn kha mynkhuhpaw a pyanaw hae hmin miakaw kyakhe chiapaw mih ccungccaw hae nynh he a huekuh hae tuh, kae hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka thua cipaw na nyh cih oh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Minmin kha ka kuih ka dyngnua cih hae zah, khuasahnaw hae balyn pong lekuh lan, ramkaw kyate Riblah kyacia, ram kha ccungccaw adaenaw te ccungkia leipaw ram lang ka rae cih. Tetuh minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ronaw Anae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />Pou ccungccapaw, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh Israel ram kha hynhte a hopya:</para>
  <para style="q1">Athang vae! Ram aki ki pali tungvaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">athangnaw tuh athua vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Athangnaw tuh atu</para>
  <para style="q2">na tungvaw a thua vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thinrianaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na tungvaw kae sawnua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">na cyisahnaw thyhte bya kae pia cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">na nungsikunaw balyn hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha de kae tah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang kha kae haang lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya kae ungsah lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Na nungsikunaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na kya phang um zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na cyisahnaw keiccu de kae tah cih.</para>
  <para style="m">Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Ronaw phuin kheit koute</para>
  <para style="q2">phuin kheit yn thua!</para>
  <para style="q2">Dotua, ronaw yn thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Athangnaw a thua vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">athangnaw a thua vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang kha ae thonuakuh vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">dotua, yn thua vae!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pou ram lungkhu um hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae ronaw nynh ae thuanua vae oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Accyh zaw vae, mua vawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">lungpawnaw thua leite,</para>
  <para style="q2">keisukeilae umnaw nin kha anae vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aro mawze ka thinrianaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nae tungvaw ka bu cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thinrianaw kha nae tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">kae ccingsah nua cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Nae cyisahnaw thyhte</para>
  <para style="q2">bya kae pia cih oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae nungsikunaw balyn keiccu</para>
  <para style="q2">de kae tah cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nanning kha kae haang lan khyh oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya kae umsah lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Na nungsikunaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">nae laku kya a um keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">nae cyisahnaw thyhte</para>
  <para style="q2">de kae tah cih oh.</para>
  <para style="m">Tetuh nanning de ae tah oh paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thua cipaw na nyh cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dotua, tuh-e nin!</para>
  <para style="q2">Dotua, tuh-e nin tuh yn thua vae!</para>
  <para style="q2">Nang na ronaw ccyh yn thua vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tungbang tuh apaw paw vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">lysakunaw tuh atoih vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Puathonaw tuh hoyleinaw</para>
  <para style="q2">tungbang lang a lethung vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin tuh lu kheit sanmah</para>
  <para style="q2">hiinhy lan khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih hoirumnaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih sisua mah laehy vae khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin laku kya phu-enaw um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Accyh azaw vae, anin yn nae vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">a retu tuh a lungpaw nan sah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a zuatu mah a ngaethah nan sah,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize Pachia thinrianaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin zapi balyn tungvaw khe a um.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A zuatu nynh a la zua vae paw uccaw kalan aning nynh a hiinshe lungkhu bua kithui vae lan khyh. Pawccecize tuh-e zapi balyn te asekuhpaw vizin tuh ccing leite um lan khyh. Mih hoyleinaw keiccuze mih hiinnaw kha tynsakuh kho khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Minmin nynh saki kha tu hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">atyn-are kha a paccyn hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama humhung mah</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawtuknaw kalan cceih khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize ka thinrianaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e zapi balyn tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">phang a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Atolang khe thaloi a um,</para>
  <para style="q2">alungkhu khe shethya te</para>
  <para style="q1">ccakannaw a um;</para>
  <para style="q2">ramkaw kya a umpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">thaloi te a chih,</para>
  <para style="q2">khuapi kya a umpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccakan te shethya nynh a chia.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A hiinhy hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a lue hae lanze, accya kya umpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">vahu hawte mua vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">muih athua cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih balyn mawte</para>
  <para style="q2">mih hoyleinaw keiccu</para>
  <para style="q2">a rah a khui cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mih kuih tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a thawzyabung cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih ccukharu balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">tui lang a tang cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Minmin nynh buriboei kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a zingkuh cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">rinaw nynh minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a bong cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Mih balyn mawte mih maethah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lu a okuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mih ngunphua kha</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi lang a vua cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih sui tuh athupaw lang ria athua cih.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a thinria nin kya tuh mih ngunphua te mih sui nynh minmin kha khum kho khyh hae. Tuh-e te mih vueso lan khyh zah, byn lan khyh hae. Pawccecize tuh-e tuh mih hoyleinaw kyate yn thuapaw thykupawkunaw nynh thua. <verse number="20" style="v" />Apuithyapaw mih ccaankunawpaw khate lysakuh hae zah, anungsikuhpaw mih zohtuh hae, luathua-ae-ui umpaw mih uccaw hae kha a raeku hae; tukeiccuze tuh-e tuh minmin hanlan athupaw uccaw lang ka rae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh ramccang hae kalan te</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi vaw e ccungccaw hoylei hae kalan khe</para>
  <para style="q1">luadepaw uccaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ap cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin nynh a thusah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Minmin kyate ka mae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ccanglang ka hawitaw cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">tetuh aphutepaw ka hmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a thusah cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">puathonaw tuh tuh-e hmin</para>
  <para style="q2">lungkhu lang a tee cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh tuh-e hmin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a thusah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sivawrui bawtary kha raetua!</para>
  <para style="q2">Pawccecize ram tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw chiapaw seinaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">phe abeih; khuapi tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuaasahkunaw te phe abeih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mih inn hae kha lawpya khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">athah huaccepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae kha kae thuasah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Athungpaw ccungccaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">lysakunaw kha ka thangsah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih hminthyaa hae kha thusah</para>
  <para style="q2">athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lungriathaenaw he yn thua te,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin nynh daenaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccung cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama muih lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ronaw kha ccangkheit koute</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangkheit,</para>
  <para style="q1">laanbya kha ccangkheit koute</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangkheit yn langkuh cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">profeh kyate vizin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccung cih hae; ranpibawi kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">ccangpyanaw tuh um vae lan khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">piccan hae kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">tuanaw pyanaw mah um vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Siapharan tuh a rah a khui cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">bawi tuh lungrote a um cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ram lungkhu e</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae kuih tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">athyngkuh cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Mih cyisahnaw thyhte</para>
  <para style="q2">mih tungvaw ka cyih cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh bya a pia hae thyhte</para>
  <para style="q2">mimaw kha bya ka pia cih hae.</para>
  <para style="m">Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha minmin nynh a nyh cih hae, a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beikinn lungkhu Nungsikunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum taruhnaw kum, sawpaw sah taruhnaw, nin pangaw nin khe ka inn kya ka haung zah, Judah piccan hae tuh ka malang a haung lya hae khe, Bawipaw PACHIA kuih tuh ka tungvaw yn thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngawran ka do zah, ccungccaw muinsan te alokuhpaw kha ka muih; atae te alokuhpaw alia lang tuh maee hawte langkuh zah, atae te palung lang tuh phaephae akpaw sohin te nynh aloku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:27">Eze 1.27</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Kuih alopaw kha yn dyng zah ka sangtung khate yn kyng; te muisaw nynh kae kha laephi te vaawlui laku lang yn hangthung zah, Jerusalem khua, voidu lungkhu e thahlang a hawipaw teenaw sakoih kalan khe Pachia vizin khate yn cciakhae, tuin kyakhe thinriasahpaw zohtuh a haungnaw um zah, tuh-e zohtuh nynh amaw kha a thinriasah. <verse number="4" style="v" />Accya kya ka muih boi paw vizin hawte, Israel Pachia a phu-enaw tuh tuin kya a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:28">Eze 1.28</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tetuh Pachia nynh kae kha, “Pou ccungccapaw, atu palung lang dothung tua,” yn cipya. Tukeiccuze palung lang ka dothung zah, silawhang sakoih palung lang, teenaw kyakhe thinriasahpaw tuh-e zohtuh tuh a um. <verse number="6" style="v" />Aning nynh kae kha, “Ccungccapaw, ka beikinnthyaa kyate kae kha ccaring dee khylan, minmin nynh a cyi hae paw, Israel phin nynh a cyipaw myarya anungsikuhpaw kha na muih tou? E laeze anungsikuh huapaw kha na muih ung cih,” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Te aning nynh voidu teenaw kalan khe yn cciakhae; ka do zah pang kya a ua ccangkheit ka muih. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tetuh aning nynh kae kha, “Ccungccapaw, pang kha poh ua lan vitua,” yn cipya; te pang kha ka vih zah teenaw ccangkheit a um. <verse number="9" style="v" />Aning nynh kae kha, “Tee lah, khuin kya minmin nynh a cyi hae paw anungsikuhpaw kha dotua,” yn cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka tee zah ka dotua; tuin kyakhe avawpaw sarangpaw phuinccing, anungsikuhpaw sarangpaw hae te Israel phin kya-e zohtuh balyn kha pang kya po voilu lan a soi hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuh-e hae malang khe Israel phin piccan sung sari tuh Shafan ccapaw Jaazaniah ryte a thadyn hae. Minmin nynh pakephepaw zung kheit cci kha ccarou ccyngkuh hae zah, tuh-e pakephepaw lungkhu te mynkhuhpaw maeekhuh tuh akhuhthung. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te aning nynh kae kha, “Ccungccapaw, Israel phin piccan hae lu kheit cci nynh amohnaw kya, mih zohtuh khaan raveih kya a cyi hae paw kha na muih vae tou? Minmin nynh, ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh oun muih khyh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ram hynh phe a vua vae,’ a ci hae,” cite yn hopya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Te aning nynh kae kha, “Minmin nynh e laeze anungsikuh huapaw a cyi hae paw kha na muih ung cih,” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Te aning nynh kae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn thahlang sakoih teenaw kalan khe yn cciakhae; tuin kyakhe nopi hae tuh khozinung Tammuz<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tammuz a ci hae paw mih pachia tuh thingku-ruaku hae he a chih te chihbua zah, khuavae kya bua a hiin cite a zyn hae. A chi vae ze nopi hae nynh leih a rawhui hae.</char></note> hanlan rawkhuite a haung hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te aning nynh kae kha, “Pou ccungccapaw, e hynh na muih vae tou? E hae laeze anungsikuh huapaw kha na muih ung cih,” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Te aning nynh kae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn voidu lungkhu langkhe yn teekhae; tuin kyaze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn thuakaw kya, inn atolang te beikhang laku khe, ccungccaw lu kuin lae pangaw loukaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn kha mih nulang sangsahte, nithua lang hawi hae zah, nithua lang e khuanin kha bakhungnuate a beik hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te aning nynh kae kha, “Pou ccungccapaw, e hynh na muih vae tou? E kya Judah phin nynh a cyipaw anungsikuhpaw hynh huatawpaw thua khyh khaw? Ka thin houh riasahte ram hynh puathonaw te a biasah hahe cih hae tou? Thingkaran kha mih naduh kin khe a nungdeku hae! <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukeiccuze thinriate ka cyih cih; minmin kha ka haang lan khyh hae, ngaethya ka ungsah lan khyh hae; ka thaenaw khe myarya ccae lante a sia hae zemah ka ngaepah lan khyh hae,” yn cipya.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zohtuh Beik hae paw Chianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te aning nynh ka thaenaw khe roi accae lante sia zah, “Khuapi kya-e ccungccaw theihtu hae nanning, chianawpaw nae zunghe kha ccarou ccyngkute oun naeku tua oh,” a ci. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te ccungccaw lu taruh tuh chianawpaw zunghe kha ccarou ccyngkute thahlang a hawipaw, thahlang koikua kalan te oun thua hae; minmin laku e lu kheit tuh laphan laaw te kuakuhpaw boeining kha lawkuh zah a tae kyakhe ccatui bawng kha a keku. Minmin tuh tee hae zah, sohin silawhang pe khe a thadyn hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel Pachia phu-enaw tuh a la umnaw cherubim vawlan te Beikinn thuakaw kalan khe a kaethung. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh laaw te kuakuhpaw boeining a lawkuhpaw pisepaw, a tae kya ccatui bawng a kekuhpaw kha ko zah, <verse number="4" style="v" />“Jerusalem khuapi lungkhu lang la cceih lah, khuapi lungkhu e nungsikunaw balyn keiccuze a rah a khui hae paw mih terui kyakhe syntawnaw kha la raetua,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:3">Bya 7.3</ref>, <ref loc="REV 9:4">9.4</ref>, <ref loc="REV 14:1">14.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Mingccang hae kha ka thaenaw khe hopah hae zah, “Khuapi lungkhu khe amaw kha zui oh lah, ccungccaw theih oh; haang nan oh lah, ngaethyaumsah nan oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Atawpaw, liaccaw te ccangvae, imua taraw hae te nopi hae kha theih oh, thuasalama syntawnaw rae athua hae paw kha tuh ty nan oh. Ka beikinnthyaa kyate thoty oh,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze minmin nynh beikinn malang um hae paw piccan hae kyakhate a thoty hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Te aning nynh minmin kha, “Beikinn kha thusah oh lah, michi rhua khate voidu kha phe biasah oh. Te poutaw oh!” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze minmin nynh pou hae zah, khuapi lungkhu khe ccungccaw hae kha a chia hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />A chia cciamang lya hae khe kae tuh ka makhaete ka um, ka mae ka sahbung zah, “Pou Bawipaw PACHIA, Jerusalem tungvaw na thinrianaw kha na bu thyhte, a laehypaw Israel balyn kha na roh cih hae tou?” cite ka sia. <verse number="9" style="v" />Aning nynh kae kha, “Israel te Judah phin hae seinaw tuh myaryamaw ale; ram tuh chiise luanaw te phe beih zah, khuapi tuh dingleinaw te phe abeih; minmin nynh, ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh e ram hynh phe vua vae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh muih vae khyh,’ a ci hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Kae nynh minmin kha ka haang lan khyh hae, ngaethya mah ka umsah lan khyh hae, mih cyisahnaw kha mih lu vawlan ka ccawsah cih,” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Te laphan laaw te kuakuhpaw boeining a lawkuhpaw pisepaw, a tae kya ccatui bawng a kekuhpaw nynh, “Kaw nae pya thyhte phe ka cyi vae,” cite bya a leih.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia Phu-enaw nynh Jerusalem A Cciataw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te ka do zah, cherubim lu vawlan adawkuhpaw vawlan khe nilar lung te lokuh zah bawitungkhung te alokuhpaw kha ka muih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:26">Eze 1.26</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:2">Bya 4.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Pachia nynh boei akuakuhpaw a lawkuhpaw pisepaw kha, “Cherubim hae zakaw umpaw leccu hae laku langkhe cciatua; cherubim hae laku umpaw maee-e kha na kuih te lah lah, khuapi vawlan khe heitua,” a cipya. Te ka muihnaw mawkhe aning tuh a cceih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:5">Bya 8.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuh-e pisepaw nynh a tee lyakhe cherubim hae tuh beikinn te alia langkhe a thadyn hae; voidu lungkhu tuh maeking nynh pong a zithin. <verse number="4" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phu-enaw tuh cherubim hae kyate beikinn thuakaw kalan khe a nuekuh thung; beikinn tuh maeking te phe beih zah, voidu tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phu-enaw phaephae akpaw te phe abeih. <verse number="5" style="v" />Alesaepaw Pachia nynh bya a hopaw roi hawte, cherubim hae mih sake roi tuh voidu atolang te heize thae kho athua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh akuakuhpaw boeining a lawkuhpaw pisepaw kha, “Cherubim hae laku kya-e leccu hae lungkhu umpaw maee kha lawtua,” cite kaw he a pya te, tuh-e paw nynh tee zah leccu pe khe a thadyn. <verse number="7" style="v" />Te cherubim hae laku kya-e cherub ccangkheit nynh mih laku umpaw maee kalan khe a kuih kha dyng zah, maee beihtaraw kha a lah koute akuakuhpaw boeining a lawkuhpaw pisepaw kuih kya a nung, te tuh-e paw nynh maee tuh lah zah a poukhae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Cherubim hae sake kaw khe ccungccaw kuih alopaw kha yn langkuh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka do zah, cherub ccangkheit pe khe leccu ccangkheit ccite, cherubim hae pe khe leccu ccangpali a um; leccu hae muinsan tuh aphutepaw lung phaephae akpaw te nynh aloku hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Leccu ccangpali tuh mih muinsan lokuh zah, leccu ccangkheit lungkhu khe ccangpaw leccu ccangkheit bingpaw te nynh aloku hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.9-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:15-21">Eze 1.15-21</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Cherubim hae tuh he a ccia hae ze, ccanglang maeku leite san kheit lang a cceihthya hae; ccangpaw leccu hae nynh mah ccanglang maeku leite malang sangpaw leccu nynh a hawinaw langkhe a zui hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Mih pyn tuh abalyn mawte, mih ke, mih kuih, mih sake, te leccu hae ccangpali mawte mit te phe abeih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Leccu hae tuh, “Amiakuhpaw leccu hae” cite ka thaenaw khe a ho hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Cherub ccangkheit nynh mae maepali cci a hoi hae: ccangkheitnaw mae tuh cherub maesue, ccangningnaw tuh ccungccaw maesue, ccangthumnaw tuh chindeih maesue, ccangpalinaw tuh mosipi maesue nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:10">Eze 1.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:7">Bya 4.7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cherubim hae tuh a thokuh hae. E hae tuh Khebar vawpi pe ka muih hae paw ahiinpaw ahysuepaw hae nynh athua hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Cherubim hae tuh he a ccia hae ze, mih pe khe leccu hae tuh a cceihbua hae; cherubim hae nynh laephi kyate hangku khylan mih sake kha he a daw hae ze, mih pe umpaw leccu hae tuh ccanglang maekuh khyh hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Cherubim hae tuh a thadyn hae ze, leccu hae mah thadynbua hae zah, a thoku hae ze leccu hae mah a thokuh bua hae; pawccecize ahiinpaw ahysuepaw hae muisaw tuh leccu hae kya a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phu-enaw tuh beikinn thuakaw kyate pou zah cherubim hae vawlan khe a thadyn. <verse number="19" style="v" />Cherubim hae nynh mih sake hae kha daw hae zah ka muihnaw khe laephi kyate a thokuh hae, mih pe umpaw leccu hae ryte a pou hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn nithua lang e koikua kyakhe a thadyn hae; te Israel Pachia phu-enaw tuh mih vawlan khe a um. <verse number="20" style="v" />E hae tuh Khebar vawpi pe, Israel Pachia zakaw kya ka muih hae paw ahiinpaw ahysuepaw nynh thua hae; te e hae tuh cherubim hae nynh athua hae cipaw ka ny. <verse number="21" style="v" />E hae ccangkheit cci nynh mae maepali, sake kepali cci hoi hae zah, mih sake kaw khe ccungccaw kuih te alokuhpaw a um. <verse number="22" style="v" />Mih maesue tuh Khebar vawpi pe ka muih hae paw maesue hae te nynh aloku hae. Mih balynte malang khe lawbabin lan a cceih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ahoy leipaw Tuanaw Pyatu hae Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Muisaw nynh kae kha yn hangthung zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn nithua lang e sakoih, nithua lang a hawipaw kalan khe yn cciakhae. Thuakaw teenaw kyakhe ccungccaw lu kuin lae pangaw a um hae; tuh-e hae kyakhe bawi alepaw hae, Azzur ccapaw Jaazaniah te Benaiah ccapaw Pelatiah kha ka muih hae. <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, “Ccungccapaw, e hae tuh hoyleinaw kha paccyn hae zah, e khuapi kya a hoyleipaw tuanaw kha a pyatu hae nynh thua hae; <verse number="3" style="v" />minmin nynh, ‘Inn saknaw accyh nae loh khyh; e khuapi tuh ang thua zah aening tuh saw nynh ah thua oh,’ a ci hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin kha rawsete profehbya hotua; pou ccungccapaw, profehbya hotua,” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muisaw tuh ka tungvaw yn thua zah hynhte yn hopya, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a hopaw hynh hopah hae: Pou Israel phin hae, e hynh nae tuakunaw thua zah, nae lungkhu kya yn thungkuhpaw miakaw kha phe ka ny. <verse number="6" style="v" />Nanning nynh e khuapi kya ccungccaw patae kha na theih oh zah, michi rhua te laanpi hae kha phe na biasah vae oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Khuapi lungkhu na nung oh paw michi rhua hae tuh saw thua hae zah, e khuapi tuh ang nynh thua; thuasalama nanning tuh khuapi kyate kae pousah cih oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Nanning nynh thaloi rhaw kha na ri oh; tuh-e thaloi tuh nae tungvaw ka thuasah cih, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. <verse number="9" style="v" />Nanning kha khuapi kyate kae pousah cih oh zah ramccang hae kuih kalan kae ap cih oh, te bya kae pia cih oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Nanning tuh thaloi te na chih cih oh; Israel ramri khe bya kae pia cih oh. Te nanning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha nae nyh cih oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />E khuapi tuh nae ang thua lan khyh zah, nanning tuh ang lungkhu e saw na thua lan khyh oh. Israel ramri khe bya kae pia cih oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tetuh minphuin ccangpaw hae phungzae kha na zui oh zah, a phungbya na zuipya lei oh paw te a phungzae kha mah na zuipya lei oh paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha nae nyh cih oh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Profehbya ka ho cciamang lyakhe, Benaiah ccapaw Pelatiah tuh a chih. Tetuh ka mae ka bakhung zah, “Pou Bawipaw PACHIA, a laehypaw Israel hae hynh phe na thangsah ccaccing vae cih hae tou?” cite thawte ka sia.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia nynh Israel A Kikhae Cih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="15" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, na puizia hae, na vaeccaw hae, kyng hae zah ramccang lang a cciakhae hae paw na uno hae, Israel phin balyn kha, Jerusalem a um hae paw nynh, “Minmin tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate asawnaw lang a cceih vae hae; e ram hynh aening ram lang oun pya vae,” cite a ho hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze hynhte hopah hae: Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Minmin kha minphuin ccangpaw hae kalan ccaring ka nuesakuh hae zah, ram hae kyakhe phiariphiarae ka nung hae zemah, minmin a thuanaw hae ram hae kyakhe kae tuh minmin elang ccyh sosoh hanlan beikinnthyaa nynh ka thua. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze hopah hae: Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Minphuin hae kyate nanning kha kae suelua cih oh zah, phiariphiarae na umnaw oh ram hae kyate kae pum cih oh, te Israel ram kha kae pya cih oh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Minmin nynh tuin ram kya he a thua hae te, tuin ram umpaw athupaw uccaw balyn te a nungsikunaw balyn kha a vua cih hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Minmin kha thinlung ccangkheit hoinaw kha ka pya cih hae zah, mih lungkhu kya tuanaw thawpaw kha ka sang cih hae; mih pyn kyate lung thinlung kha ka vuapah cih hae zah, ngesaw thinlung kha ka pya cih hae,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.19-20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:26-28">Eze 36.26-28</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />tuhteze nynh ka phungbya hae kha a zui cih hae zah ka phungzae hae kha kyngkute a zui cih hae. Tetuh minmin tuh ka ccungccaw hae athua cih hae zah, kae tuh mih Pachia ka thua cih. <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuasalama mih thinlung tuh athupaw mih uccaw hae te mih nungsikunaw nulang a zuikuh hae paw hanlan tuh mih cyisahnaw kha mih lu vawlan ka thuasah cih, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tetuh cherubim hae nynh mih sake kha daw hae zah, mih pe e leccu hae mah a zuikuh bua hae; Israel Pachia phu-enaw tuh tuh-e hae vawlan khe a um;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.22-23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 43:2-5">Eze 43.2-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phu-enaw tuh khuapi ngaelung kyate hangkuh thung zah, khuapi nithua lang umpaw mua vawlan khe a thadyn. <verse number="24" style="v" />Pachia muisaw liate a kyng hae paw a umnaw hae, Khaldi ram langkhe kae kha muisaw nynh vizin kyakhe yn hangthung zah yn cciakhae. Tukoute ka muihpaw vizin nynh kae kha yn cciataw. <verse number="25" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn muihsahpaw balyn kha a kyng hae paw ccungccaw hae kya ka hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Judah Kyngnaw Muihsahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, nang tuh rhawdou a mangpaw ciihan laku kya nynh na um, minmin tuh muihnawpaw mit a hoi hae zemah a muih lei hae paw, thaenawpaw nakaring a hoi hae zemah a thae lei hae paw nynh thua hae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa 6.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:21">Jer 5.21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:18">Mar 8.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />pawccecize minmin tuh rhawdou a mangpaw ciihan nynh thua hae. Tukeiccuze, ccungccapaw, ram kyate a dee hae paw kya-e uccaw paccynku hawte paccynkuh lah, minmin nynh a muihnaw hae khuadae ccyh khe ram kyate a dee hae paw hawte cciatua; kyng athuapaw ccungccaw hawte a muihnaw hae khe na umnaw hmin kyate ccangpaw hmin kalan na cceih cih. Minmin tuh dou a mangpaw ciihan athua hae zemah poh a thaethya kho hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuadae ccyh a muihnaw hae khe, a kyng hae paw nynh a phuku hae hawte, khuadae ccyh a muihnaw hae khe na phupaw kha lawku tua; te zete ccyh a muihnaw hae khe, a kyng hae paw hawte na pou cih. <verse number="5" style="v" />A muihnaw hae khe pang kha poh ua lan vih lah, tuin kyate na phupaw kha poukhae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Riryngmoh khe a muihnaw hae kyakhe phupaw kha na raw vawlan na khangkuh cih zah, na poukhae cih; laephi kha na muih khyh nawlan na mae kha na bongkuh cih; pawccecize Israel hae hanlan nang kha muihsahnaw lang kae rae vae, yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kaw yn pya thyhte ka cyi. A kyng hae paw kya-e phupaw hawte, ka phupaw kha khuadae khe ka paccynku, zetesang khe pang kha ka kuih te po ua lan ka vi; mih muihnaw khe phupaw kha ka raw vawlan khangkute riryngmoh khe ka poukhae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Awkhualan awkhua khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="9" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, rhawdou a mangpaw Israel ciihan nynh nang kha, “Pawmou na cyi?” cite ae khia khyh hae tou? a ci. <verse number="10" style="v" />Minmin kha hynhte hopah hae, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: E hodaepaw bya tuh Jerusalem umpaw uktu bawi te tuin kya umpaw Israel phin balyn hanlan nynh thua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Kae tuh nanning hanlan muihsahnaw nynh ka thua: Ka cyi hawte, minmin kha cyi athua cih hae; minmin tuh kyng athua cih hae zah, a kyng hae paw umnaw kalan a cceih cih hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Minmin kya a umpaw uktu bawi tuh riryngmoh khe a phupaw kha a raw vawlan a khangkuh cih zah, a toikuh cih; pang kha a vikuh cih zah a poukhae cih; a mit te laephi kha a muih khyh ccaw cite, a mae kha a bongkuh cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Aning kha ka miabu te ka bong cih zah, ka kaang kya a kae cih; Khaldi hae ram, Babilon khuapi kalan ka cciakhae cih, tuh-e khuapi kya a chi zemah tuh-e khuapi tuh muih lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:7">2Si 25.7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:11">Jer 52.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaw a umlu hae paw balyn, amaw a bawmtu hae te a rhawkaw hae balyn kha teitei lang balyn pong ka phia cih hae; mih nulang te thaloi khate ka zui cih hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Minmin kha minphuin ccangpaw hae laku te ram hae kalan phiariphiarae he ka nung hae te, minmin nynh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha yn nyh cih hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin kya-e beihtaraw kha tuh thaloi kyate thuasah, ccakannaw te shethya kyate thuasah ka luesah cih hae, tuhteze nynh minmin nynh a thuanaw hae minphuin ccangpaw hae kyakhe mih nungsikunaw balyn kha a ho cih hae; tetuh minmin nynh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Byapianaw Ccyh Nue Leinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="18" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, na looh kha thyngkute ae lah, na tui kha thyngku ri biate niatua; <verse number="19" style="v" />te ramccungccaw hae kha hynhte hopah hae, Israel ram e Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae te asekuhte Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Minmin nynh mih looh kha rikawte a ae cih hae zah, mih tui kha lungrote a neih cih hae, pawccecize tuin kya um hae paw balyn kya-e puathonaw keiccuze mih ram lungkhu umpaw balyn tuh azo cih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ccungccaw a la umnaw khuapi hae tuh aroh cih zah, ram tuh ccungccaw kharouh adae cih; tetuh nanning nynh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih oh. <verse number="21" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="22" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, “Accyh tuh dyadya alia vae, vizin miakaw tuh accakaepaw lang nynh a tang,” cite Israel ram konglang na hopaw e phungtangbya hynh pawtemou athua? <verse number="23" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin kyakhe, “Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: E phungtangbya hynh ka thangsah vae cih zah, Israel ram kya phungtangbya lang mang vae lan khyh hae. Thuasalama accyh anae vae, vizin miakaw tuh accing cih,” cite hopah hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel phin kya akyh leipaw vizin um vae lan khyh, akyh leipaw profehbya mah um vae lan khyh. <verse number="25" style="v" />Thuasalama kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka ho lanpaw bya kha ka ho cih zah, tuh-e bya tuh accing cih. Tuh-e bya tuh a thysung vae lan khyh. Pou rhawdou a mangpaw phin, nae she kya bya ka ho cih zah ka ccingsah cih, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ho. <verse number="26" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="27" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Israel phin hae nynh, “Aning nynh a muihpaw vizin tuh malang kum patae hanlan nynh thua; ccyh hynhsepi hanlan nynh profehbya a ho,” a ci hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin kha hopah hae, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Ka bya tuh accyh nue vae lan khyh, ka hopaw bya tuh accing cih, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Lingthya Profeh hae Seisahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, profehbya ho hae paw Israel profeh hae kha rawsete profehbya hotua; mimaw tuanaw te profehbya ho hae paw kyakhe, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh thaetua oh!” cite hopah hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Paw sanmah muih leite, mimaw tuanaw thyhte a ho hae paw, tuanaw hoi leipaw profeh hae hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! <verse number="4" style="v" />Pou Israel, na profeh hae tuh arohpaw apumkuhpaw laku kya a umpaw suizaw hae hawte nynh athua hae. <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nin, rhawtuknaw kya Israel tuh tynkaring lan a thadyn kho nawlan, minmin nynh khualungrua aronaw kalan kae khyh hae, Israel hae hanlan khualungrua kha raethui khyh hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Minmin nynh hynbya te lingkunawpaw vizin kha a muih hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha a saw lei hae pite, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho,” a ci hae, tuhzemah mih bya accing lanpaw kha a ngaw hae! <verse number="7" style="v" />Kae nynh ka ho lei pite, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho,” cite ahme leipaw vizin, lingthya profehbya a ho hae paw kha na thae khyh oh tou?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw tuh: Nanning nynh hynbya na ho oh zah lingkunawpaw vizin kha na muih oh keiccuze nanning kha kae rawse cih oh, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahme leipaw vizin muih hae zah lingkunawpaw bya a ho hae paw profeh hae kha ka kuih nynh a rawse cih hae; minmin tuh ka ccungccaw hae tungkunaw kya umbua lan khyh hae, Israel hae ccazing kya zeibua thua lan khyh hae, Israel ram lungkhu lang tee lan khyh hae; nanning nynh kae tuh Bawipaw PACHIA ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize, thanccingte, minmin nynh ka ccungccaw hae kha cciakhaesei hae zah, daenaw a um lei pite, “Daenaw,” cite a ho hae keiccu nynh thua, te ccungccaw hae nynh lungrua kha a rua hae ze, e profeh hae nynh lungrua kha arawpaw sii a thuhthin hae keiccu nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:14">Jer 6.14</ref>, <ref loc="JER 8:11">8.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Lungrua tuh a ting cih, cite lungrua kya arawpaw sii thuh hae paw kha hopah hae. Khuaa thawte arah cih, hya lepaw accah cih zah khise atho cih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Lungrua tuh he a ting te, “Lungrua kya na thuhpaw arawpaw sii kha teimou a um vae?” cite nanning kha ae khia lan khyh oh tou? <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Ka bungpaw keiccuze khise ka thosah cih, ka thinria keiccuze khuaa thawte arah cih zah, hya nynh tuh-e lungrua tuh aroh cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Nanning nynh arawpaw sii na thuh oh paw lungrua kha laekhu kyacia ka ting cih; tuhteze nynh athonaw aleihpaw tuh azo cih; lungrua tuh he a ting te, nanning mah lungrua kyakhe na rohbua cih oh; te nanning nynh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih oh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuhcite tuh-e lungrua kya te arawpaw sii a thuh hae paw tungvaw khe ka thinrianaw kha ka mang cih; lungrua tuh um vae khyh, lungrua sii a thuhtu hae— <verse number="16" style="v" />daenaw a um lei pite Jerusalem hanlan daenaw vizin muih hae zah Jerusalem konglang profehbya a hotu hae Israel profeh hae mah um vae khyh hae cipaw kha nanning kya kae hopah cih oh, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, mimaw tuanaw thyhte profehbya a ho hae paw na ccungccaw hae kya-e nopi hae kha rawsete na mae hawiliatua hae; minmin kha profehbya honua hae lah, <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Ccungccaw hiinnaw kha kyng khylan ccungccaw miakaw kuihnyng kya khiikupaw kha huipah hae zah, lu miakaw hanlan lu bongkupaw boei taraw kha a raepah hae paw nopi hae hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! Ka ccungccaw hae laku kya hiinnaw kha kyngdete nae hiinnaw kha na khynsakuh cih oh tou? <verse number="19" style="v" />Barli phaw kuihphe kheit te sanlou beihtaraw hanlan ka ccungccaw hae laku kya the nae thyasah vae oh, hynbya a ngae hae paw ka ccungccaw hae kya hynbya hopyanaw liate, chi lan accan leipaw kha na theih oh zah, hiin lan accan leipaw kha na hiin oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Ccungccaw hiinnaw na kyngdenaw oh paw kuih kya khiikupaw kha ka hua; khah-e kha nae kuih kyate thoh ka pae cih zah, pavaw bite na bi oh paw ccungccaw hae hiinnaw kha ka luesah cih. <verse number="21" style="v" />Nae kya-e bongkupaw boei taraw kha ka seii cih zah, nae kuih kyate ka ccungccaw hae kha ka khum cih hae; minmin tuh nae kuih kya umpaw saw thua vae lan khyh hae; tetuh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih oh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Miding hae kha rawthyanaw ka pya lei hae pite, mih raw na thyasah oh keiccu thuasah, ccungccaw hoylei hae paw kha ahoy leipaw mih laanpi kyate a maeleihku khyh nawlan hae thawzung na pya oh zah mih hiinnaw kha na khum oh keiccu thuasah, <verse number="23" style="v" />nanning nynh ahme leipaw vizin kha na muih vae lan khyh oh zah, profehbya kha na ho vae lan khyh oh; ka ccungccaw hae kha nae kuih kyate ka khum cih hae. Tetuh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih oh.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia Byapianaw Ahme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel piccan abang tuh ka kya oun thua hae zah ka malang a haung hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="3" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, e ccungccaw hae nynh mih zohtuh hae kha mih thinlung kya lawkuh hae zah, mih hoyleinaw kha mih malang khe thykunawpaw lang a nungkhaw hae; kae tuh minmin nynh tuanaw ngiakupaw lang ka tang cih tou? <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin kha hopah hae, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Mih zohtuh hae kha mih thinlung kya lawkuh hae zah mih hoyleinaw kha mih malang khe thykunawpaw lang a nungkhaw hae paw Israel hae miakaw nynh profeh kalan oun cciakhae hae; mih zohtuh patae ryte oun cceih hae paw kha kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh bya ka leih cih hae, <verse number="5" style="v" />tuhteze nynh mih zohtuh hae liate ka kyate asawkuh hae paw balyn, Israel hae thinlung kha ka kyng kho cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho cite minmin kha hopah hae: Ngaesikuh oh lah, nae zohtuh hae kyate maeleihkuh oh; nae nungsikunaw balyn kyakhate nae mae kha ccanglang hawi oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka kyate phiakuh hae zah, mih zohtuh hae kha mih thinlung kya lawkute, mih hoyleinaw kha mih malang khe thykunawpaw hawte nung hae salamah, ka rynaw khiatua khylan profeh kalan a cceih hae paw Israel phin miakaw kha thuasah, Israel ram a umpaw ramccang hae miakaw kha thuasah kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccaccei maw nynh minmin kha bya ka khung cih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Minmin kha rawsete ka hawilia cih hae; minmin kha muihsahnaw te byaphung lang ka rae cih hae zah, ka ccungccaw hae laku kyate ka vua cih hae; te nanning nynh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Profeh lu kheit kha hopya thua zah, tuh-e thyhte bya a ho lanze, tuh-e profeh tuh kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka hynsah vae, tuh-e paw tuh ka kuih ka dyngnua cih zah, ka ccungccaw Israel hae laku kyate ka roh cih. <verse number="10" style="v" />Minmin tuh detahnaw a teing cih hae—profeh tungvaw detahnaw te profeh kha bya a khiatupaw tungvaw detahnaw tuh alokuh cih— <verse number="11" style="v" />tuhteze nynh Israel hae tuh ka kyate ccanglang cceihsei lan khyh hae zah, mih cyiseinaw balyn khate mimaw toulou kha thusakuh vae lan khyh hae. Tetuh minmin tuh ka ccungccaw hae athua cih hae zah, kae tuh mih Pachia ka thua cih, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. <verse number="12" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="13" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, ram ramkheit nynh ka tungvaw lungzi leite um zah a sei ze, ka kuih ka dyngnua zah, looh bawmnaw kha paetawte a tungvaw khe ccakan ka ccisah, te ccungccaw hae te sarangpaw hae kha ka chia hae, <verse number="14" style="v" />Noah, Daniel te Job, e lu thum hae maw heize a la um hae ze, mih dingnaw liate mimaw hiinnaw kyalya kha a khumkuh cih hae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ram kha ro khylan loramsaw hae kha ram phe lekuh lan ka sawnua hae ze, ram kya daetedae cih. Tuh-e loramsaw hae keiccuze hum sanmah cceih kho lan khyh; <verse number="16" style="v" />kae tuh ka hiin thyhte, e lu thum hae tuh a la um hae ze heize, mih ccanung hae te mih ccapaw hae kha khum kho lan khyh hae; mimaw makhae kha khum athua cih hae zah, ram tuh ccungccaw phe adae cih, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuhkhyhze tuh-e ram tungvaw thaloi thuakhaete, “Thaloi tuh ram pynpi phe lekuh lan cceih sah,” cite ka ho zah ccungccaw hae te sarangpaw hae kha ka chia hae ze, <verse number="18" style="v" />kae tuh ka hiin thyhte, e lu thum hae tuh a la um hae ze heize, mih ccanung hae te mih ccapaw hae kha khum kho lan khyh hae, mimaw makhae kha khum athua cih hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuhkhyhze ccungccaw hae te sarangpaw hae kha chia khylan, tuh-e ram kya shethya ka thuasah zah, ka thinrianaw tuh tuh-e ram kya chiise te ka bu lanze, <verse number="20" style="v" />Noah, Daniel te Job tuh a la um hae ze heize, kae tuh ka hiin thyhte, mih ccanung hae te mih ccapaw hae kha khum kho lan khyh hae; mih dingnaw liate mimaw hiinnaw rou kha nynh a khumkuh kho cih hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Pawccecize Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Jerusalem kyate ccungccaw hae te sarangpaw hae kha chia khylan chinawpaw ka detahnaw phuin pali, thaloi, ccakannaw, loramsaw hae te shethya kha Jerusalem tungvaw he ka thuasah te, hohcihmou luenaw houh aruhua cih!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:8">Bya 6.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuhzemah, poukhae athua cih hae paw ccanung ccapaw ahiinhy hae paw kha tuin kya a um cih hae; minmin tuh na kalan oun thua cih hae. Mih ozia te mih cyisahnaw kha he na muih hae te, Jerusalem tungvaw ka thuakhaepaw hoyleinaw balyn hanlan kha lungdaenaw pya na thua cih. <verse number="23" style="v" />Mih ozia te mih cyisahnaw kha he na muih hae te, minmin nynh nang kha lungdaenaw ae pya cih hae; Jerusalem tungvaw ka la cyipaw balyn tuh akonglang um leite ka cyi khyhpaw kha na nyh cih, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ccungkia leipaw Misu ku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pou ccungccapaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">misu ku tuh ccangpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">thingku hae laeze pawmou</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyhua zah, misu karan tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">ramkaw e thingku hae laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">pawmou ahoyhua?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hankhakheit rae nawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">misu ku kha law athua zawtou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Uccaw hankhakheit</para>
  <para style="q2">bawnawpaw lang misu ku kha</para>
  <para style="q2">rae kho athua zawtou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maeething lang maee kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">phung athua; adung san ning kha</para>
  <para style="q1">maee nynh karae u zah</para>
  <para style="q2">angaelung tuh phe man lan a u vae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawlang sang ccungkia ung cih tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maee nynh a u mawze</para>
  <para style="q2">pawpaw lang mah ccungkia khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">maee nynh phe ccung lan</para>
  <para style="q2">u zah phe aman vae te thytuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungkianaw houh zyahua vae cih—</para>
  <para style="q2">pawlang sang mang kho a um ung cih tou!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Maeetua nawlan ka pya vae hae paw ramkaw e thingku hae laku umpaw misu ku hawte, Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae kha ka ap cih hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin kha rawsete ka hawilia cih hae; maee kyate a lue hae zemah, maee nynh minmin kha a u mamin cih hae; minmin kha rawsete he ka hawilia hae te, nanning nynh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te minmin tuh mih lungzi khyh keiccuze ram kha ccungccaw phe ka daesah cih, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">A Lungzi leipaw Akaenung Liaccanung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Jerusalem kha a nungsikunaw nysakuh lah, <verse number="3" style="v" />hynhte hopya tua, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh Jerusalem kha hynhte a hopya: Na thokeinaw te na puinaw tuh Kanaan ram nynh thua; na paaw tuh Amor paw thua zah na nung tuh Hit nung nynh thua. <verse number="4" style="v" />Na puinaw konglangte, na pui nin ze na laerui ae aw khyh hae, tuisingte ae ccikan khyh hae, loi ae noi khyh hae, nolung boei te mah ae lung khyh hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Na tungvaw thawccinaw hoite, e hae ccangkheit san cyipya lan ngaethya ae umsahpaw um khyh; na pui nin khe nang kha ae hua hae zah ramkaw kya ae vua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na pe ka cceih zah, na chiise te na kalouhkupaw kha kae muih. Na chiise kya na touku lyakhe nang kha, “Hiintua! <verse number="7" style="v" />Loolae kya umpaw thingku hawte lethungtua,” kae cipya. Na lethung, na hang vae zah phe na liaccaw vae; na matei yn doh zah na sang yn sae vae; tuhzemah boeining leite na ccakaete nynh na um. <verse number="8" style="v" />Na pe bua ka cceih zah kae dotua; nang tuh vawpaw hoi phe na zaw vae. Ka angkiccua adung kha kae dawpah zah, na ccakaete na umpaw kha kae bongpya: Nang kae hawnawpaw byakinnaw kha namaw ryte ka rae zah, nang tuh ka kya-e lang na tang vae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tetuh nang kha tui te kae sing, na chii kha pong kae ccikanpah zah, chitui kae thuh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ccaanpaw boeining kha kae lawsakuh zah, saving phanah kha kae nawsaku; nebaleihpaw laaw te kuapaw boei kha kae zingsakuh zah, po-laaw te kuapaw boeining kha kae zingsah. <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang kha ccaannawpaw uccaw hae te kae ccaan: Na kuih kya khawccan kae nawsah zah na nging kya si kae oisah, <verse number="12" style="v" />na naduh kya naduhhuing kae huingsah, na nakua kya nakuahuing kae huingsah zah, na lu vawlan apuithyapaw bawilukhung kae khungsah. <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang kha sui te ngun te ccaan na thua zah, na boeining tuh nebaleihpaw laaw te kuapaw boeining te po-laaw te kuapaw boeining te ccaanpaw boeining nynh thua. Na looh tuh vaekhui, khoitui te chitui nynh thua. Myarya na puithya zah siapharannung lang na tang. <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang kae pyapaw ka lesaenaw keiccuze na puithyanaw tuh ccing zah, na puithyanaw minthaannaw tuh minphuin hae laku kya a pazaekuh, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama na puithyanaw kha na doliakuh zah na minthaan keiccuze na ohhuakuh, khuaccong hae paw miakaw kya na ohhuakunaw kha ruarua na ua hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Na boeining kha na lawkuh zah, na beiknaw hminthyaa kha azong aphuinphuin te na ccaan zah, tuin kyakhe na ohhuaku; e tahawpaw hynh um mah um boi khyh zah, malang mah um boi vae lan khyh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Kae pyapaw ka sui te ka ngun athuapaw na kya-e apuithyapaw lung hae kha na lah zah, pise zohtuh hae kha na raeku, te khah-e hae khate na ohhuaku; <verse number="18" style="v" />khah-e zohtuh hae kha ccaanpaw na boeining hae khate na bong zah, ka chitui te ka kya-e mynkhuhpaw kha mih malang khe na nungpya hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Kae pyapaw looh—kae dangpaw vaekhui, chitui te khoitui kha mih malang khe mynkhuhpaw silawnaw lante na nungpya hae; tuhcite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ho. <verse number="20" style="v" />Nae saahpya hae paw na ccanung hae te na ccapaw hae kha na hoei hae zah, khah-e zohtuh hae nynh ae hae sah cite si na lawnaw hae. Na ohhuakunaw tuh zaw loh khyh ii! <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka ccaaw hae kha na theih hae zah, khah-e zohtuh hae kalan khe silawnawpaw lante na pya hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Na nungsikunaw te na ohhuakunaw balyn keiccuze na zawthaw lya-e na chii kya ohkute, boeining lawku leite na ccakaete na umpaw kha na liathui vae khyh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Hoyleinaw balyn kha na rae koute (Nang na hanlan ngaethya lan kou um, ngaethya lan kou um! cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci), <verse number="24" style="v" />accawngnaw hmin miakaw khe inaw kha na raekuh zah, khualae e laanpi takyh kyakhe ahangpaw hmin kha na duaku; <verse number="25" style="v" />laanpi akounaw takyh kya ahangpaw hmin kha na raekuh zah na puithyanaw khate na ohhuaku, na pe a cceihpaw miakaw kya na pyn kha pyakute houhouh na ohhuaku. <verse number="26" style="v" />A ohhuakuh rypaw na innpaw hae, Izip hae te na ohhuakuh oh zah, ka thinriasah khylan houhouh na ohhuaku. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nang kha ka kuih kae dyngnua zah na looh kha ka zyasah bung, te na ohhuaku ry keiccuze mih maethahpaw Filistin ccanung hae, na rhaw hae rynaw kalan khe nang kha kae ap. <verse number="28" style="v" />Nang tuh a sungkuh kho leipaw na thua keiccuze Assiria hae ryte na ohhuaku oh; minmin ryte na ohhuaku oh zemah na lungryachih kho loh khyh. <verse number="29" style="v" />Kungku hae paw ram, Khaldi ram ryte ohhuakunaw houhouh na rae; e hynhte mah na lungryachih lae khyh. <verse number="30" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw tuh, maethya nyh leipaw ohhuanung cyisahnaw, e uccaw hae balyn hynh rawthungte raete, na thinlung tuh pawcih baban mou anyaa; <verse number="31" style="v" />laanpi akounaw takyh kya inaw na raekuh zah, khualae e laanpi takyh kya ahangpaw hmin kha na raeku. Tuhzemah amee pyapaw kha pawlang na ria khyh keiccuze nang tuh ohhuanung te na lokuh khyh oh. <verse number="32" style="v" />A vawpaw ccelang mingccangpaw kha lehkhanpaw, milae vawpaw te a seinung zu nynh na thua! <verse number="33" style="v" />Ohhuanung hae balyn kha amee pya athua hae; thuasalama nang tuh na sungsah hae paw kha na lasung na pya hae, na ohhuakunaw elang teitei kyate balyn na kalan yn ccia ccaw hae cite pyaruh kha na pya hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nang tuh na ohhuakunaw kya ccangpaw nopi hae te na lokuh khyh oh: humhung nynh mah nang kha ohhuaku khylan ae soih khyh; nang kha amee ae pya khyh lya hae khe, nang nynh amee na pya paleih hae; nang tuh milae te na lokuh khyh oh. <verse number="35" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, pou ohhuanung, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh thaetua: <verse number="36" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Na ohhuakuh ry zah na ccakaete umte na sungsah hae paw ryte na ohhuaku keiccu thuasah, anungsikuhpaw na zohtuh hae balyn keiccu thuasah, na zohtuh hae na pyapaw na ccaaw hae chiise keiccu thuasah, <verse number="37" style="v" />hoysahnaw na raekheih oh paw na sungsah hae paw balyn, na sungsah hae paw balyn te na hua hae paw balyn kha ka suelua cih hae; minmin kha teitei kyate balyn kae sueluanua cih hae zah mih malang khe na ccakaete kae nung cih, tetuh minmin nynh na ccakaete na umpaw kha khaleih ae muih cih hae. <verse number="38" style="v" />Milae vawpaw te a sei hae paw nopi hae te ccungccaw theihpaw nopi hae kha byapia hawte nang kha bya kae pia cih zah, eiung thinriate na tungvaw kya chiise ka thuasah cih. <verse number="39" style="v" />Minmin kuih kya kae ap cih, minmin nynh na ohhuakunaw hmin kha a roh cih hae zah, ahangpaw na hmin hae kha a roh cih hae; na boeining kha ae phae cih hae zah apuithyapaw na uccaw hae kha a lah cih hae, te na ccakaete ae cciataw cih hae. <verse number="40" style="v" />Ccungccaw patae kha ae konua cih hae zah minmin nynh lung te ae deih cih hae, mih thaloi te zoihtatyh lan ae bae cih hae. <verse number="41" style="v" />Minmin nynh na inn hae kha maee te ae soipah cih hae zah nopi hae patae muihnaw khe bya ae pia cih hae; na ohhuakunaw kha ka thangsah cih zah, amee mah na pya vae lan khyh hae. <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuhcite ka thinrianaw kha ka daesakuh cih zah, na tungvaw ka eiung vae lan khyh; lungdaete ka um cih zah, ka thinria vae lan khyh. <verse number="43" style="v" />Na zawthaw lya kha na ning vae zah, e uccaw hae balyn kya ka thin nae riasah vae keiccuze na cyisahnaw hae kha na lu vawlan kae khang cih, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">Na nungsikunaw balyn vawlan khe ohhuaku rynaw seinaw kha na raechih khyh tou? <verse number="44" style="v" />Dotua, phungtangbya a mangpaw miakaw nynh nang na kong kha, “Nung lothya alonung ccanung,” cite phungtangbya a mang cih hae. <verse number="45" style="v" />Nang tuh a vawpaw te a ccaaw hae kha a huatu na nung ccanung nynh na thua; nang tuh mih vawpaw hae te mih ccaaw hae kha a huatu na unonung hae mih unonung nynh na thua. Na nung tuh Hit nung thua zah, na paaw tuh Amor paw nynh thua. <verse number="46" style="v" />Na unung tuh a ccanung hae ryte nang te palung lang a umpaw Samaria kha nynh thua; na neitawnung tuh a ccanung hae ryte nang te alia lang umpaw Sodom kha nynh thua. <verse number="47" style="v" />Nang nynh mih hiinzia kyalya kha zui leite, mih nungsikunaw thyhte na cyibua; ccyh sosoh kya minmin laeze na hiinzia balyn tuh arohhua. <verse number="48" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh, kae tuh ka hiin thyhte, nang te na ccanung hae nynh na cyi oh hawte, Sodom te a ccanung hae nynh cyih khyh hae. <verse number="49" style="v" />E hynh na neitawnung Sodom seinaw nynh thua: aning te a ccanung hae tuh a lysakuh hae, looh phe beih lan hoi hae zah ngaengan hiinhoyte a um hae, thuasalama ryachi hae te anyaa hae paw kha bawm khyh hae. <verse number="50" style="v" />Minmin tuh lysakuh hae zah ka malang anungsikuhpaw uccaw kha a rae hae; tukeiccuze tuh-e uccaw tuh he ka muih te minmin kha ka vua hae. <verse number="51" style="v" />Samaria nynh nang na seinaw angankuh zeih seinaw rae khyh; nang nynh anungsikuh huapaw kha minmin laeze na rae vae, te na raepaw anungsikuhpaw balyn liate na unonung hae mih dingnaw kha na langsaku vae. <verse number="52" style="v" />Nang nynh thethyanaw kha ccoutua, pawccecize na unonung hae hanlan azoi huapaw byapianaw kha na thuakhaepya vae hae; minmin nynh a rae hae paw laeze anungsikuh hua lante na raepaw na seinaw hae keiccuze minmin tuh nang laeze a dinghua hae. Tukeiccuze na maethah sah lah, thethyanaw ccoutua, pawccecize na unonung hae mih dingnaw kha na langsah vae. <verse number="53" style="v" />Sodom te a ccanung hae, Samaria te a ccanung hae kha ka kikhae cih hae zah, nanning hiinnaw kha mah mih ccungccaw hae ryte bua ka hoysah cih, <verse number="54" style="v" />tetuh minmin hanlan lungtangnaw lang na tang cih, na cyipaw balyn keiccuze na thethah cih zah na maethah cih. <verse number="55" style="v" />Na unonung Sodom te a ccanung hae, na unonung Samaria te a ccanung hae tuh langmawlya hawte bua athuathui cih hae zah, nang te na ccanung hae mah langmawlya hawte bua na thuathui cih oh. <verse number="56-57" style="v" />Na hoyleinaw langsah athua maw, na lysaku lya kha na unonung Sodom tuh na munglae kya byaphung lang na mang khyh tou? Atu tuh nang ae theihrya hae paw na pepan e hae balyn, Aram ccanung hae te a innpaw hae balyn hanlan thuasah, Filistin ccanung hae hanlan thuasah nang tuh dothatheihpaw nynh na thua vae. <verse number="58" style="v" />Nang tuh na ohhuaku rynaw te na nungsikunaw keiccuze detahnaw kha na teing cih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Zungzae Tynpaw Byakinnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Na cyi hawte na tungvaw ka cyih cih, nang nynh byakinnaw kha na roh zah, thyalawkute byakinkunaw kha pawlang na ria khyh; <verse number="60" style="v" />tuhzemah na ngawphue lyaze nang te ka raepaw ka byakinnaw kha ka liathui cih zah, zungzae tynpaw byakinnaw kha nang te ka rae cih. <verse number="61" style="v" />Nang te byakinnaw ka la raepaw keiccu thua leite, na unonung hae athua hae paw na unung te na neitawnung kha parouh mawte na ccanung hae lang he kae pya hae te, na hiinzia kha na liathui cih zah na maethah cih. <verse number="62" style="v" />Ka byakinnaw tuh na kya ka tynsah cih zah, kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih, <verse number="63" style="v" />Na cyipaw balyn kha he kae ngaethya te, na tuathui cih zah na ngaeangthua cih, te na maethya keiccuze na khalang kha papin na awthui vae lan khyh, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Mosipi Sa Ning te Misu Ku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />Pou ccungccapaw, Israel hae kha phohpawbya phohpyate tousenaw phungpaw kha hynhte hopah hae: <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Aming tuh azong aphuinphuin te pyaa zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a sake alepaw, aming myarya thaawpaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">mosipi lepaw sa kheit tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Lebanon mua lang yn thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Aning nynh sidar ku adung kha kyng zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />adungpaccy atoihpaw kha a khya;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e tuh kungkunaw ram lang cciakhae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kungkunaw khua kyakhe a lin.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Te ram kyate ccacii kha lah zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">lae hoy kyakhe a lin;</para>
  <para style="q1">su ku hawte tui alungnaw khe a lin.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuh-e aku tuh yn toih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ange tuh lo zah apazaekuhpaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">nebabynpaw, ange hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mosipi kalan khe lobung hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">atharui hae tuh a thadynnaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">a sahbung hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">misu ku lang yn tang.</para>
  <para style="q2">Tuhcite misu ku lang a tang;</para>
  <para style="q1">ange hae tuh toih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">anaw asae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aming thaaw zah a sake myarya lepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangpaw mosipi lepaw sa kheit a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">Te dotua! E misu ku nynh atharui hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e mosipi kalan khe a saw;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e misu ku nynh tui mue khylan,</para>
  <para style="q2">ange hae kha tuh-e mosipi kalan khe a losah.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuh-e misu ku tuh lin a la thuanaw hmin kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tui alungnaw lae hoy kyakhe lin athua,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhteze nynh ange atoih cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">anaw asae cih zah</para>
  <para style="q1">aphu-epaw misu ku lang</para>
  <para style="q2">a tang cih.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze hynhte hopah hae: Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuh-e misu ku tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hoynaw a mue cih tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuh-e misu ku tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">baleih naansah khylan te</para>
  <para style="q1">athae kha thuhsah khylan,</para>
  <para style="q2">anaw atoih thawpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">naansah khylan,</para>
  <para style="q2">mosipi nynh atharui kha</para>
  <para style="q2">khaee lan khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Atharui ryte poh khaee khylan,</para>
  <para style="q2">athawsaepaw kuih khyhze</para>
  <para style="q2">athungpaw rhawkaw ho lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ccangpaw hmin kya</para>
  <para style="q2">linthui he athua te, hiinte alethung cih tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Nithua lang e khisan nynh he a mung te,</para>
  <para style="q2">khaleih naan lan khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">A lethungnaw hmin kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">naan lan khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="12" style="v" />Rhawtho a mang hae paw kha atu hopah hae: E tousenaw bya asuilan hynh na nyh khyh oh tou? Hynhte hopah hae: Babilon siapharan tuh Jerusalem lang yn thua zah, Jerusalem siapharan te a kuihkaw e bawi hae kha kyng hae zah Babilon lang a kikhae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.12-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:15-20">2Si 24.15-20</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10-13">2Sh 36.10-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Siapharan ciihan lu kheit kha ko zah, byakinsakute tuh-e paw ryte byakinnaw kha a rae, (aning nynh ram lungkhu e lupi hae kha a cciakhae hae), <verse number="14" style="v" />tuhteze nynh peenaw tuh zakaw a sangsakuh cih zah, amaw te amaw kha hangsahku leite, a byakinnaw kha zuite a thadyn kho cih. <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama aning nynh Judah siapharan kha rhawthonua zah, marang hae te rhawkaw patae kha ngia khylan Izip ram langkhe locceihtu hae kha a saw hae. Aning tuh hoynaw a mue cih tou? Hynhcihawpaw uccaw a cyihpaw tuh a lue kho cih tou? Byakinnaw kha rote a lue kho cih tou? <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw tuh: Kae tuh ka hiin thyhte, thanccingte siapharan lang a khangtupaw siapharan kya-e byakinnaw kha pawlangria khyh zah, aning te a raekheih hae paw a byakinnaw kha a ro keiccuze siapharan lang a khangtupaw a umnaw Babilon khua khe aning tuh a chih cih. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccungccaw patae kha chia khylan, Babilon hae nynh rhawtuk nawlan laephi kha thaete dohsah hae zah koihlunawpaw khualungrua kha he a rae hae te, Faro nynh athungpaw a rhawkaw hae te aphupi hae ryte aning kha rhawtuknaw kya bawm lan khyh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Jerusalem siapharan nynh thyalawkute byakinkupaw kha pawlangria khyh zah, byakinnaw kha a ro keiccu thuasah, e uccaw balyn hynh a cyi keiccu thuasah aning tuh lue lan khyh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw tuh: Kae tuh ka hiin thyhte, aning nynh pawlang a ria leipaw ka byakinpyakunaw kha thuasah, aning nynh a ropaw ka byakinnaw kha thuasah a lu vawlan ka ccawsah ccaccing cih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka miabu te ka bong cih zah, ka kaang kya a kae cih; Babilon lang ka cciakhae cih zah, ka tungvaw lungzinaw hoi leite a sei keiccuze tuin khua khe bya ka pia cih. <verse number="21" style="v" />A rhawkaw hae kyate a ccuepaw balyn tuh thaloi te a chih cih hae, a hiinhy hae paw tuh teitei lang balyn phiariphiarae a phiakuh cih hae; tetuh kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka hopaw kha na nyh cih oh, a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyathya kya Israel kha Hangthungnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">Myarya hangpaw sidar ku</para>
  <para style="q1">adungpaccy kya-e atoih thawpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka lah cih zah, ka lin cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Atoih thawpaw adungpaccy kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">atoihpaw kha ka khya cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">hang zah asung-epaw mua vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">ka lin cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel mua ahang huaccepaw vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e tuh ka lin cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e nynh ange atoih cih zah athae thae cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">te asung-epaw sidar lang a tang cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e thingku kaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">pavaw phuinccing a um cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">asake saepaw ahysuepaw phuinccing nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e thingnge a mynlyh kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">bu a luakuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ramkaw e thingku balyn nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">yn nyh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ahangpaw thingku kha ka nesah zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">anepaw thingku kha ka hangsah;</para>
  <para style="q1">hinlalyhpaw thingku kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka rousah zah, aroupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">thingku kha hinlalyh lan ka nung.</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka ho vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e tuh ka ccingsah cih.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Lu Raveih tungvaw Liarunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nungpaaw hae nynh ariapaw misu thae kha ae hae zah, ccaaw hae tuh mih hawzaw,” cite nanning nynh Israel ram te asekuhpaw e phungtangbya kha palei na ho oh paw hynh paw na rynaw oh mou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:29">Jer 31.29</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw tuh, Kae tuh ka hiin thyhte, e phungtangbya hynh Israel ram kya na mang vae lan khyh oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Hiinnaw balyn tuh ka kya-e nynh thua; nungpaaw hae hiinnaw thuasah, ccaaw hae hiinnaw thuasah ka kya-e nynh thua: A seipaw ccungccaw tuh a chih cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ccungccapaw tuh ding zah ahmepaw te akyhpaw kha a cyi ze thuasah— <verse number="6" style="v" />mua hae vawlan khe ae khyh, Israel phin kya-e zohtuh hae kha beik khyh, milae zu kha seikhae khyh, nopiny a nyhpaw kha naekuh khyh, <verse number="7" style="v" />humhung kha mah tuaasah khyh, laebah a lahtu nynh a ponpaw uccaw kha bua a kii, milae uccaw luade khyh, a vuelawpaw kha a looh pyabua zah a ccakaete umpaw kha boeining a bongpya ze thuasah, <verse number="8" style="v" />ato lawkute phua koiisakuh khyh hae, hoyleinaw kyate a kuih a synku, byalung hae paw laku kya ahmete bya a pia, <verse number="9" style="v" />ka phungbya hae kha a zui, ka phungzae hae kha pekite zui zah lungzite rya a law ze thuasah—tuhcihawpaw ccungccaw tuh miding nynh thua; aning tuh a hiin ccaccing cih, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18.5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuh-e paw a ccapaw tuh a puathopaw, ccungccaw a theihpaw, <verse number="11" style="v" />e uccaw hae hankhakheit kha a cyi (a paaw nynh khah-e hae kha a la cyi khyh zemah), mua hae vawlan khe a ae, milae zu kha a seikhae, <verse number="12" style="v" />ryachi hae te anyaa hae paw kha a tuaa a sah hae, milae uccaw a luade, ponpaw uccaw kha kii khyh hae, zohtuh hae kha a beik, anungsikuhpaw kha a cyi, <verse number="13" style="v" />ato kha a lawkuhtupaw athua lanze, aning tuh a hiin cih tou? Hiin lan khyh. Aning nynh anungsikuhpaw e uccaw balyn kha a cyi vae; aning tuh a chih ccaccing cih; a chiise tuh amaw tungvaw accah cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama, e ccungccapaw ccapaw tuh a paaw nynh a la raepaw seinaw balyn kha muih zah hoyte tua zah tuhcite cyihbua khyh, <verse number="15" style="v" />mua vawlan khe ae khyh, Israel hae kya-e zohtuh hae kha beik khyh, milae zu kha seikhae khyh, <verse number="16" style="v" />humhung kha mah tuaasah khyh, a pon hae paw uccaw kha lawkuh khyh, milae uccaw luade khyh, a vuelawpaw kha a looh pyabua zah a ccakaete umpaw kha boeining te a bongpya, <verse number="17" style="v" />hoyleinaw kyate a kuih kha a synku, ato kha lawkuh khyh zah ka phungzae hae te ka phungbya hae kha a zui lanze, aning tuh a paaw hoyleinaw keiccu chih lan khyh; aning tuh a hiin ccaccing cih. <verse number="18" style="v" />A paaw tuh a rysawthah zah a uno uccaw kha a luade, te a minphuin hae laku khe ahoy leipaw kha a cyi keiccuze a hoyleinaw keiccu a chih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuhzemah nanning nynh, “A paaw hoyleinaw keiccuze a ccapaw tuh pawccemou teing leite a um cih?” na ci oh. A ccapaw nynh ahmepaw te akyhpaw kha cyih zah, ka phungbya balyn kha pekite a zui lanze, aning tuh a hiin ccaccing cih. <verse number="20" style="v" />A seipaw ccungccaw tuh a chih cih. A ccaaw tuh a paaw hoyleinaw keiccuze teing lan khyh, a paaw tuh a ccapaw hoyleinaw keiccuze teing lan khyh; miding tuh a dingnaw mee kha a mue cih zah, ccungccaw hoyleipaw tuh a hoyleinaw mee kha a mue cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:16">Deu 24.16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuasalama ccungccaw hoyleipaw nynh a raepaw a seinaw balyn kyate maeleihkuh zah ka phungbya balyn kha zuite ahmepaw te akyhpaw kha a cyi lanze, aning tuh a hiin ccaccing cih; chih lan khyh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Aning nynh a la cyiseipaw seinaw hae kha ccuinpya thua lan khyh; aning tuh a la cyipaw dingnaw keiccuze a hiin cih. <verse number="23" style="v" />Ccungccaw hoyleipaw nynh a chipaw kha ccapyh san ka lungtua zawtou? A hiinzia kha paleihkuh zah a hiinpaw kha ka lungtuahua khyh tou? cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. <verse number="24" style="v" />Thuasalama midingpaw nynh a dingnaw kyate maeleihkuh zah hoyleinaw kha raete, ccungccaw hoyleipaw nynh a cyipaw anungsikuhpaw uccaw kha a cyi lanze, aning tuh a hiin cih tou? Aning nynh a la cyipaw adingpaw cyisahnaw kha liathuipya thua lan khyh; a la cyiseipaw hynhunaw te a la raepaw seinaw keiccuze aning tuh a chih cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuhzemah nanning nynh, “Bawipaw nynh a cyipaw tuh hme khyh,” na ci oh. Pou Israel hae, atu ngaetua oh: Ka cyipaw tuh hme khyh tou? Ahme leipaw tuh nanning nynh na cyi oh paw kha thua khyh tou? <verse number="26" style="v" />Miding nynh a dingnaw kyate maeleihkuh zah hoyleinaw kha a rae lanze, tuh-e hoyleinaw keiccuze aning tuh a chih cih; a la cyipaw hoyleinaw keiccuze aning tuh a chih cih. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuhawte, ccungccaw hoyleipaw nynh a la cyipaw hoyleinaw kha maetawkuh zah, ahmepaw te akyhpaw kha a cyi lanze, a hiinnaw kha a khumkuh cih. <verse number="28" style="v" />Aning nynh a la cyipaw cyiseinaw balyn kha hoyte tua zah a maetawku keiccuze aning tuh a hiin ccaccing cih; chih lan khyh. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuhzemah Israel hae nynh, “Bawipaw nynh a cyipaw tuh hme khyh,” a ci hae. Pou Israel hae, ka cyipaw tuh hme khyh tou? Ahme leipaw tuh nanning nynh na cyi oh paw kha thua khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, pou Israel hae, nae hiinzia thyhte nanning balyn kha bya kae pia cih oh, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. Nae seinaw balyn kha maetawkuh oh lah, ngaesikuh oh; tuhkhyhze tuh hoyleinaw tuh nae ronaw athua cih. <verse number="31" style="v" />Kae kha rawsete na rae oh paw seinaw balyn kha vua oh lah, thinlung thawpaw te tuanaw thawpaw lawkuh oh! Pou Israel hae, pawccemou na chih cih oh? <verse number="32" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh a chipaw kha ka lungtua khyh, paleihkuh oh lah, hiintua oh, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Thethyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel siapharan ccapaw hae hanlan rawkhuite na ho lanpaw tuh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Na nung tuh chindeih hae kyaze</para>
  <para style="q1">pawcihawpaw chindeih pinung mou athua!</para>
  <para style="q2">Chindeih ano hae paw kyaze</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw a taw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a do-oih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aning nynh a do-oihpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ataw sa kheit tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">chindeih anopaw lang yn tang zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">saw teipaw kha a ccangku;</para>
  <para style="q2">aning nynh ccungccaw hae kha a ae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Minphuin hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kong kha thae hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">mih bungzou; aning kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mih saehung lungkhu khe a kyng hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">sivawrui te he hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">Izip ram lang a cciakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nung nynh ngaehoi</para>
  <para style="q2">um vae khyh cipaw nyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">lungrote he a um te,</para>
  <para style="q1">ataw hae kya-e sa kheit kha lah zah</para>
  <para style="q2">chindeih nopaw lang a tangsah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuh-e chindeih nopaw nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q2">chindeih hae kya saw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">tei lan a via bungthung;</para>
  <para style="q2">te chindeih nopaw lang yn tang zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">saw teipaw kha a ccangku;</para>
  <para style="q2">aning nynh ccungccaw hae kha a ae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aning nynh mih rhawlungrua hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ropah hae zah mih khua hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">phe a zosahpya hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">aning nynh a siaruapaw</para>
  <para style="q1">roi keiccuze ram te</para>
  <para style="q2">a lungkhu umpaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">pong siikuh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A pepan umpaw khua takyh kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw kha a dou hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">miabu te aning kha bong hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">mih saehung lungkhu khe</para>
  <para style="q2">a kyng hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sivawrui te khii hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">abawng lungkhu a nung hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">te Babilon siapharan kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">a cciakhae hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel mua vawlan khe a roi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thae athua vae khyh ccaw cite</para>
  <para style="q2">thong lungkhu a nung hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na nung tuh misu khokhu lungkhu,</para>
  <para style="q2">tui kin kya linpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">misu ku hawte nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">tui alung keiccuze athae thae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">akaran te phe abeih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tynkarangpaw akaran tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">uktu bawi kya-e ccoi lang a tang;</para>
  <para style="q1">akaran hae patae laku khe</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya hang lante a thadyn;</para>
  <para style="q1">akaran patae ryte ahang keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">phe alangkuh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuasalama tuh-e tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thinriate poh khaee thua zah</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi kya vua athua;</para>
  <para style="q2">nithua lang e khisan nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">karae rousah zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">athae tuh akhuakuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">tynkarangpaw akaran tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">karae rou zah, maee nynh phe a u.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Atu vae tuh, tui um leinaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">karae roupaw ramkaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">linthui athua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Akaran kyate maee pou zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">akaran te athae kha phe a u,</para>
  <para style="q1">tetuh tuin kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">uknawpaw ccoi rae nawlan</para>
  <para style="q1">tynkarangpaw akaran um vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">E tuh rawkhuinaw thua zah, rawkhui nawlan mang athua.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Israel nynh Pachia Dounaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sarinaw kum, sawpaw sah pangawnaw, nin haw nin khe Israel piccan hae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha tuanaw ngia khylan oun thua hae zah ka malang a haung hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="3" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw kha Israel piccan hae kha hopah hae: Kae kha tuanaw ngia khylan pawccemou nae thua oh? Kae tuh ka hiin thyhte, nanning nynh tuanaw nae ngia kho lan khyh oh, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, minmin kha bya na pia cih hae tou? Minmin kha bya na pia cih hae tou? Mih minpaaw hae nynh a rae hae paw nungsikunaw kha nysah hae lah, <verse number="5" style="v" />minmin kha hopah hae: Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Israel kha ka po lyaze, Izip ram kya kamaw toulou kha minmin kya nysakute, Kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ka thua, cite Jakob ciihan hae kha bya ka kinpyaku hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.5-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:2-8">Exo 6.2-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuin nin khe, Izip ram kyate kae poukhae cih oh zah, nanning hanlan ka popaw ram, mateitui te khoitui aluanaw ram, ram balyn laeze aphu-e huaccepaw ram lungkhu lang kae teekhae cih oh, cite minmin kha bya ka kinpyaku hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Nanning lu kheit cci nynh nae mit lungtuakhae kupaw anungsikuhpaw uccaw hae kha vua oh lah, Izip ram e zohtuh khate naemaw toulou kha thusakuh nan oh; kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ka thua. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh kae kha yn dou hae zah ka bya ngae khyh hae; mih mit lungtuakhaekupaw anungsikuhpaw uccaw hae kha lu kheit nynh sanmah vua khyh hae zah, Izip ram e zohtuh hae kha vua khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">Tetuh ka thin-unaw kha mih tungvaw ka bu cih zah, Izip ram lungkhu kya ka thinrianaw kha ka mangnua cih hae, cite ka tuaku. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin a umnaw hae minphuin ccangpaw hae muihnaw khe ka min kha thusah athua khyh nawlan, ka min hanlan rya ka lah zah, minphuin ccangpaw hae muihnaw khe ka nysakuh hae zah, minmin kha Izip ram kyate ka poukhae hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Izip ram kyate ka poukhae hae zah ramkaw lang ka cciakhae hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />A zuipaw miakaw nynh a hiin ccaw hae cite, ka phungbya hae kha ka pya hae zah ka phungzae hae kha ka muihsah hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.11, 13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuhpiaze kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha ka thyaasah hae cipaw a ny nawlan hae, kae te minmin laku muisahnaw lante ka sabbath hae kha ka pya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 31:13-17">Exo 31.13-17</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama Israel hae nynh ramkaw kya kae kha yn dou hae; a zuipaw miakaw nynh a hiinnaw lanpaw ka phungbya hae kha zui khyh hae zah, ka phungzae hae kha a vua hae; te ka sabbath hae kha myaryamaw a thusah hae.</para>
  <para style="p">Tetuh minmin kha ro khylan, ramkaw kya ka thin-unaw kha mih tungvaw bu lan cite ka tuaku. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama ka poukhae hae paw kha a muih hae paw minphuin ccangpaw hae muihnaw khe ka min kha thusah athua khyh nawlan, ka min hanlan rya ka law. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuhpiaze ram balyn laeze aphu-e huaccepaw, mateitui te khoilutui aluanaw ram, nanning kae pya vae oh paw ram lungkhu langkhe kae teekhae lan khyh oh, cite ramkaw khe bya ka kinpyaku hae,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:26-35">Nam 14.26-35</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />pawccecize mih thinlung tuh mih zohtuh hae nulang a zuiku keiccuze ka phungzae hae kha vua hae zah ka phungbya hae kha zui khyh hae, ka sabbath hae kha mah a thusah hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin kha ngaethya ka umsah hae zah ka roh khyh hae, ramkaw kya phe ka thangsah khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ramkaw kya mih ccaaw hae kha ka hopah hae zah, Nae nung nae paaw hae kya-e phungbya kha zui nan oh, mih phungzae kha mah zui nan oh, mih zohtuh hae khate naemaw toulou kha thusakuh nan oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ka thua; ka phungbya hae kha zui oh lah, ka phungzae hae kha hoyte zui oh, <verse number="20" style="v" />Kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh nae Pachia ka thuapaw kha na ny nawlan oh, kae te nanning laku kya muisahnaw athua cih paw ka sabbath hae kha thyaasah oh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuasalama mih ccaaw hae nynh kae kha yn dou hae; a zuipaw miakaw nynh a hiinnaw lanpaw ka phungbya hae kha zui khyh hae zah, ka phungzae hae kha hoyte zui khyh hae; ka sabbath hae kha a thusah hae.</para>
  <para style="p">Tetuh ka thin-unaw kha mih tungvaw ka bu cih zah, ramkaw khe ka thinrianaw kha ka mangnua cih hae, cite ka tuaku. <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama ka poukhae hae paw kha a muih hae paw minphuin ccangpaw hae muihnaw khe ka min kha thusah athua khyh nawlan, ka min hanlan tuate ka kuih kha zya ka synku. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuhpiaze ramkaw khe minmin hanlan bya ka kinkuh zah, minmin kha minphuin ccangpaw hae laku kya phiariphiarae ka nung cih hae zah, ram hae kalan ka saw cih hae,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:33">Lev 26.33</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />pawccecize minmin nynh ka phungzae hae kha zui khyh hae, ka phungbya hae kha vua hae zah ka sabbath hae kha a thusah hae, mih minpaaw hae kya-e zohtuh hae kha a beik hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Te ahoy leipaw phungbya hae kha ka pya hae zah, a hiinkhae kho lei hae paw phungzae hae kha ka pya hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Minmin nynh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha a ny nawlan hae, minmin kha ro khylan mih ccatawccaw balyn khate silawnaw rae hae zah, mimaw mih lasung ccaccei mawkhate minmin kha ka thusah hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, ccungccapaw, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw kha Israel hae kalan hopya tua hae: Nae minpaaw hae nynh ka tungvaw lungzi leite ka min kha bua yn thusah hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Minmin kha pya lan bya ka kinpyaku hae paw ram lungkhu langkhe he ka teekhae hae te, minmin nynh a muih hae paw ahangpaw mua miakaw khyhze thingku anaw abungpaw miakaw kyakhe silawnaw rae hae zah ka thin yn riasah hae; te tuin kyakhe mynkhuhpaw kha maee te upah hae zah, niapaw silawnaw kha a rae hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />(Na ccianua oh paw ahangpaw hmin tuh pawmou athua? cite ka khia hae. Tukeiccuze tuh-e tuh Bamah cite atunin cia a ko hae.) <verse number="30" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw kha Israel hae kalan hopya tua hae: Nae minpaaw hae kya-e anungsikuhpaw uccaw hae nulang zuikuseite, minmin nynh a cyi hae hawte naemaw toulou kha na thusakuh cih oh tou? <verse number="31" style="v" />Nae lasung kha na pya oh zah nae ccaaw hae kha silaw nawlan maee te ute naemaw toulou kha nae zohtuh hae khate atunin cia na thusaku oh. Pou Israel hae, nanning nynh kae kha tuanaw nae ngiakuh kho cih oh tou? Kae tuh ka hiin thyhte, nanning nynh tuanaw nae ngia kho lan khyh oh, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Aening tuh minphuin ccangpaw hae hawte thua oh sih lah, thing te lung a beik hae paw ramccungccaw hae hawte thua oh sih,” cite na tuaku oh paw kha papin cyihkuh lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia nynh Israel kha A Kikhae Cih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw tuh: Kae tuh ka hiin thyhte, athungpaw kuih, dyngpaw kuih te bupaw thinrianaw khate nanning kha kae uk cih oh. <verse number="34" style="v" />Phiariphiarae na umnaw oh ram hae te minphuin hae kyate athungpaw kuih, dyngpaw kuih te bupaw thinrianaw khate kae cciakhae cih oh zah kae suelua cih oh; <verse number="35" style="v" />minphuin ccangpaw hae ramkaw langkhe kae cciakhae cih oh zah, tuin kyakhe mitmae hawiliakute nanning kha bya kae pia cih oh. <verse number="36" style="v" />Izip ram ramkaw kya nae minpaaw hae kha bya ka pia hae hawte, nanning kha bya kae pia cih oh, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka hoitang kaw khe kae cciasah cih oh zah, byakinnaw lungkhu khe kae nung cih oh. <verse number="38" style="v" />Kae yn dou hae paw te yn rawse hae paw kha nanning laku kyate poh ka thuaa cih hae; ramccang ccungccaw lante a umnaw hae ram kyate minmin kha ka poukhae hae zemah, Israel ram lungkhu lang tee lan khyh hae. Te kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Pou Israel hae, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Nae balynte atu cceih oh lah, nae zohtuh hae kha beik oh; thuasalama atu te malang tuh ka bya na ngae khyh oh zemah, nae lasung hae te nae zohtuh hae khate athyaapaw ka min kha na thusah vae lan khyh oh. <verse number="40" style="v" />Pawccecize, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw tuh: athyaapaw ka mua, Israel mua ahangpaw vawlan khe Israel hae balyn nynh ram lungkhu kya kae kha yn beik cih hae; tuin kyakhe minmin kha leh ka khan cih hae, te tuin kyakhe nae kya-e ahlu hae, ahoy huaccepaw nae lasung hae te athyaapaw nae uccaw balyn kha kae ngia cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Phiariphiarae na umnaw oh ram hae te minphuin hae kyate nanning kha kae poukhae oh zah he kae suelua oh te, nanning kha mynkhuhpaw hawte kae ccou cih oh; minphuin ccangpaw hae muihnaw khe ka thyaanaw kha nanning laku kya ka langsakuh cih. <verse number="42" style="v" />Nae minpaaw hae kalan pya lan bya ka kinpyaku hae paw ram, Israel ram lungkhu lang he kae teekhae oh te, kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha nae nyh cih oh. <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuin kyakhe naemaw toulou na thusakunaw oh paw nae cyisahnaw te nae hiinzia balyn kha na liathui cih oh zah, na la cyi oh paw hoyleinaw balyn keiccuze naemaw toulou nae luathuakuh cih. <verse number="44" style="v" />Pou Israel hae, ahoy leipaw nae hiinzia, nae cyisahnaw athahpaw thyhte thua leite, ka min hanlan nanning kha he kae ccuepe oh te, kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha nae nyh cih oh, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Negeb Rawse lan Hotynaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="46" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, alia langkhe na mae kha hawi lah, alia lang kha rawsenaw bya honua tua, te Negeb ram umpaw tuhpi kha rawsete profehbya hopya tua; <verse number="47" style="v" />Negeb tuhpi kha hynhte hopya tua, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh thaetua: Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho, Na tungvaw kya maee ka tyh cih zah, na kya umpaw thingku hinlalyhpaw miakaw te aroupaw thingku miakaw kha a u cih; aruapaw maee tuh chih lan khyh zah, alia langte palung langkhe pawpaw balyn kha khaleih a u cih. <verse number="48" style="v" />Kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh tuh-e maee kha ka tyh cipaw kha ccungccaw balyn nynh a nyh cih hae; tuh-e maee tuh chih lan khyh. <verse number="49" style="v" />Tetuh kae nynh, “Pou Bawipaw PACHIA! Minmin nynh ka konglang ho hae zah, ‘Aning tuh tousenawpaw phungpaw a hotupaw thua khyh tou?’ a ciku hae,” cite ka hopya.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia Thaloi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, na mae kha Jerusalem langkhe hawi lah, beikinnthyaa hae kha rawsenaw bya hotua; Israel ram rawsenawpaw profehbya kha hotua, <verse number="3" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho cite Israel ram kha hopya tua: Nang kha rawsete ka thaloi kha abu kyate ka thuaakuh cih zah, na kya umpaw miding thuasah, ccungccaw hoyleipaw thuasah parouh mawte ka bae cih hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Adingpaw te ahoy leipaw na ccungccaw hae kha parouh mawte ka bae lan hae paw athua keiccuze, alia langte palung lang cia ccungccaw balyn kha rawsete ka thaloi tuh abu kyate thuaa athua cih; <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka thaloi kha abu kyate a thuaa vae cipaw ccungccaw balyn nynh a nyh cih hae; tuh-e thaloi tuh abu lungkhu lang bua sangthui thua vae lan khyh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccungccapaw, hawkhaeku tua; mih malang khe thinlung koite myarya ngaethyate hawkhaeku tua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin nynh nang kha, “Pawccemou na hawkhaeku?” cite ae khia hae ze, nang nynh minmin kha, “Oun thuapaw thongpang keiccu nynh thua. Ccungccaw miakaw tuh myarya rih cih hae zah, mih kuih tuh a thawzya cih, mih lungroh cih zah mih ccukharu athyngkuh cih. Tuh-e tuh yn thua cih zah yn ccing cih,” cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="9" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, profehbya ho lah, Bawipaw nynh hynhte a ho cite hopya tua hae:</para>
  <para style="q1">Thaloi, thaloi tuh taw athua vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">awrarih lan nuih athua vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thaloi tuh chianaw khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">taw athua vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">khozawlaekuhpaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">phaephae ak lan taw athua vae!</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawtemou lungtuanaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ah rae kho ung cih oh?</para>
  <para style="q1">Ccungngue te thuiheinaw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pawlang na ria khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thaloi kha awrarih lan nuih khylan te</para>
  <para style="q2">kuih te kyng khylan pya athua vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Thaloi kha ccungccaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a theihtu kuih kya pya khylan</para>
  <para style="q1">taw thua vae zah awrarih lan</para>
  <para style="q2">nuih athua vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pou ccungccapaw, siaruate rawtua,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize tuh-e thaloi nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ccungccaw hae kha a rawse hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel bawi balyn kha mah a rawse hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin tuh ka ccungccaw hae ryte</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi kalan vua athua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ezou! cite nae phae kha tuku tua oh!</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh syntawtuanaw nynh thua. Ccungngue kha pawlang na ria khyh oh lanze, tuh-e tuh cyihkuh lan khyh tou? cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, profehbya ho lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na kuihbia tua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Thaloi nynh vae ning,</para>
  <para style="q2">vae thum baetua sah;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e tuh chianaw lanpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ccungccaw patae chianaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha phang a koihlu hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tukeiccuze mih lungroh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw patae a khuliakuh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Koikua balyn kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi kha ka nung vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Thaloi kha phaephae ak lan rae thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">chia nawlan awrarih lan nuih athua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na thaloi haw a hawinaw miakaw lang,</para>
  <para style="q2">voilang ranglang khe baetua!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kae nynh mah ka kuih ka bia cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thinrianaw kha ka daesah cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka ho vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka kalan yn thuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh: <verse number="19" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Babilon siapharan thaloi nynh a cceih cihnaw laanpi ccangning kha syntawnaw raetua; tuh-e laanpi ccangning mawte ram ramkheit kyate a pou cih hae. Te khuapi kalan a cceihpaw laanpi aphiakunaw kyakhe syntawnawpaw kha raetua; <verse number="20" style="v" />Ammon hae khua Rabbah lang thuasah, Judah ram e sihkakinpaw Jerusalem khua lang thuasah tuh-e thaloi a cceih cihnaw laanpi kha syntawnaw raetua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Pawccecize Babilon siapharan tuh laanpi ccangning aphiakunaw kyakhe ccungthydung khylan a thadyn; the hae kha a thyhleih, terafim khozi kha tuanaw a ngia, saw athin kha a do. <verse number="22" style="v" />Jerusalem cite zeikuhpaw ccungthydungnawpaw the kha a ranglang kuih nynh a kyng, tuh-e the nynh aning kha rhawtuknawpaw zunghe raenua lanpaw, chia khylan siarua lanpaw, rhawtuk khylan siarua lanpaw, koikua te arawsekuh lante rhawtuknawpaw zunghe raenua lanpaw, laephi dohsah lanpaw te rhawvianawpaw innhangpaw hae sak lanpaw kha a hopya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama phuring-unaw tuh Jerusalem ccungccaw hae hanlan ahme leipaw phuring-unaw hawte nynh athua; pawccecize minmin nynh atynpaw byakinkunaw kha a rae vae hae; thuasalama siapharan nynh minmin kha kyng khylan mih hoyleinaw kha a syntaw. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Nae seinaw kha nae cyisahnaw balyn kya langsaku khylan, nae cyiseinaw kha phykute milae na nysah oh keiccuze milae kuih kya na thua cih oh. <verse number="25" style="v" />Anungsikuhpaw ccungccapaw, Israel uktu bawi,</para>
  <para style="q2">nyathya detahnaw ccyh nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ae thuanua vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">Na pungde kha nung lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na bawilukhung kha khahku tua;</para>
  <para style="q2">uccaw hae tuh arulaekuh vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Anyaapaw kha hangthungtua lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ahangkuhpaw kha nyaasah bung tua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ronaw, ronaw, ronaw—</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e ronaw tuh ka thuasah cih!</para>
  <para style="q1">(Tuhcihawpaw tuh cyihkuh boi khyh.)</para>
  <para style="q2">Tuh-e ronaw a rae cih paw</para>
  <para style="q1">he yn thua te, tuh-e tuh ka pya cih.</para>
  <para style="q2">Amaw kha tuh-e khuapi tuh ka pya cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, profehbya ho lah, hopya tua hae, Amon hae te thuasah, mih saryanaw te thuasah asekuh lante Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.28-32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:1-6">Jer 49.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:1-7">Eze 25.1-7</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:13-15">Amo 1.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:8-11">Zef 2.8-11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">Thaloi, thaloi!</para>
  <para style="q2">Chia nawlan thuaaku athua,</para>
  <para style="q1">maemih nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q2">khozawlaekuhpaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">awrarih lan taw athua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Vizin na muih oh paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ahme leipaw thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">malang hanlan na hodae</para>
  <para style="q2">oh paw bya tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">hynbya nynh thua, nanning tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hoyleipaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw thyapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">na thua oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning nyathya detahnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccyh tuh yn thua vae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Thaloi tuh nae nging vawlan accah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thaloi kha abu kalan sangtua oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Nanning kha rae na thuanaw oh hmin kya,</para>
  <para style="q1">na thokeinaw oh ram kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">bya kae pia cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka thinrianaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nae tungvaw ka bu cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thinrianaw maee te</para>
  <para style="q2">kae mung cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Mih rysawthah zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ro a thya hae paw kuih kalan,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae ap cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nanning tuh maee hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">maeething na thua cih oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae chii tuh laephi kalan a tee cih.</para>
  <para style="q2">Nanning tuh liathui</para>
  <para style="q1">na thua vae lan khyh oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh phe ka ho vae.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ccungccaw Theihpaw Khuapi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, nang, ccungccaw theihpaw khuapi kha bya na pia cih tou, bya na pia cih tou? Aning nynh anungsikuhpaw a cyisahnaw balyn kha hopya tua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw kha minmin kalan hynhte hopya tua hae: Amaw lungkhu khe chiise luasah zah, zohtuh hae kha raekute amaw toulou a thusakuhpaw khuapi ccyh tuh a thua vae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Na luasahpaw chiise keiccuze na sei vae, na raekupaw zohtuh hae keiccuze na nungsikuh vae; namaw nynh na ccyh kha na naesaku vae, khyapyapaw na ccyh tuh a thua vae. Tukeiccuze minphuin hae malang khe na the kae thyasah zah, ram balyn nynh saryapaw lang kae rae vae. <verse number="5" style="v" />A thethah zah siarisiarae a sianua hae paw nang kha namaw te na sawkuh oh paw te na naekuh oh paw nynh ae sarya cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na kya umpaw Israel bawi hae nynh mih huhan raveih thyhte ccungccaw kha a chia hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kyakhe nung te paaw kha a theihrya hae; na kya umpaw minphuin ccangpaw hae kha uccaw luade hae zah, ngawraw hae te nomae hae kha na kyakhe a tuaa a sah hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Exo 20.12</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 22:21-22">22.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Deu 5.16</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 24:17">24.17</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Athyaapaw ka uccaw hae kha pawlang na ria khyh oh zah ka sabbath hae kha na thusah oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:30">Lev 19.30</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 26:2">26.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Ccungccaw chia khylan ccungccaw a lawty hae paw, mua vawlan a ae hae paw, ohhuakunaw seinaw rae hae paw tuh na kya a um hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Na lungkhu khe mih paaw hae zu kha a seikhae hae; nopiny a ny ccyh hae khe nopi hae kha a seikhae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.10-11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:7-20">Lev 18.7-20</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Ccungccaw abang nynh mih innpaw hae zu seikhaete anungsikuhpaw kha a rae hae; abang nynh mih monung hae ryte anungsikuhpaw ohhuakunaw kha a rae hae; na kya umpaw abang nynh mih ccianung athuapaw mih paaw ccanung khate anungsikuhpaw kha a rae hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Na lungkhu khe, minmin nynh ccungccaw chia khylan amee a lawku hae; nanning nynh phua ato lawkute na koiisaku oh, nae innpaw hae uccaw kha na luade oh; nanning nynh kae kha nae ning vae oh, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:25">Exo 22.25</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 23:8">23.8</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:36-37">Lev 25.36-37</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:19">Deu 16.19</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 23:19">23.19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dotua, ahme leite na mue oh paw uccaw, te na lungkhu kya aluapaw chiise keiccuze ka kuih ka bia. <verse number="14" style="v" />Na tungvaw rya he ka lah te, na rawthungnaw tuh a ngaesang kho cih tou? Na kuih thungnaw tuh atyn kho cih tou? Kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka ho vae paw kha ka cyih cih. <verse number="15" style="v" />Nanning kha minphuin ccangpaw hae kya phiariphiarae kae nung cih oh zah ram hae kyakhe kaheikalah kae phia cih oh, te nae nungsikunaw kha kae lawpah cih oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Nanning keiccuze minphuin hae muihnaw kya ka minthusah athua cih; te nanning nynh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="18" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Israel hae tuh ka hanlan sivaw-ia lang phe tang vae hae; mih balyn mawte ngun, sohin, ccephui, sivaw te kuee hawte thua hae zah, somaee kya tuisahte sivaw-ia lang phe tang vae hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Nanning balyn tuh sivaw-ia lang na tang vae oh keiccuze Jerusalem ngaelung langkhe kae suelua cih oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngun, sohin, sivaw, kuee te ccephui kha tuisah khylan somaee lungkhu nung hawte, nanning kha ka thinrianaw te ka thin-unaw khate Jerusalem khua khe kae pum cih oh zah kae tuisah cih oh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Nanning kha sueluate ka thinrianaw maee kha kae mungnua cih oh zah, tuin khua lungkhu khe atui lang na tang cih oh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngun tuh somaee lungkhu atui hawte, nanning tuh tuin khua kyakhe na tui cih oh; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae tungvaw kya ka thinrianaw ae bu oh paw kha na nyh cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="24" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Israel ram kha hopya tua: Nang tuh accikankuh leipaw ram, thinrianaw nin kya khuaarah leipaw ram nynh na thua. <verse number="25" style="v" />Ram lungkhu umpaw a bawi hae tuh saw tei zah a siapaw chindeih te nynh aloku hae; ccungccaw hae kha tei hae zah, sisua te aphutepaw uccaw hae kha a lawku hae; ram lungkhu kya nomae lang patae a tangsah hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />A ranpibawi hae nynh ka ccangpyanaw kha roh hae zah athyaapaw ka uccaw hae kha a thusah hae; athyaapaw te athyaa leipaw kha laesah leite, athyaapaw te athyaa leipaw kong kha ccangpah khyh hae, minmin laku kya kae kha thethyasah khylan, ka sabbath hae kha pawlangria khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:10">Lev 10.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v" />A bawi hae tuh saw a tei hae paw ram-ui hae te nynh aloku hae, ccungccaw chiate, ahme leite muenaw hanlan ccungccaw hiinnaw kha a ro hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Profeh hae nynh mah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho lei pite, “Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho,” cite hote ahme leipaw vizin kha muih hae zah, hynbya a ho hae, arawpaw sii kha a thuh hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Ram kya-e ccungccaw hae nynh nangsepaw te luadepaw rya kha a law hae; a ryachipaw te anyaapaw kha tuaasah hae zah, ramccang hae kha ahme leite a luade hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Ram kha ka ro khyh nawlan, khualungrua a raethui cih paw te ating vae paw khualungrua kya ram ccelang ka malang a thadyn cih paw kha ka ccung zah lu kheit sanmah ka muih khyh. <verse number="31" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka thinrianaw kha mih tungvaw kya ka bu; ka thinrianaw maee te minmin kha ka u hae; mih cyisahnaw kha mih lu vawlan ka ccawsah, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Oholah te Oholibah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, nung nungkheit ccanung hae lu ning a um hae; <verse number="3" style="v" />minmin tuh he a liaccaw hae te, Izip ram kya ohhuanung lang a tang hae; mih matei kha miapah hae zah mih liaccady by kha a pom hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Atawccanung min tuh Oholah cikuh zah a neitawnung min tuh Oholibah acikuh. Minmin tuh ka kya-e lang tang hae zah, ccanung ccapaw hae kha a saahku hae. Oholah tuh Samaria thua zah Oholibah tuh Jerusalem nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Oholah tuh ka kya-e athua pite a ohhuakuh; a sungsah hae paw Assiria hae, <verse number="6" style="v" />meizong boeining a lawkuh hae paw rhawbawi hae, uktu hae te kawpyatu bawi hae, apuithyapaw ccangvae hae, marang rhawkaw hae kha a ry hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Assiria pise asung-e hae paw balyn ryte a ohhuaku hae; aning nynh a ry hae paw miakaw kya-e zohtuh hae balyn khate amaw toulou kha a thusaku. <verse number="8" style="v" />Izip ram kya a la raepaw ohhuakunaw kha umtaw khyh; tuin kyakhe a ngawphue lyaze pise hae nynh ikhae hae zah a liaccady matei kha miapyate a seikhae hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze aning nynh a ry hae paw a sungsah hae, Assiria hae kuih kalan khe ka ap vae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Minmin nynh a boeining kha phae hae zah a ccakaete a nung hae; a ccanung hae te a ccapaw hae kha a kyngpya hae; amaw thaloi te a chia hae. Aning tuh byapianaw teing zah, nopi hae laku kya byaphung lang a tang. <verse number="11" style="v" />A neitawnung Oholibah nynh tuh-e tuh a muih zemah a unung laeze ohhuaku rynaw thinlung hoihua zah a ohhuakuh hua. <verse number="12" style="v" />Assiria hae, uktu hae te kawpyatu bawi hae, sivaw rhawtuk-uccaw lawkuh hae paw rhawbawi hae, marang rhawkaw hae apuithyapaw ccangvae hae balyn kha aning nynh a ry hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Aning nynh a nungsikunaw kha ka muih; parouh mawte alokuhpaw laanpi kha a zui hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama Oholibah nynh houhouh a ohhuaku; pang kya soikuhpaw pise hae zuh, asi sepaw soikuhpaw Khaldi hae zuh, <verse number="15" style="v" />tuh-e azuh hae tuh mih tae kya taeccia cciakuh hae zah mih lu kya haetapaw pungde a deku hae, mih balynte bawi hae—mih thokeinaw ram tuh Khaldi ram athuapaw Babilon hae te nynh aloku hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Minmin kha he a muih hae te, ohhuaku rynaw thinlung hoi zah, Khaldi ram umpaw tuh-e hae kalan khe locceihtu a saw hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Babilon hae tuh sungsakunaw ikhung kalan cceih hae zah aning kha a thusah hae; te minmin ryte amaw toulou kha a thusakuh koute, nungsikuh babae lante minmin kyate a ki. <verse number="18" style="v" />A ohhuakunaw te a ccakaete a umpaw kha khawsung leite he a langsakuh tuh, a unung tungvaw ka lua ka aethua hawte, aning tungvaw mah ka lua ka aethua. <verse number="19" style="v" />A ngawphue lyaze Izip ram kya a ohhuaku ccyh kha liathuite houhouh a ohhuaku, <verse number="20" style="v" />pise athuanaw hae paw mih e tuh lann e te lokuh zah, mih buatui tuh rangtepaw buatui te alokuhpaw a sungsah hae kha a ry hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Izip hae nynh na matei ae miapya lya hae te na mateidung ae moipya lya hae, na ngawphue lya-e ohhuakuh rynaw kha na ngaethui. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, pou Oholibah, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Mih tungvaw na lua-aethuapaw na sungsah hae kha nang rawsete ka thosakuh cih hae zah, teitei langte balyn nang kha kae konua cih hae: <verse number="23" style="v" />tuh-e hae tuh Babilon hae te Khaldi hae balyn, Pekod hae, Shoa hae te Koa hae ryte Assiria hae balyn, tuh-e hae kya-e apuithyapaw ccangvae hae, uktu hae, kawpyatu bawi hae, bawi hae te rhawbawi hae, marang rhawkaw hae balyn nynh athua hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Minmin nynh palung langte rhawkaw patae ryte marangle hae te uccaw phunawpaw le hae khate nang kha ae thuanua cih hae; khawriaphua adihpaw, khawriaphua alepaw te sivawlukhung khate teitei langte balyn nang kha ae koihlu cih hae, kae nynh minmin kha byapianaw kaw ka pya cih hae zah, nang kha mih phungzae thyhte bya ae pia cih hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Minmin nynh na tungvaw mih thin ae rianua ccaw hae cite, ka thinrianaw kha kae sawnua cih. Na naduh te na nakua kha ae aw cih hae zah, a hiinhy hae paw tuh thaloi te a chih cih hae. Na ccanung hae te na ccapaw hae kha a kyng cih hae, a hiinhy hae paw kha maee te a u cih hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Na boeining kha ae phae cih hae zah, aphutepaw na lung hae kha a lawkuh cih hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuhcite na ohhuaku rynaw thinlung te Izip ram kyate nae thuakhaekupaw na ohhuakunaw kha ka thangsah cih; khah-e hae kha na ngae vae lan khyh zah, Izip ram kha na liathui vae lan khyh. <verse number="28" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Nang nynh na huapaw ccungccaw hae kuih kalan te na lua na aethuapaw ccungccaw hae kuih kalan khe kae ap cih; <verse number="29" style="v" />nang kha ae hua hae thyhte ae cyih cih hae, na ryalaw mee athae balyn kha a lawkuh cih hae zah, na ccakaete ae cciataw cih hae, na ohhuakunawpaw na e kha alang cih. Na ohhuaku rynaw te na ohhuakunaw nynh <verse number="30" style="v" />hynh-e hynh na tungvaw ae thuakhaepya vae, pawccecize minphuin ccangpaw hae ryte na ohhuakuh zah, mih zohtuh hae khate namaw toulou kha na thusaku. <verse number="31" style="v" />Na unung laanpi kha na zuibua vae; tukeiccuze a banang kha na kuih kya kae pya cih. <verse number="32" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Akopaw te akhupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">na unung banang kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na neih cih; tuh-e banang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">patae accawngpaw thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang tuh ae sarya cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ae nuinse cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nang tuh ruinaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethyanaw khate phe na beih cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Na unung Samaria banang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ri lan umpaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">ronaw banang nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />tuh-e banang tuh na neih cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">phe athang cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">banang akoinahpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na khae cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na matei kha thoh ae aw cih;</para>
  <para style="m">phe ka ho vae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. <verse number="35" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw tuh: Kae kha nae ning zah na nulang nae vua keiccuze ohhuaku rynaw na hoipaw te na ohhuakunaw mee kha teingtua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae yn hopyapaw tuh: Ccungccapaw, Oholah te Oholibah kha bya na pia cih hae tou? Anungsikuhpaw mih cyisahnaw kha hopya tua hae. <verse number="37" style="v" />Pawccecize minmin nynh milae vawpaw te sei hae zah ccungccaw kha a chia hae; mih zohtuh hae khate milae vawpaw kya seinaw a rae vae hae; ka hanlan yn saahpya hae paw ccaaw hae kha heize zohtuh hae kalan khe looh lang a pya vae hae. <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuhpiaze ka tungvaw kya e hynh a cyi ung hae: Tuin nin khe ka beikinnthyaa kha thusah hae zah ka sabbath hae kha thethyasah hae. <verse number="39" style="v" />Mih ccaaw hae kha mih zohtuh hae hanlan a chia nin hae khe, ka beikinnthyaa kha thusah khylan a lungkhu lang a tee hae. E hynh minmin nynh ka inn lungkhu a cyi hae paw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Minmin nynh locceihtu hae kha sawte asawnaw e pise hae kha kosah hae zah oun thua hae. Minmin hanlan tui na singpyaku hae, na mit kya azong na thuhpakuh hae zah ccaankunawpaw uccaw khate na ccaanpyaku hae; <verse number="41" style="v" />myarya lypaw ikhung vawlan khe na haung zah, tuh-e ikhung malang aphaekuhpaw ccaboi vawlan khe ka kya-e mynkhuhpaw te ka chitui kha na nung. <verse number="42" style="v" />ngaluin-ngaluin ccae hae paw zapi hae roi tuh accae, siarisiarae um hae paw patae te ramkaw te oun thuakhae hae paw arui hae paw mah a umbua hae; minmin nynh nopi hae kuih kyakhe khawccan nawsakuh hae zah, mih lu vawlan khe apuithyapaw bawilukhung kha a khungsah hae. <verse number="43" style="v" />Milae vawpaw te seinaw raekheihte a tawkhaekuhnung tetou minmin tuh a ohhuaku hae, cite ka ho. <verse number="44" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh ohhuanung kha a teenua hawte, minmin nynh aning kha a teenua hae. Tuhcite minmin nynh a ohhuakuh ry hae paw Oholah te Oholibah kha a teenua hae. <verse number="45" style="v" />Adingpaw byapiatu hae nynh, minmin tuh milae vawpaw kya seinaw te ccungccaw chiapaw seinaw kha a rae hae, cite a ho cih hae; pawccecize minmin tuh milae vawpaw kya seinaw raetu hae te ccungccaw theihtu hae nynh athua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Tuh-e nopi hae kha thinphangsah khylan te uccaw luade khylan, zapi hae kha mih kalan konua oh. <verse number="47" style="v" />Zapi hae nynh minmin kha lung te a deih cih hae zah thaloi te a bae cih hae; mih ccanung hae te mih ccapaw hae kha a chiapah cih hae zah, mih inn kha maee te a soipah cih hae. <verse number="48" style="v" />Nopi balyn nynh raeringkuh hae zah nanning hawte a ohhuaku khyh nawlan hae, ram lungkhu kya ohhuakunaw kha ka zosah cih. <verse number="49" style="v" />Ohhuaku na rynaw oh keiccu ae liaru cih oh zah, aseipaw nae zohtuh hae keiccu detahnaw na teing cih oh; te kae tuh Bawipaw PACHIA ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih oh.</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Accohpaw Ang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum takuanaw, sawpaw sah hawnaw, nin haw nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, atunin ccaccei maw a min kha zeitua. E nin ccaccei kyahin Babilon siapharan nynh Jerusalem kha a koihlu vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:1">2Si 25.1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:4">Jer 52.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Rhawtho a mangpaw ccungccaw hae kha tousenaw phungpaw hopah hae, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Maee vawlan khe ang khang lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tui kha phoihtua;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ang lungkhu khe sange hae kha thungtua,</para>
  <para style="q2">ahoypaw sange hae, aphae, alya te</para>
  <para style="q2">aru ahoy hae paw khate phe biasah tua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuuphu kya-e ahoy huapaw kha lawtua lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">thingtung hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ang kaw khe pumnua tua;</para>
  <para style="q2">sange hae kha ccohsahnua lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ang lungkhu umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">aru hae kha mah ccohsahnua tua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Chiise aluapaw khuapi,</para>
  <para style="q2">chihhangkae zah athyaa leipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ang hanlan ngaethya lan kou um!</para>
  <para style="q2">Sange hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">nge kheit koute nge kheit</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungthydung leite</para>
  <para style="q2">phe thang lan lawtua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize khuapi nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a luasahpaw chiise tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e khuapi lungkhu kya a um;</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e chiise tuh laephi nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a thei ccaw cite laephi vawlan lae khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">raerae langpaw lung vawlan khe nynh a lae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thinriasah khylan te phulaw khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">khuapi nynh a luasahpaw chiise kha</para>
  <para style="q1">raerae alangpaw lung vawlan khe ka lae vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhteze nynh chiise kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thei kho thua lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Chiise aluapaw khuapi hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya lan kou um!</para>
  <para style="q1">Maeething apumkuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya lepaw kha ka rae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thingtung hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pum oh lah, maee tyh oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">saw kha phe voi lan thung oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">amynkhuhpaw aphuinphuin kha</para>
  <para style="q1">thungbia oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">aru hae kha maee nynh u hae sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maee-e vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">ang ccakae khate khangtua,</para>
  <para style="q1">tetuh ang tuh aso cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">daw tuh ase cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a lungkhu umpaw athupaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">palae atui cih, chihhang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">maee nynh phe a u cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Alakaw lan ka thaw ka bangsaku han;</para>
  <para style="q2">thaawkalae lan chihhangkaepaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">zo kho khyh. Maee te zo kho khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anungsikuhpaw na ohhuaku rynaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thyaasah zemah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na nungsikunaw tuh thyaa lae khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thinrianaw kha na tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ccingsah mawlaezung</para>
  <para style="q2">na thyaa lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka ho vae; accyh zawbia vae zah rya ka lah cih. Kae synpakuh lan khyh. Na ozia te na cyisahnaw thyhte de kae tah cih, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ezekiel kha Chitawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="16" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, na sungsah huapaw kha na kyate vaekheihmawte ka lah cih; tuhzemah na rah na khui lan khyh, na mitphi mah lua lan khyh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Zyazyate hawkhaeku tua; a chihpaw elang rawkhuite um nan. Na pungde khungkuh lah, na phanah nawkuh; na mung palung lang e kha bongsakuh nan, a rah a khui hae paw kya-e looh kha ae nan, a ci. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukeiccuze awkhua ccyh khe ccungccaw hae kha ka hopah hae zah, zete ccyh kya ka zu tuh a chih. Te awkhualan awkhua tuh kawpya ka thua thyhte ka cyih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tetuh ccungccaw hae nynh kae kha, “E na cyipaw hynh kaening hanlan paw suilan mou cipaw nae hopah lan khyh tou?” cite yn khia hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Te minmin kha ka hopya hae: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua: <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel hae kha hopah hae, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Na lysakunaw oh paw nae huhan, nae mit lungtuanaw te nae thinlung nynh a rypaw ka beikinnthyaa kha the ka thyasah cih; na cciataw oh paw nae ccanung hae te nae ccapaw hae tuh thaloi te a chih cih hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Te ka cyi hawte na cyih cih oh; nae mung palung lang e tuh na bongkuh lan khyh oh, a rah a khui hae paw kya-e looh kha na ae lan khyh oh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Nae pungde kha na khungkuh cih oh zah nae phanah kha na nawkuh cih oh; na rah na khui lan khyh oh, nae hoyleinaw keiccuze na zo na dae cih oh zah, lu kheit te lu kheit hawkhaekute na umnuakuh cih oh. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tetuh Ezekiel tuh nanning elang muihsahnaw athua cih; aning nynh a cyi hawte na cyihbua cih oh. E hynh he yn cyihkuh te, Bawipaw PACHIA ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, mih rhawlungrua, mih lungtuanaw te mih phu-enaw, myarya a do ry hae paw te mih thinlung nynh a rypaw kha thuasah, mih ccanung hae te mih ccapaw hae kha thuasah ka lawpya hae ccyh yn thua tetuh, <verse number="26" style="v" />a luepaw lukhakheit nynh na kya yn thua cih zah, nang kha the ae thaesah cih. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh yn luetupaw kalan khe na khalang na aw cih zah, yccae leite um vae leite bya na hopah vae cih. Tuhcite minmin hanlan nang tuh muihsahnaw na thua cih; te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ammon Honuapaw Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.1-7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:1-6">Jer 49.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 21:28-32">Eze 21.28-32</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:13-15">Amo 1.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:8-11">Zef 2.8-11</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, na mae kha Ammon hae kalan hawi lah, profehbya honua hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ammon hae kha hopya tua hae, Bawipaw PACHIA bya kha ngaetua oh: Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Thethyasah athuapaw ka beikinnthyaa kha thuasah, ccungccaw daesah athuapaw Israel ram kha thuasah, kyngte ramccang lang cciakhae athuapaw Judah hae kha thuasah nanning nynh he na muih oh te, nae lungrythua keiccuze, <verse number="4" style="v" />nanning kha nithua lang e ccungccaw hae kalan kae ap cih oh. Minmin nynh nanning laku kya mih ryahmin kha ae tahnuakuh cih oh zah, nanning laku khe mih bu hae kha ae saknua cih oh; nae thingthae kha ae aepah cih oh zah, nae vaetua mateitui kha ae niapah cih oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Rabbah khua kha kalauh hae paeenaw lang ka rae cih zah Ammon ram kha tuukhia lang ka rae cih. Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawccecize Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Nanning nynh Israel ram kha rawsete nae kuih na bianua oh, na ccu na suanuakuh oh zah eiungte nae lungtua keiccuze, <verse number="7" style="v" />ka kuih kae dyngnua vae oh zah, minphuin ccangpaw hae kalan luadepaw uccaw hawte kae ap cih oh. Minphuin ccangpaw hae kyate nanning kha kae vua cih oh zah, ram hae kyate kae maemih cih oh; nanning kha kae roh cih oh. Tetuh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Moab Honuapaw Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Moab nynh, Judah hae tuh minphuin ccangpaw hae balyn te alokuh, cite a ho keiccuze,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.8-11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 15:1-16:14">Isa 15.1—16.14</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 25:10-12">25.10-12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:1-47">Jer 48.1-47</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 2:1-3">Amo 2.1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:8-11">Zef 2.8-11</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Moab tuh ram akin-akae, ramri kya-e khua hae kyate tho zah ram phu-enaw athua hae paw Beth-jeshimoth, Baal-meon te Kiriathaim khua hae kha rhaw hae ka tuksah cih hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Moab te Ammon ram kha nithua lang e ccungccaw hae kalan ka pya cih hae. Tukeiccuze Ammon tuh minphuin hae laku kya liathui thua vae lan khyh, <verse number="11" style="v" />Moab ram kha bya ka pia cih. Tetuh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Edom Honuapaw Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Edom nynh Judah hae tungvaw phulah ry zah rawsete phu a lawnaw kya myarya a sei,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.12-14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:5-17">Isa 34.5-17</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 63:1-6">63.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:7-22">Jer 49.7-22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 35:1-15">Eze 35.1-15</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:11-12">Amo 1.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:1-14">Oba 1-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:2-5">Mal 1.2-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho, Edom kha ka kuih ka dyngnua cih, a kya umpaw ccungccaw te sarangpaw hae kha ka roh cih zah, ccungccaw phe ka daesah cih; Teman khua kyate Dedan khua kyacia thaloi te a chih cih hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka ccungccaw Israel kuih khate Edom kha phu ka lah cih; ka thinrianaw te ka thin-unaw thyhte minmin nynh Edom tungvaw a cyih cih hae; minmin nynh phu ka lawpaw kha a nyh cih hae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Filistin Honuapaw Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Filistin hae nynh adae kho leipaw rhawkunaw khate phulawnaw kha rae hae zah, eiungnaw thinlung khate ro khylan a liaru hae,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.15-17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:29-31">Isa 14.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="JER 47:1-7">Jer 47.1-7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3.4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:6-8">Amo 1.6-8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:4-7">Zef 2.4-7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:5-7">Zek 9.5-7</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho, Filistin kha ka kuih ka dyngnua cih, Kereth hae kha ka vua cih hae zah, rili kin kya a laehy hae paw kha ka roh cih hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Myarya ccihpaw detahnaw khate minmin kha phu ka lah cih hae. Te minmin kha phu he ka lah hae te, minmin nynh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Tair Honuapaw Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum haw lae kheitnaw, sawpaw masaty nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.1—28.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Isa 23.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3.4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amo 1.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:1-4">Zek 9.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:21-22">Mat 11.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:13-14">Luk 10.13-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Tair nynh Jerusalem konglang kha ho zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Alei! Minphuin hae koikua athuapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem tuh aroh vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">a thuakaw hae tuh ka hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ahungkuh vae; kae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">houhouh ka hoirum vae cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">atu aning tuh aroh vae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou Tair, nang kha kae rawse!</para>
  <para style="q2">Rili nynh tuileih kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a thosah hawte, nang rawsete</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin patae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thosakuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Minmin nynh Tair kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">khualungrua kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a roh cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a innhangpaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a phou cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">A laenoi kha phe thyaa lan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka phi cih zah</para>
  <para style="q1">lung ccite a umpaw lang</para>
  <para style="q2">ka rae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rili ngaelung kya miabu reinawpaw hmin lang</para>
  <para style="q2">ka tangsah cih.</para>
  <para style="m">Kae nynh phe ka ho vae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tair tuh minphuin hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a luade hae paw lang a tang cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ram lungkhu e khua hae kya</para>
  <para style="q2">um hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi te chia athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="m">Tetuh minmin nynh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Siapharan hae siapharan athuapaw thahlang e Babilon Siapharan Nebukhadnezzar kha marang hae, marangle hae, marang rhawkaw hae, athungpaw te huhan a hoipaw rhawkawphu ryte Tair khua lang ka cciakhae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ram lungkhu e khua hae kya</para>
  <para style="q2">um hae paw kha aning nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">thaloi te a theih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Aning nynh rhawlungrua kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ae raenua cih, marung kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ae thaekhaw cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">khawriaphua kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ae hangnua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na khualungrua kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thingtung khate a tingsah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na innhangpaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a hae khate a tya cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A marang hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya alung hae keiccuze,</para>
  <para style="q1">vuiping nynh nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ae bong cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Aroh vae paw khuapi</para>
  <para style="q2">lungkhu lang tee hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">aning nynh na koikua hae kya</para>
  <para style="q2">he a tee te, marang rhawkaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">leccu hae te marangle hae roi keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">na khualungrua tuh ahy cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A marang ccukoh hae khate</para>
  <para style="q2">na laanpi balyn kha a syde cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Na ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi te a theih cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">tynkarangpaw na tung hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi kya a khuliakuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na hoirumnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ae luade cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">na uccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ae lawpakuh cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">na khualungrua kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a tingsah cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ahoypaw na inn hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a roh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Na lung hae, thingphe hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi hae kha tui lungkhu lang</para>
  <para style="q2">a phung cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hlaw na sahpaw roi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka daesah cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">na tintang roi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thae thua vae lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:22">Bya 18.22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang kha lung ccakaepaw lang</para>
  <para style="q2">kae rae cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">miabu reinawpaw hmin lang</para>
  <para style="q2">na tang cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang kha papinmaw raethui</para>
  <para style="q2">na thua vae lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ka ho vae, cite</para>
  <para style="q1">Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh Tair kha hynhte a hopya: Na lungkhu kya ccungccaw chianaw um zah, vaemaw mue hae paw nynh he a hawkhaekuh hae te, na khuliakupaw roi keiccuze rili kin um hae paw tuh thyngku leite a um cih hae zawtou? <verse number="16" style="v" />Tetuh rili kya-e uktu bawi balyn tuh mih bawitungkhung kyate a rung cih hae; mih angkiccua te kou puithya lan ccaanpaw mih boeining kha a khahkuh cih hae. Boeining kha thyngku biate a lawkuh cih hae zah laekhu kya a haung cih hae; atu te atu a thyngkuh cih hae zah, na tungvaw acyihkuhpaw keiccuze a siikuh cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.16-18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:9-10">Bya 18.9-10</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Minmin tuh nang na hanlan mih ngaethah cih zah nang kha:</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou a minthaanpaw khuapi,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaekheih lyaze rili kya</para>
  <para style="q2">athungpaw khuapi,</para>
  <para style="q1">ri lan a umnaw kha ram pynpi kya</para>
  <para style="q2">phe a biasahpaw khuapi,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang te na kya um hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">pawtemou rili hae kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">phe na zo oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na khuliaku nin khe</para>
  <para style="q2">rili kin e ram hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a thyngkuh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">nang nynh na zo keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">rili lungkhu umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">tuikoih hae tuh a siikuh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Ccungccaw a um leipaw khuapi hawte nang kha ccungccaw adaepaw khuapi lang kae rae zah, rili kha na tungvaw lang thuakhaete, tui alepaw te nang kha he kae vusah te, <verse number="20" style="v" />langmaw lyaze Hunghua lungkhu lang a rungbung hae paw ccungccaw hae kalan khe nang kha kae nangde cih, langmawlya te roh hae zah Hunghua lungkhu lang a cceihbung hae paw ryte lae kaw khe kae umsah kheih cih oh, tuhteze nynh na kyakhe khuasahpaw ccungccaw um lan khyh zah ahiin hae paw ram kya umnaw hmin na hoi lan khyh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ri lan umpaw athangnaw kalan khe kae thuakhae cih zah, nang tuh na um vae lan khyh; nang kha ccung zemah papinmaw muih na thua vae lan khyh, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:21">Bya 18.21</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Tair hanlan Ngaethyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Tair hanlan rawkhuite um lah, <verse number="3" style="v" />rili kin umpaw khua, rili kin e ram patae kya-e ccungccaw hae nynh kungkunaw hae khua athuapaw Tair kha hopya tua, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou Tair, nang nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Kae tuh ka puithyanaw</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ccing,” cite na ho vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na ramri tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">rili hae ngaelung nynh a um;</para>
  <para style="q2">nang ae raetu hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">na puithyanaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ccing lan ae rae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Senir ram e maeccaw ku hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na thingphe lang a sue hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">kohlung boei tung rae nawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">Lebanon ram e sidar ku kha a law hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bashan ram e phaesi thing khate</para>
  <para style="q2">na kohlung zawnawpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">accong kha a rae hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">Saipras e maeccaw ku khate</para>
  <para style="q1">na kohlung suarui kha rae hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">saepanua khate a ccaan hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kohlung kya zopaw boei tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Izip ram kya-e kou puithya lan</para>
  <para style="q1">ccaanpaw boei ahoypaw</para>
  <para style="q2">thua zah, na kohlung kya</para>
  <para style="q1">asaekuhpaw alan hawte nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">na kohlung kya adawkuhpaw boei tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">Elishah tuikoih kyate thuakhaepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">meizong te sephaphuhpaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sidon khua te Arvad khua kya</para>
  <para style="q2">um hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">na kohlung a zawtu nynh thua hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">na kyakhe ryalaw athyapaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hae um hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin tuh na kohlung</para>
  <para style="q2">a zawtu nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gebal piccan hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">mih kuihhae ahoypaw</para>
  <para style="q1">kohlung raetu hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na kya a um hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">rili kya-e sanphalung balyn te</para>
  <para style="q2">a zuitu hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">nang te uccaw reku khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">na kya a um hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Paras<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paras tuh Persia cipaw nynh thua.</char></note>, Lud<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lud tuh Lidia cipaw nynh thua. </char></note> te Put<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Put tuh Libia cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> minphuin hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na rhawkawphu, athungpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">na rhawkaw hae kya a umbua hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin nynh khawriaphua te</para>
  <para style="q1">lukhung kha ae saepah hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">phu-enaw kha ae pya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Arvad hae te na rhawkaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na khualungrua po voilu lan</para>
  <para style="q1">rhaw ae viapya hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">Gamad hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">na innhangpaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">rhaw ae viapya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Mih the bawng hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na khualungrua po voilu lan</para>
  <para style="q1">a baw hae; na puithyanaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ccing lan ae raepya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na sisua tuh myaryamaw lung zah, Tarshish khua ryte uccaw reku bungthungnaw kha na rae oh; phua, sivaw, ccephui, kuee kha na kungku kya yn thuakhae zah na rulaeku oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Javan, Tubal te Meshek hae ryte uccaw kungkunaw kha na raekheih oh; see te sohin angphe hae kha ae zuapya hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Beth-togarmah hae te nang tuh marang hae, rhawtuknawpaw marang hae te lann hae kha rulaekunaw na rae oh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Rhodes hae ryte uccaw kungkunaw kha na raekheih oh; rili kin e ram hae tuh nang nynh uccaw na zuanaw hmin nynh thua hae; minmin nynh saepanua te thing manpaw kha amee lang nang ae pya hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Na uccaw alung keiccuze Edom te nang tuh uccaw kungkunaw kha na raekheih oh; lung hinpaw, sephaphuhpaw boeining, kou puithya lan ccaanpaw boeining, ahoypaw boeining, koral lung te patamia lung khate na uccaw kha na rulaeku oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah te Israel ram khate mah uccaw kungkunaw kha na raekheih oh; Minnith kyate apoupaw chanvuih, ccaw, khoitui, chitui te balm phi kha ae zuapya hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Na sisua aphuinphuin tuh myaryamaw alung keiccuze Damaskas te mah nang tuh uccaw kungkunaw kha na raekheih oh—Helbon misutui te tuuming rawpaw kha ae pya hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Vedan te Uzal kya-e Javan nynh nang te uccaw kungkunaw a rae hae; sivaw, kassia thing te ccazung epaw kha na re hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Dedan nynh marang cciku ze dekupaw kha ae zuapya. <verse number="21" style="v" />Arabia ram te Kedar bawi hae balyn tuh tuutaw hae, tuutepaw hae te miaa hae kha kungkunaw na raekheih oh zah hoyte na ccuepeku oh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Sheba te Raamah kya-e kungku hae ryte uccaw kungkunaw kha na raekheih oh; ahoy huaccepaw mynkhuhpaw aphuinphuin, amee rupaw lung te sui kha na rulaeku oh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Haran, Kanneh, Eden, Sheba kungku hae, Asshur te Khilmad hae nynh mah nang te uccaw kungkunaw kha a rae hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahoypaw boeining hae, meizong boeining hae, kou hoy lan ccaanpaw boeining, azong aphuinphuin te ccaanpaw uccaw, khyndadyh lan arui te heedepaw uccaw hae kha kungkunaw na raekheih oh. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tarshish sanphalung hae tuh na uccaw phupyate na kalan oun cceih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.25-36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:11-19">Bya 18.11-19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">Tukeiccuze nang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">rili ngaelung kya myarya ripaw</para>
  <para style="q2">phupaw te phe na beih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kohlung zawtu hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha rili lungkhu khe</para>
  <para style="q1">ae cciakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Nithua lang e khisan nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha rili ngaelung khe</para>
  <para style="q2">ae ro vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na sisua hae, na uccaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">zuathyapaw na uccaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">na kohlung zuitu hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">na kohlung a zawtu hae te</para>
  <para style="q1">a raethuitu hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">na uccaw a zua a retu hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">na kya umpaw rhawkaw balyn te</para>
  <para style="q2">na umkheih oh paw</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw aphu balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha ro na thua nin khe</para>
  <para style="q2">rili ngaelung kya a ccah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na kohlung a zawtu hae kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">siaruanaw roi keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">anaenaw umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khua hae tuh ahy hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kohlung zawtu balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih kohlung hae kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">atolang a rung hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Kohlung a zuitu hae te</para>
  <para style="q1">a zawtu balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">varang langkhe thadyn hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />nang na hanlan accae lante</para>
  <para style="q2">rah hae zah thawte a sia hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Mih lu vawlan vuiping phingkuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">buhhaw kya a toukuh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />nang na keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">mih sang kha okuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">buriboei kha a zingku hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang na hanlan mih thinlung</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ccih lante thawte a rah a khui hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nang na hanlan ngaethyate</para>
  <para style="q2">rah hae zah:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Rili ngaelung kya Tair hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">aroh boi paw hummou a um?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Rili laanpi kyate na uccaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">he yn thua te, ccungccaw patae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">mih lungry na ccingsah hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya lungpaw na sisua te</para>
  <para style="q1">na zuapaw uccaw hae khate</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi siapharan hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na hoirumsah hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Atu tuh tui akhunaw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">rili khate ro na thua vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">na zuapaw uccaw hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">kohlung kya-e na ccungccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">namaw ryte na phungkuh vae oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Rili kin um hae paw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">nang keiccuze a siikuh vae hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih siapharan hae tuh myarya rih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih maesue kya mih rinaw alangkuh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Minphuin patae laku e</para>
  <para style="q2">kungku hae nynh nang kha</para>
  <para style="q1">saryanaw roi ae sawnua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">nang tuh myarya ri lan umpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">athangnaw kya na thua vae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae na zo vae cih,” a ci hae.</para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Tair Siapharan Rawsenaw Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Tair uktu bawi kha hopya tua, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Lysakunaw thinlung na hoi zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Kae tuh pachia nynh ka thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">rili ngaelung kya,</para>
  <para style="q2">pachia hae haungnaw kya</para>
  <para style="q1">ka haung,” na ci,</para>
  <para style="q2">pachia hawte na tuaku zemah</para>
  <para style="q1">pachia na thua khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw nynh na thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang tuh Daniel laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">na hawhua ccaccing;</para>
  <para style="q1">nang na malang phei khopaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">thuruh khopaw um khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />na hawnaw te na nythyanaw liate</para>
  <para style="q2">sisua patae na tungku vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">na sisua bawng lungkhu khe</para>
  <para style="q2">sui te ngun kha na sueluaku vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kungkunaw kya myarya na haw liate</para>
  <para style="q2">na sisua kha na lungthungsaku vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e na sisua keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">lysakunaw thinlung na hoi vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">namaw toulou kha pachia hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">na tuaku keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />minphuin hae kyaze ri lan um huaccepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ramccang hae kha kae konua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh aphutepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">na hawnaw kha mih thaloi</para>
  <para style="q1">ae thuaanuakuh cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na lesaenaw kha a thusah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nang kha Hunghua lungkhu lang</para>
  <para style="q2">ae tuu cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">rili ngaelung khe</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya ccihpaw chinaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">na chih cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang ae theih hae paw kuih kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">nang tuh pachia thua leite,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw mang na thua pite,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang ae theihtu hae malang khe</para>
  <para style="q1">“Kae tuh pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thua,” cite na ho ung cih tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vingdungawkuh lei hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a chi hae hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">ramccang hae kuih khate na chih cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize Bawipaw PACHIA nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">phe ka ho vae, a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Tair Siapharan tungvaw Ngaethyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuhpiaze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="12" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Tair siapharan hanlan na ngaethah sah lah, aning kha hopya tua, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang tuh ccingnaw tazeih nynh na thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">hawnaw te phe na beih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">na puithyanaw tuh phe accing.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang tuh Pachia khokhu,</para>
  <para style="q2">Eden kya na um;</para>
  <para style="q1">aphutepaw lung</para>
  <para style="q2">aphuinphuin khate na ccaanku,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e lung hae tuh patamia, khrisolaih,</para>
  <para style="q2">awrarihpaw lung, topaz, beryl,</para>
  <para style="q1">oniks, jasper, nilar lung,</para>
  <para style="q2">karbankal te emeral lung nynh thua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">sui te raepaw uccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na hoi.</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang kha rae na thua nin khe</para>
  <para style="q2">khah-e hae kha na hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">paccynpya athua vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chitui thuh athuapaw cherub kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nang ae rintu lang kae nungpya;</para>
  <para style="q1">nang tuh athyaapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia mua vawlan khe na um;</para>
  <para style="q1">phaephae akpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">lung hae laku khe na cceih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na pui nin kyate na tungvaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyleinaw muih athua mawlaezung</para>
  <para style="q2">na cyisahnaw tuh ccaenaw um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na kungkunaw tuh myarya</para>
  <para style="q2">alung keiccuze puathonaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">phe na beih zah na sei vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">tukeiccuze nang kha</para>
  <para style="q1">athyaa leipaw uccaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia mua kyate kae vua,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang ae rintu cherub nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">phaephae akpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">lung hae laku kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha ccaring ae dee.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na puithya keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">na thinlung tuh alysakuh;</para>
  <para style="q1">na minthaannaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">na hawnaw kha na roku.</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang kha laekhu lang kae vua;</para>
  <para style="q2">siapharan hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha dote</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lungpaw ccaw cite</para>
  <para style="q2">mih malang khe kae nung.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahme leipaw kung na kunaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">na hoyleinaw alung keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">na beikinnthyaa hae kha na thusah.</para>
  <para style="q2">Tukeiccuze na lungkhu kya</para>
  <para style="q1">maee ka tyh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha maee te kae u,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang ae muih hae paw balyn malang khe</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha buhhaw lang kae tangsah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Minphuin hae laku</para>
  <para style="q2">nang ae nyhpaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">nang keiccuze a siikuh hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">nang tuh ri lan umpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">athangnaw kya na thua vae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae na zo vae cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Sidon kha Rawsenaw Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.20-26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3.4-8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:1-2">Zek 9.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:21-22">Mat 11.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:13-14">Luk 10.13-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Sidon khua langkhe hawi lah, profehbya kha hynhte honua tua, <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou Sidon, nang kha kae rawse,</para>
  <para style="q2">na ngaelung khe</para>
  <para style="q1">phu-enaw ka mue cih.</para>
  <para style="q2">Sidon khua kha bya ka pia zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thyaanaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">he ka langsakuh te,</para>
  <para style="q1">kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char></para>
  <para style="q2">ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sidon khua kha</para>
  <para style="q2">shethya ka sawnua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">khua lungkhu e laanpi hae kya</para>
  <para style="q2">chiise ka luasah cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">khua kha voilute</para>
  <para style="q2">a rawsepaw thaloi keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">michi hae tuh khua ngaelung khe</para>
  <para style="q2">a khuliakuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tetuh minmin nynh kae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel hae nynh minmin a dothatheih hae paw mih innpaw hae balyn kyakhe athuingthyapaw hinpawbu te hinpaw ahepaw kha muih vae lan khyh hae. Te minmin nynh kae tuh Bawipaw PACHIA ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Israel hanlan Malang Hythuanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Israel hae kha phiariphiarae nung athuanaw minphuin hae kyate he ka suelua hae te, ka ryalahtu Jakob ka pyapaw mimaw laephi kyakhe a um cih hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuin kyakhe khyndadyh lan a um cih hae, inn a sakkuh cih hae zah misu khokhu kha a raekuh cih hae. Minmin kha a la dothatheih hae paw mih innpaw hae balyn tungvaw bya he ka pia hae te, minmin tuh khyndadyh lan a um cih hae. Tetuh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia ka thuapaw kha minmin nynh a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Izip Rawsenaw Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum hawnaw, sawpaw sah hawnaw, nin haw lae ning nin khe, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29.1—32.32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:1-25">Isa 19.1-25</ref>; <ref loc="JER 46:2-26">Jer 46.2-26</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Izip siapharan Faro kha na mae hawinua lah, amaw te Izip ram pynpi kha profehbya honua tua; <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou Izip siapharan Faro,</para>
  <para style="q2">a vawpi hae ngaelung khe</para>
  <para style="q2">a kuih a ccu tharae zo zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Nal vawpi tuh ka kya-e nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">e vawpi hynh kamaw hanlan ka raeku,”</para>
  <para style="q1">cite a hopaw nakaa-hupi,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha kae rawse.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngasabaw khate na khaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kae baw cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na vawpi hae kya-e ngasaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na kaleih kya ka besakuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Na vawpi hae kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha ccaring kae sue cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na vawpi hae kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">ngasaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na kaleih kya a bekuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang te na vawpi hae kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">ngasaw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ramkaw langkhe kae vua cih oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">nang tuh ramkaw khe na chih cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha ae khuing lan khyh hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ae uh lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang kha laephi kya-e sarangpaw hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">khivae kya-e pavaw hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">looh lang ka pya vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tetuh Izip ram um hae paw balyn nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char></para>
  <para style="q1">ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 36:6">Isa 36.6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize nang tuh Israel hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">phaeku hoitang nynh na thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />mih kuih te ae kyng vae hae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang tuh na khya zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih raw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thoh na pae hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">na kya a ngeiku vae hae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang tuh na khya zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih kuih mih ccu balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na tynsah khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw tuh: Na kalan thaloi ka thuasah cih zah, ccungccaw te sarangpaw hae kha ka bae cih hae; <verse number="9" style="v" />Izip ram tuh ccungccaw adae cih zah alakawpaw lang a tang cih. Tetuh minmin nynh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">Nang nynh, “Nal vawpi tuh ka kya-e nynh thua, ka raekupaw nynh thua,” na ci keiccuze <verse number="10" style="v" />nang te na vawpi hae kha kae rawse oh, Izip ram kha Migdol kyate Sai-en cia, Ethiopia ramri phe thua lan, alakawpaw te ccungccaw phe adaepaw lang ka rae cih. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ccungccaw te sarangpaw nynh tuin ram kya po cceih lan khyh hae; kum sung pali lungkhu pawpaw nynh mah umnah lan khyh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ccungccaw phe adaepaw ram hae laku khe Izip ram kha ccungccaw adaepaw lang ka rae cih; Izip khuapi hae tuh arohpaw khuapi hae laku khe kum sung pali lungkhu arohpaw lang a tang cih hae. Izip hae kha minphuin hae kyakhe phiariphiarae ka nung cih hae zah, ram hae kyakhe ka phiasakuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuhzemah Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Kum sung pali accing te, Izip hae kha phiariphiarae a umnaw hae minphuin hae kyate ka suelua cih hae; <verse number="14" style="v" />Izip hae kha ka kikhae cih hae zah, mih thokeinaw ram, Pathros ram langkhe ka kisah cih hae; tuin kyakhe ram nyaapaw lang a tang cih hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ram hae laku kya Izip tuh anyaa huaccepaw ram lang a tang cih zah, minphuin hae luki papin sang vae lan khyh; minmin tuh minphuin ccangpaw hae kha papin bua a uk leipaw ditarawpaw lang ka rae cih hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Izip hae tuh Israel hae nynh doliakupaw lang papin tangthui vae lan khyh hae; bawmnaw mue khylan Izip hae kalan a la maeku hae paw mih hoyleinaw kha Israel hae nynh a tuathui cih hae. Tetuh minmin nynh kae tuh Bawipaw PACHIA ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Babilon nynh Izip A Thiing Cih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kum kuin lae sarinaw, sawpaw sah kheitnaw, masaty nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="18" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Babilon Siapharan Nebukhadnezzar nynh a rhawkaw hae tuh Tair kha thawte rhaw a tuksah hae; rhawkaw miakaw tuh mih lu-o zah, mih raw pong kuakuh; tuhzemah aning te a rhawkaw hae tuh Tair dounaw mee kha Tair kyate paw sanmah mue khyh hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Izip ram kha Babilon Siapharan Nebukhadnezzar ka pya cih; aning nynh Izip sisua kha luadete a lawkuh cih zah a phukuh cih; tuh-e tuh a rhawkaw hae mih ryalaw mee lang a tang cih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Thawte rya a lawnaw mee lang Izip ram kha aning ka pya vae, pawccecize minmin nynh ka hanlan rya a law hae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuin nin khe Israel hae hanlan aki ka saesah cih zah, nang kha minmin laku kya byahonaw kaw kae pya cih. Tetuh minmin nynh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Izip hanlan Rawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, profehbya hotua, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ezou, yn thuapaw nin hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya lan kou um!” cite rah oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize nin tuh anae vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nin tuh anae vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e nin tuh mae-ui nin,</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ronaw nin athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Izip kya thaloi te chiakunaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a um cih zah, Ethiopia ram kya</para>
  <para style="q1">lungriathaenaw a um cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">chiapaw ccungccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">Izip ram kya he a chih hae te,</para>
  <para style="q2">a uccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ccaring cciakhaepya athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">athonaw aleihpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ropya athua cih.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ethiopia, Put, Lud te Arabia balyn, Libia ram e ccungccaw hae, a pankheih hae paw ram kya-e ccungccaw hae tuh minmin ryte thaloi te a chih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">Izip kha a bawm hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">a chih cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Izip nynh a lysakunawpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccahbung cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">Migdol kyate Sai-en cia</para>
  <para style="q1">thaloi te a chih cih hae, cite</para>
  <para style="q2">Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ccangpaw arohpaw ram hae kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">Izip hae tuh aroh cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih khuapi hae tuh arohpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khuapi hae kya a umbua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Izip ram kha maee ka tyhnua zah</para>
  <para style="q2">Izip a bawm hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">he a roh hae te,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh, pawningkhua a nyh lei hae paw Ethiopia hae kha mih rikawthuasah khylan ka saw hae paw locceihtu hae tuh sanphalung te a cceih cih hae; Izip ram a ro nin khe lungriathaenaw nynh mih tungvaw a thuanua cih hae; pawccecize tuh-e ccyh tuh anae vae!</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Babilon Siapharan Nebukhadnezzar kuih khate</para>
  <para style="q2">Izip zapi hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ka thangsah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Minphuin hae kyaze</para>
  <para style="q2">ri lan um huaccepaw</para>
  <para style="q1">Nebukhadnezzar te</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">Izip ram ro khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">cciakhae athua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">Izip ram kha thaloi</para>
  <para style="q2">a thuaanuakuh cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">a chia hae paw michi rhua khate</para>
  <para style="q2">ram kha phe a biasah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vawpi hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kansah cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">ram kha hoyleinaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a rae hae paw kuih kalan ka zua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">ramccang hae kuih khate</para>
  <para style="q2">ram te ram lungkhu e</para>
  <para style="q1">atyn-are kya ronaw ka thuasah cih.</para>
  <para style="q2">Kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ka ho vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">Zohtuh hae kha ka roh cih zah</para>
  <para style="q1">Memfis kya umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">azuh hae kha phe ka thangsah cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">Izip ram kya uktu bawi</para>
  <para style="q2">um vae lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhcite Izip ram kya</para>
  <para style="q2">rinaw ka umsah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathros ram kha ka roh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Zoan khua kha maee te ka soi cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">Thebes khua tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">byapianaw ka rae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Izip ram kyaze athung huapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Pelusium khua tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thinrianaw ka bu cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Thebes zapi hae kha ka theih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Izip ram kha maee te ka soi cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">Pelusium khua tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">riathaenaw myarya a teing cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">Thebes khua kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">khualungrua tuh ating cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Memfis tuh khuadae ccyh kya heize</para>
  <para style="q2">rhaw hae nynh a tuk cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />On khua te Pi-beseth khua e</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangvae hae tuh thaloi te a chih cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">khuapi hae tuh kyngku khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">mimaw nynh a cceih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Izip uknaw kha he ka roh te,</para>
  <para style="q2">Tehafnehes khua kya</para>
  <para style="q1">khuadae tuh phe amoh cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">a lysakunaw tuh phe athang cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">khuapi kha maeking te</para>
  <para style="q2">bong athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccanung athua hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">khua hae kha kyngte</para>
  <para style="q2">cciakhae athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuhcite Izip tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">byapianaw ka rae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tetuh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char></para>
  <para style="q2">ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Faro Rawsenaw Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kum haw lae kheitnaw, masaty sawpaw, nin sari nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="21" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Izip siapharan Faro kuih kha ka khya vae; thaloi kyng lan ciate a thawsae ccaw cite a vaemaw a dan nawlan heepya thua khyh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Izip siapharan Faro kha ka rawse, athungpaw a kuih te khya athua vae paw a kuih kha parouhte ka khya cih hae zah, a kuih kyate thaloi kha ka ccawsah cih. <verse number="23" style="v" />Izip hae kha minphuin hae laku kya phiariphiarae ka nung cih hae zah, ram hae kya ka phiasakuh cih hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Babilon siapharan kuih kha a thaw ka saesah cih zah, ka thaloi kha a kuih kya ka nung cih; thuasalama Faro kuih kha tuh ka khya cih zah, vaemaw keiccu vyavya chihpaw nynh a hawkhaeku hawte Babilon siapharan malang khe a hawkhaekuh cih. <verse number="25" style="v" />Babilon siapharan kuih kha a thaw ka saesah cih, thuasalama Faro kuih tuh accahbung cih. Ka thaloi kha Babilon siapharan kuih kya he ka nung te, minmin nynh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae. Aning nynh Izip ram kha tuh-e thaloi tuh a hangnua cih, <verse number="26" style="v" />Izip hae kha minphuin hae laku kya phiariphiarae ka nung cih hae zah ram hae kya ka phiasakuh cih hae. Tetuh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ahangpaw Sidar Ku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum haw lae kheitnaw, sawpaw sah thumnaw, masaty nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Izip siapharan Faro te a ccungccaw zapi hae kha hopah hae:</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang tuh na lesae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">hum te mou na loku oh?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Assiria khuh dotua,</para>
  <para style="q2">Lebanon kya a umpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">sidar thing te nynh aloku,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e thing akaran hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">puithya zah anaw abung,</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya hang zah adung tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">maeking phe aphah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tui nynh aku kha a lethungsah,</para>
  <para style="q2">lae kaw e tui nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">aku kha hangsah zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">aku aponaw pepan khe</para>
  <para style="q1">vaw hae kha a luasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ramkaw e thingku balyn kalan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">vaw taraw hae tuh alua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuhcite ramkaw e</para>
  <para style="q2">thingku balyn laeze</para>
  <para style="q1">ahanghua; atoihnaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">tui alung keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">ange hae tuh lethung zah</para>
  <para style="q2">akaran hae tuh myarya asae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khivae kya-e pavaw balyn nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ange hae kyakhe bu a luaku hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ramkaw e sarangpaw balyn nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">akaran hae kaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">mih taw than hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin lepaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a mynzia kya a um hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuh-e thingku tuh le zah</para>
  <para style="q2">akaran hae asae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya apuithya;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize tui alungnaw langkhe</para>
  <para style="q2">atharui asah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pachia khokhu kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">sidar ku hae nynh tuh-e thingku tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">rawse kho khyh hae,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:9">Gen 2.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">maeccaw ku hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhcihawpaw ange kha hoi khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">plane thingku hae mah</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e thingkaran hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">touse lan um khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">Pachia khokhu kya</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e thingku hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">apuithyapaw thingku um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuh-e thingku tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">akaran patae khate</para>
  <para style="q1">myarya puithya lan ka rae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia khokhu Eden khokhu kya</para>
  <para style="q1">umpaw thingku balyn nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e thingku tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q1">eiungnaw a hoi hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Tuh-e thingku tuh hang zah adung tuh maeking phe aphah, tuhte a hang pawte a thinlung a lysaku keiccuze, <verse number="11" style="v" />aning kha minphuin hae kya-e bawi hae kuih kalan ka ap vae; a hoyleinaw te ateku thyhte, tuh-e bawi nynh a tungvaw a cyih cih. Tuh-e thingku kha phe ka vua vae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Minphuin kyaze ri lan um huaccepaw ramccang hae nynh tuh-e thingku kha nge hae zah a cciataw vae hae. Mua hae vawlan te accya balyn khe akaran hae tuh ccah hae zah, ange hae tuh ram kya-e vaw taraw hae pe khe khya zah a um hae; laephi ccungccaw balyn tuh a mynzia kyate cceih hae zah tuh-e thingku kha a cciataw hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khivae kya-e pavaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">apupaw akupi vawlan khe a to hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">loramsaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ange hae laku khe a um hae.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />E balyn hynh, tui kin umpaw thingku hae tuh myarya hangpaw aku a um khyh nawlan, mih dungparyh tuh maeking kya phe aphya khyh nawlan, te tui hoyte a muepaw thingku hae tuh tuh-e thingku hae phe phah lan ahangpaw a um khyh nawlan nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuh-e thingku balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Hunghua lungkhu lang</para>
  <para style="q1">a rungbung hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw balyn ryte</para>
  <para style="q1">lae kaw lang, chinaw kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">ap athua hae;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Tuh-e thingku nynh Michi khua lang a cciabung nin khe, akhupaw tui khate ka khawsung zah phang ka bong; a vawpi hae kha ka tingkhaw zah, athawsaepaw a tui hae kha ka luasah khyh. Tuh-e thingku a chi keiccuze Lebanon kha ngaethyanaw boeining ka lawsahku, ramkaw e thingku balyn tuh tuh-e thingku keiccuze phe arou hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Hunghua lungkhu lang a cceihbung hae paw ryte tuh-e thingku kha Michi khua lang he ka vuabung tuh, a ccawpaw roi khate minphuin hae kha ka thyngsaku hae; Eden kya umpaw thingku hae, Lebanon thingku ahoy huaccepaw te aphute huaccepaw, tui hoyte a muepaw thingku balyn tuh lae kaw khe lungdaenaw pya athua hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Minmin mah tuh-e thingku ryte thuasah, tuh-e thingku te a hobung hae paw ryte thuasah, minphuin hae laku kya tuh-e thingku mynzia kya a um hae paw ryte thuasah Michi khua lang, thaloi te chia athua hae paw kalan a cceihbung hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Eden kya umpaw thingku hae lakuze phu-enaw te lesaenaw kyaze teihynhmou nang te alokuh? Atu nang tuh Eden kya umpaw thingku hae ryte lae kaw lang rungkhae bung na thua cih; nang tuh vingdungawkuh lei hae paw laku, thaloi te chia athua hae paw ryte na huekuh kheih cih oh. E hynh Faro te a ccungccaw zapi balyn nynh athua hae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Faro te Izip elang Rawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum haw lae ningnaw, sawpaw sah haw lae ningnaw, nin kheit nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Izip siapharan Faro hanlan rah lah, hynhte hopya tua:</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang nynh minphuin hae laku kya</para>
  <para style="q2">chindeih hawte namaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">namaw kha na tuaku,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama nang tuh rili kya umpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">nakaa-hupi te nynh na loku oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">vawkhu hae kyakhe tui na zeihku,</para>
  <para style="q1">na ccu te tui kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na thesakuh zah na nuihsah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">Minphuin patae</para>
  <para style="q1">a pumkunaw hae kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">ka miabu khate nang kha</para>
  <para style="q1">kae bong cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">miabu ryte kae suebia cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang kha lae vawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">kae vua cih zah, ramkaw khe</para>
  <para style="q1">phah kae deihnah cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">azouthyapaw pavaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na tungvaw ka ccusah cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi pynpi e loramsaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe byn lan ka dang cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na ngesaw kha mua hae vawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">phiariphiarae ka nung cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">accya hae kha na rhua khate</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ka biasah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aluapaw na chiise khate ram kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mua hae vawlan kyacia</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ciasah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">vawkhu hae tuh na chiise te</para>
  <para style="q2">phe abeih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang kha he kae roh te,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaawlui kha ka bong cih zah</para>
  <para style="q1">awsi hae kha ka mohsah cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">khuanin kha maeking te</para>
  <para style="q1">ka khawsah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">sawpaw nynh a awnaw kha pya lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa 13.10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:29">Mat 24.29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-25">Mar 13.24-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25">Luk 21.25</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12-13">Bya 6.12-13</ref>, <ref loc="REV 8:12">8.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na luki vaawlang e</para>
  <para style="q2">awnaw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka mohsah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na ram kha ka mohsah cih, cite</para>
  <para style="qr">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na ny boi leipaw ram hae kalan,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangpaw minphuin hae laku khe</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha kyngte he kae cciakhae lyakhe,</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin patae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lungria ka thaesah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang keiccuze minphuin patae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka siisakuh cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih siapharan hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">nang keiccuze a thyngkuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang na khuliaku nin kya,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thaloi kha mih malang he ka he te,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin lu kheit cci tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih hiinnaw elang</para>
  <para style="q2">palei a thyngkuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon siapharan thaloi nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha ae thuanua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Minphuin hae lakuze</para>
  <para style="q2">ri lan um huacce hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih thawsae hae paw kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi khate</para>
  <para style="q1">na ccungccaw zapi hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka theih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin nynh Izip</para>
  <para style="q2">a lysakunaw kha a roh cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccungccaw zapi balyn tuh a zo cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tui alungnaw pepan a um hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">a sahiin hae balyn kha ka roh cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw ccu nynh thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">sahiinpaw ccu nynh thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">khah-e tui kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nuihsah vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tetuh mih tui kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ccirarih lan ka ccisah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih vawkhu hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">chitui hawte ka luasah cih, cite</para>
  <para style="q2">Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Izip ram kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw phe ka daesah zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ram lungkhu umpaw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">he ka thangsah te, ram lungkhu e</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">de he ka tah hae te,</para>
  <para style="q1">kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char></para>
  <para style="q2">ka thuapaw kha yn nyh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />E hynh rawkhuinaw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">e hynh hlaw lang sah athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">E hynh minphuin hae kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">nopi hae nynh hlaw lang a sah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin nynh Izip te</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccungccaw zapi balyn hanlan</para>
  <para style="q1">hlaw lang a sah cih hae, cite</para>
  <para style="q2">Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Izip hanlan Michi Hlaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kum haw lae ningnaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">masaty sawpaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">nin haw lae pangaw nin khe</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kya yn thua zah:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ccungccapaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">Izip zapi hae hanlan rawtua,</para>
  <para style="q1">Hunghua lungkhu lang</para>
  <para style="q2">a cceihbung hae paw a umnaw hae</para>
  <para style="q1">lae kaw lang e laephipi kalan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">Izip te alesaepaw</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin hae ccanung hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">sawbung tua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Nang tuh ming hae laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">na puithyahua tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Cciabung tua!</para>
  <para style="q2">Vingdungawkuh lei hae paw ryte</para>
  <para style="q2">daebabi lan la umkheih oh!” a ci.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Izip hae tuh thaloi te a chia hae paw laku khe a khuliakuh cih hae. Izip tuh thaloi rhaw kalan ap thua vae zah, a ccungccaw zapi hae ryte parouh mawte kyng hae zah a cciakhae hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />A thawsaepaw rhawbawi nynh Izip te Izip bawmtu hae kong kha Michi khua kyate a ho cih zah: “Minmin tuh a cceihbung vae hae, thaloi te chia athua hae paw, vingdungawkuh lei hae paw minmin tuh a khuliakuh hae,” a ci cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuin kyakhe Assiria tuh a ccungccaw zapi balyn ryte a umbua hae; mih balynte thaloi te chih hae zah, mih shawku tuh Assiaria pepan po voilu lan a um. <verse number="23" style="v" />Mih shawku hae tuh Hunghua akhu huanaw khe a um hae. A ccungccaw hae shawku tuh a shawku pepan khe po voilu lan a um hae, minmin balyn tuh thaloi te chia thua hae zah a khuliakuh hae paw, a hiin hae paw ram kyakhe ri lan umpaw kha a pazaesakuh hae paw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuin kyakhe Elam tuh a um, a shawku pepan balyn khe a ccungccaw zapi balyn kha a uu hae; minmin balyn tuh thaloi te chia thua hae zah a chih hae paw, a hiin hae paw ram kya ri lan umpaw kha a pazaesakuh hae paw, lae kaw lang a rungbung hae paw vingdungawkuh lei hae paw nynh thua hae. Mih maethyanaw kha Hunghua lungkhu lang a rungbung hae paw ryte a teingkheih hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Minmin nynh Elam kha a chia hae paw a ccungccaw zapi balyn laku khe inaw a raepya hae, tuh-e hae shawku tuh a shawku po voilu lan a um, minmin balyn tuh vingdungawkuh lei hae paw, thaloi te a chia hae paw nynh thua hae; pawccecize minmin tuh a hiin hae paw ram kya rinaw a pazaesakuh hae paw thua hae zah, mih maethyanaw kha Hunghua lungkhu lang a rungbung hae paw ryte a teingkheih hae; chia athua hae paw laku khe minmin kha a nung hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuin kyakhe Meshek te Tubal tuh mih ccungccaw hae balyn ryte a um hae, minmin po voilu lan mih ccungccaw hae shawku tuh a um, minmin balyn tuh vingdungawkuh lei hae paw, thaloi te a chia hae paw nynh thua hae; pawccecize minmin nynh a hiin hae paw ram kyakhe rinaw kha a pazaesaku hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Minmin tuh langmawlya e a chih hae paw rhawkaw hae ryte ihkheih khyh hae; Michi khua lang rhawtuknawpaw zunghe ryte a rungbung hae paw tuh-e rhawkaw hae tuh mih thaloi kha mih lu kaw khe nungpah hae zah mih khawriaphua kha mih ru vawlan a khangpya hae; pawccecize tuh-e rhawkaw hae nynh a hiin hae paw ram kya rinaw a umsah hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Nang mah ae khya cih hae zah, vingdungawkuh lei hae paw laku khe, thaloi te a chia hae paw ryte na ihkheih cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuin kyakhe Edom mah a siapharan hae te a bawi hae ryte a umbua, mih thungnaw balyn ryte thaloi te a chia hae paw kya a nungbua hae; vingdungawkuh lei hae paw, Hunghua lungkhu lang a rungbung hae paw ryte a ih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuin kyakhe thahlang e bawi hae te Sidon hae balyn tuh a umbua hae, mih thungnaw liate rinaw balyn kha a langsaku hae keiccuze chia athua hae paw ryte maethyate a rungbung hae; thaloi te a chia hae paw ryte vingdungawkuh lei hae paw thua hae zah a ih hae, Hunghua lungkhu lang a rungbung hae paw ryte maethyanaw a teing hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Faro nynh minmin kha he a muih hae te, thaloi te a chih hae paw a ccungccaw zapi balyn hanlan Faro te a rhawkaw hae balyn tuh mih lungdaehua cih, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. <verse number="32" style="v" />Aning nynh a hiin hae paw ram kya rinaw kha a pazaesaku; tukeiccuze Faro te a ccungccaw hae balyn tuh vingdungawkuh lei hae paw laku khe, thaloi te chia athua hae paw ryte haeungsah athua hae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Rhawviatu Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EZK 3:16-21">Eze 3.16-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />Pou ccungccapaw, ccungccaw hae kha hopya tua hae. Ram ramkhakheit tungvaw thaloi rhaw kha ka thuasah lanze, ram kya-e ccungccaw hae nynh minmin laku e lukhakheit kha rhawviatu lang a nung hae; <verse number="3" style="v" />tuh-e rhawviatu nynh ram kalan yn cceihpaw thaloi rhaw kha he a muih te, mungkae tu zah ccungccaw hae kha raeringnaw a pya hae; <verse number="4" style="v" />lukhakheit nynh tuh-e mungkae roi tuh mang a thae pite raeringku leite um zah, rhaw nynh thuanuate amaw kha a chia lanze, a chiise tuh amaw lu vawlan nynh a um. <verse number="5" style="v" />Mungkae roi kha mang a thae pite a raeringku khyh keiccuze a chiise tuh amaw tungvaw nynh a um. Thuasalama aning nynh a raeringku lanze, a hiinnaw kha a lue cih. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama rhawviatu nynh thaloi rhaw yn thuapaw kha mang a muih pite mungkae kha a tu khyh keiccuze ccungccaw hae tuh raeringku leite um hae zah, thaloi rhaw nynh thuanuate minmin laku e lukhakheit tuh a chi lanze, tuh-e paw tuh amaw a seinaw keiccu nynh a chi, thuasalama a chiise mee tuh rhawviatu kha ka ngia cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, ccungccapaw, nang kha Israel hanlan rhawviatu lang kae rae vae; ka mung kya-e bya kha na thae takyh te minmin kha raeringnaw na pya cih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Kae nynh ccungccaw hoylei hae paw kha, “Pou ccungccaw hoylei hae, na chih ccaccing cih oh,” cite ka hopah hae zah, ccungccaw hoylei hae paw kha mih hoyleinaw kyate maeleihku khylan na hopya khyh hae ze, minmin tuh mih hoyleinaw keiccu a chih cih hae, thuasalama mih chiise mee tuh nang kha kae ngia cih. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama ccungccaw hoylei hae paw kha mih seinaw kyate maeleihku khylan raeringnaw na pya hae zah, mih hiinzia kyate a maeleihku khyh hae ze, minmin tuh mih hoyleinaw keiccu a chih cih hae, thuasalama nang tuh na hiinnaw kha na khumku vae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia Byading te Thawccinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, nang nynh Israel hae kha hynhte hopya tua hae: Nanning nynh, “Aening cyiseinaw te aening seinaw nynh aening kha phang oun ne zah, ah thawthang vae, pawtemou ah hiin kho cih oh?” na ciku oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw tuh, Kae tuh ka hiin thyhte, ccungccaw hoyleipaw nynh a chipaw kha ka lungrythua khyh, thuasalama tuh-e ccungccaw hoyleipaw nynh a hiinzia kyate maeleihkuh zah a hiinpaw kha ka ry; maeleihkuh oh, ahoy leipaw nae hiinzia kyate maeleihkuh oh. Pou Israel hae, pawccemou na chih cih oh? <verse number="12" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, na ccungccaw hae kha hynhte hopah hae, Miding nynh a mesei lanze, a dingnaw nynh amaw kha khum lan khyh; ccungccaw hoyleipaw nynh a hoyleinaw kyate a maeleihku lanze, a hoyleinaw nynh aning kha thykupawkunaw pya lan khyh; miding tuh a sei lanze, hiin kho lan khyh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Miding tuh a hiin ccaccing cih cite ka ho salamah, a dingnaw kha doliakuh zah hoyleinaw a rae lanze, a dingnaw kha tuapya thui thua lan khyh; a la cyipaw hoyleinaw keiccuze aning tuh a chih cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukoute, ccungccaw hoyleipaw kha, “Nang tuh na chih ccaccing cih,” cite ka hopah salamah, a seinaw kyate maeleihkuh zah atazaepaw te ahmepaw kha a cyi ze thuasah, <verse number="15" style="v" />ponpaw uccaw kha lawku leite bua pyathui zah, a luadepaw uccaw kha pyathuite, hoyleinaw kha rae vae leite hiinnaw phunglang kha a zui ze thuasah aning tuh a hiin ccaccing cih zah chih lan khyh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Aning nynh a la raepaw seinaw ccangkheit sanmah liathuipya thua lan khyh; aphung thyhte cyih zah ahmepaw kha a rae keiccuze aning tuh a hiin ccaccing cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuhzemah na ccungccaw hae nynh, “Bawipaw nynh a cyipaw tuh hme khyh,” a ci hae, thuasalama minmin nynh a cyi hae paw khaw hme khyh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Miding nynh a dingnaw kyate maeleihkuh zah hoyleinaw kha a rae lanze, tuh-e hoyleinaw hanlan aning tuh a chih cih. <verse number="19" style="v" />Ccungccaw hoyleipaw nynh a hoyleinaw kyate maeleihkute aphung thyhte cyih zah ahmepaw kha a rae lanze, tuh-e liate aning tuh a hiin cih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuhzemah nanning nynh, “Bawipaw nynh a cyipaw tuh hme khyh,” na ci oh. Pou Israel hae, na cyisahnaw thyhte nanning balyn kha bya kae pia cih oh!</para>
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem Ronaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Oun kyng hae zah oun cciakhaenaw hae te, kum haw lae ningnaw kum, sawpaw sah hawnaw, nin pangaw nin khe Jerusalem kyate yn lue zah yn ccuepaw lu kheit nynh kae kha, “Jerusalem khuapi tuh aroh vae,” yn cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:3-10">2Si 25.3-10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:2-8">Jer 39.2-8</ref>, <ref loc="JER 52:4-14">52.4-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuh-e yn ccuepaw yn thua maw zete ccyh mawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih tuh ka tungvaw a um vae; thuasalama awkhua ccyh kya tuh-e paw he yn thua te nynh kae kha byaho khonaw yn pya; tetuh ka mung kha hungpya thua zah byaho kho leite ka um vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Judah Ram kya A Hiinhy hae paw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="24" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Israel ram e arohpaw hmin hae kya a um hae paw nynh, “Abraham tuh a makhae kyalya a la thua zemah e ram hynh a la ccou; thuasalama aening tuh patae ah cih vae oh; ram hynh ccou khylan pya ah thua ccaccing vae oh,” a ci hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin kha hopah hae, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Nanning nynh achii ryte asaw kha na ae oh zah, zohtuh hae kalan khe nae mit dothungte chiise na luasah oh; te nanning nynh ram kha na ccou cih oh tou? <verse number="26" style="v" />Nae thaloi kha na doliaku oh, anungsikuhpaw kha na rae oh zah, nae innpaw paw zu kha mang na thusah oh pite ram kha na ccou cih oh tou? <verse number="27" style="v" />E hynh minmin kha hopah hae, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Kae tuh ka hiin thyhte, arohpaw hmin hae kya a um hae paw tuh thaloi te a chih ccaccing cih hae; ramkaw um hae paw kha loramsaw hae kalan ka pya cih hae zah ka teisah cih hae; rhawlungrua lungkhu te lungkarung kya um hae paw tuh shethya khate a chih cih hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Ram kha arohpaw te accakaepaw lang ka rae cih, a lysakunawpaw a thungnaw tuh athang cih. Israel mua hae tuh ccungccaw a cceih bungthungpaw a um lei lan ciate ccungccaw adaepaw lang a tang cih. <verse number="29" style="v" />Minmin nynh anungsikuhpaw a rae hae paw balyn keiccuze ram kha arohpaw te accakaepaw lang he ka rae te, kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, na ccungccaw hae nynh nang na kong kha inn thuakaw pe te pang pe khe innpaw raveihte lu kheit te lu kheit hokuh hae zah, “Rang oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate paw bya mou yn thua cipaw kha thaetua oh sih,” a ciku hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Minmin tuh ka ccungccaw hae hawte oun thua cih hae zah, na malang khe ka ccungccaw hae hawte a haung cih hae, te na bya kha a thae cih hae, thuasalama zui lan khyh hae. Mih munglae tuh myarya anawthya, thuasalama mih thinlung tuh mih uccaw amia muenaw kyakhe nynh a um. <verse number="32" style="v" />Minmin hanlan tuh nang hynh sungsakunaw hlaw a sahthyapaw, a roi hoypaw te tintang hoyte a khuathyapaw hawte nynh na thua; na hopaw kha a thae hae zemah zui lan khyh hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />E balyn hynh yn ccing ccaccing cih, he yn ccing te, minmin laku kya profeh a la umpaw kha a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ahme leipaw Israel Tuurin hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Israel tuurin hae kha rawsete profehbya hotua: profehbya ho lah, tuurin hae kha hopah hae: Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Mimaw kyalya looh a dangkuh hae paw Israel tuurin hae nanning hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! Tuurin hae nynh tuu hae kha looh dang lan ccan khyh tou? <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuu matei kha na nia oh, tuuming boeining kha na lawku oh, tuu athopaw kha na chia oh; thuasalama tuu hae kha looh na dang khyh oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />A thawzyapaw kha thawzung na pya khyh oh, a ccihpaw kha na dansah khyh oh, vaemaw a muepaw kha na heepah khyh oh, a cceihseipaw kha na kikhae khyh oh, a zopaw kha na ccung khyh oh, minmin kha thawcci leite nangsete na uk oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuurin a um khyh keiccuze tuu hae tuh pong a phiakuh hae; he a phiakuh hae tuh loramsaw hae elang looh lang a tang hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Nam 27.17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1Si 22.17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mat 9.36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:34">Mar 6.34</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka tuu hae tuh phiakuh hae zah, mua balyn vawlan te sangpyng ahangpaw miakaw vawlan khe a khiavuikuh hae; ka tuu hae tuh laephi vaw balyn khe pong phiakuh hae zah, minmin a ccungtu te a zahtu lu kheit san um khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, tuurin hae nanning, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh thaetua oh: <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw tuh: Kae tuh ka hiin thyhte, tuurin a um khyh keiccuze ka tuu hae tuh teipaw saw lang tang hae zah, loramsaw balyn hanlan looh lang a tang vae hae; ka tuurin hae nynh ka tuu hae kha ccung khyh hae, mimaw kha looh dangkuh hae zah ka tuu hae kha looh dang khyh hae; <verse number="9" style="v" />tukeiccuze, tuurin hae nanning, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh thaetua oh: <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho, Tuurin hae kha ka rawse hae; mih kuih kya umpaw ka tuu hae kha yn pya oh, cite minmin kha ka ngia cih hae, tuu hae looh dangpaw rya kyate ka haeungsah cih hae; tuurin hae nynh mimaw te mimaw kha looh dangkuh vae lan khyh hae. Ka tuu hae tuh minmin hanlan looh lang a tang khyh nawlan hae, mih khalang kyate ka tuu hae kha ka luesah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ahmepaw Tuurintu Pachia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawccecize Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Kamaw ccaccei nynh ka tuu hae kha ka ccung cih hae zah thawte ka zah cih hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuurin hae nynh a phiakuh hae paw mih tuu hae kya a um lya hae khe, mih tuu hae kha thawte a ccung hae hawte, ka tuu hae kha thawte ka ccung cih hae, mae-ui zah marae amoh nin khe, minmin a phiakunaw hae hmin takyh kyate minmin kha ka luesah cih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Minphuin hae kyate ka poukhae cih hae, ram hae kyate ka suelua cih hae zah, mimaw ram lungkhu lang ka teekhae cih hae; Israel mua hae vawlan, vawkhu hae pepan te ram lungkhu umnaw hmin takyh kyakhe minmin kha looh ka dang cih hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahoypaw ramnonaw khe ka paeesakuh cih hae zah, Israel mua ahang hae paw tuh minmin nynh rampaeekunaw hae athua cih; rampaeekunaw ahoynaw khe a rya cih hae zah, Israel mua hae vawlan umpaw myarya ramnonaw khe ram a paeekuh cih hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Kamaw ccaccei hynh ka tuu hae a rintu ka thua cih zah, minmin kha ryanaw hmin ka pya cih hae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. <verse number="16" style="v" />A zopaw kha ka ccung cih zah, a cceihseipaw kha ka kikhae cih, vaemaw a muepaw kha ka heepah cih zah, a thawzyapaw kha thawzung ka pya cih, thuasalama a thopaw te thawzung hoipaw kha ka roh cih. Minmin kha dingnaw te ka kua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka tuuphu hae nanning, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Tuu te tuu laku thuasah, tuutepaw hae te miaatepaw hae laku thuasah bya ka pia cih hae: <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahoypaw ramnonaw kya ram na paeeku oh paw hynh zaw khyh tou? Pawccemou ram na paeeku leinaw oh kha nae ccu te na syde oh? Tui accipaw kha he na nia vae oh ze, na nia bang oh paw tui kha nae ccu te pawccemou na nuihsah oh? <verse number="19" style="v" />Nae ccu te na syde vae oh paw te nae ccu te na nuihsah vae oh paw tui kha tou ka tuu hae nynh a ae a neih cih hae?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh minmin kha hynhte a hopya hae: Athopaw tuu te angethahpaw tuu laku kya kamaw ccaccei nynh bya ka pia cih hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Nanning nynh anyaapaw sarangpaw balyn kha phiariphiarae a phiaku mawlaezung hae, nae napang te nae raw khate na eih oh zah, nae ki te na dia oh keiccuze, <verse number="22" style="v" />ka tuuphu kha ka khum cih zah, ro thua vae lan khyh hae; kamaw nynh tuu te tuu laku bya ka pia cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Minmin hanlan tuurin lu kheit, ka ryalahtu David kha ka nungpah cih hae zah, aning nynh looh a dang cih hae: aning nynh looh a dang cih hae zah aning tuh minmin hanlan tuurin athua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:17">Bya 7.17</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Te kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh mih Pachia ka thua cih zah, ka ryalahtu David tuh minmin laku bawi athua cih; kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh phe ka ho vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:24">Eze 37.24</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Minmin ryte daenaw byakin kha ka rae cih zah, loramsaw hae kha ram kyate ccaring ka dee cih hae, tuhteze nynh minmin tuh ramkaw kya khyndadyh lan a um cih hae zah tuhpi kya a rya cih hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Minmin te ka mua po voilu lan umpaw hmin hae kha hythua ka pya cih hae; accyh thyhte khuaa ka rawsah cih zah, tuh-e khuaa tuh hythuanaw khuaa athua cih. <verse number="27" style="v" />Ramkaw e thingku hae nynh athae thae cih hae zah, laephi nynh looh a pousah cih. Minmin tuh mih laephi kya lungdaete a um cih hae; a puihnaw hae paw mih ccong kha ka khyapah hae zah minmin kha see lang a mang hae paw kuih kyate he ka luesah hae te, kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Minmin tuh minphuin ccangpaw hae nynh luadepaw lang tang vae lan khyh hae, ram lungkhu e sarangpaw hae nynh minmin kha tei vae lan khyh hae; lungdaete a um cih hae zah lu kheit nynh sanmah minmin kha rinaw pya vae lan khyh hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Myarya hoypaw thingthae-eccang kha ka voisahpah cih hae, tuhteze nynh ram lungkhu kya vuelawtuihawnaw kha teing lan khyh hae zah, minphuin ccangpaw hae nynh saryakunaw mah teing vae lan khyh hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia tuh minmin ryte ka um zah, Israel hae tuh ka ccungccaw hae nynh thua hae cipaw minmin nynh a nyh cih hae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. <verse number="31" style="v" />Nanning tuh ka tuu hae, ram ka paeesakuh hae paw tuu hae na thua oh zah, kae tuh nae Pachia nynh ka thua, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Seir Mua vawlan Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kalan yn thua zah:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35.1-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:5-17">Isa 34.5-17</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 63:1-6">63.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:7-22">Jer 49.7-22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:12-14">Eze 25.12-14</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:11-12">Amo 1.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:1-14">Oba 1-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:2-5">Mal 1.2-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, na mae kha Seir Mua kalan khe hawi lah, profehbya kha honua tua, <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou Seir Mua, nang kha kae rawse;</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha arohpaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">accakaepaw lang rae khylan,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kuih kae dyngnua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na khua hae kha ka roh cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">nang tuh ccungccaw adaepaw lang</para>
  <para style="q1">na tang cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char></para>
  <para style="q1">ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang nynh langmawlya e rhawkunaw kha phang na kyngkuh zah, Israel ccungccaw hae tungvaw shethya a thua ccyh te minmin tungvaw nyathya detahnaw ccyh kyakhe minmin kha thaloi kalan na ap hae keiccuze, <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw tuh, Kae tuh ka hiin thyhte, chiise hanlan nang kha kae paccyn cih zah, chiise nynh nang kha ae deehui cih; chiise luanaw kha na hua khyh keiccuze chiise luanaw nynh nang kha ae deehui cih. <verse number="7" style="v" />Seir Mua kha accakaepaw te arohpaw lang ka rae cih zah, tuin kya oun thua hae paw te a cceih hae paw balyn kha ka roh cih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Na mua hae kha michi rhua te phe ka biasah cih; na sangpyng hae vawlan, na kya-e accya hae kya te na vawkhu hae balyn kyakhe thaloi te chia athua hae paw tuh a khuliakuh cih hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang kha zungzae arohpaw lang kae rae cih zah, na khuapi hae kya humhung mah um lan khyh. Tetuh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang nynh, “E minphuin ccangning te e ram ramning hynh ka kya-e athua cih hae zah, aening nynh ah ccou cih oh,” cite, tuin kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phang a um pite na ho keiccuze, <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw tuh: Kae tuh ka hiin thyhte, nang nynh minmin kha na hua hae keiccuze thinrianaw te eiungnaw kha na langsaku thyhte, na tungvaw ka cyih cih; nanning kha bya he kae pia oh te, nanning kha kamaw ccaccei nynh kae nysakuh cih oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang nynh, “Israel mua hae tuh ccungccaw adae vae, aening nynh ae khylan aening kalan pya athua vae hae,” cite saryanaw bya na hopaw balyn kha kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh phe ka thae vae, cipaw na nyh cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Kae kha rawsete na munglae te na pookuh zah, ka thethya na hopaw kha phe ka thae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Laephi pynpi a lungtua lyakhe nang kha ccungccaw phe kae daesah cih. <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel hae kya-e rho kha ro athua lyaze, na lungtua hawte, na tungvaw ka cyih cih. Pou Seir Mua, nang te Edom ram balyn tuh na roh cih oh. Tetuh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih oh.</para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Israel tungvaw Hythuanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Israel mua hae kha profehbya hopya tua hae: Pou Israel mua hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh thaetua oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw tuh: Rhaw hae nynh, “Alei! Zungzae tynpaw mua hae tuh kaening kya-e nynh athua vae hae,” cite ae hopya oh keiccuze, <verse number="3" style="v" />profehbya kha hotua: Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Nanning tuh ccangpaw minphuin hae kya-e thua khylan te minphuin hae laku thethya hopaw te saryapaw lang na tang ccaw oh cite, nanning kha ae maemih oh zah, teitei langte balyn ae syro oh keiccuze, <verse number="4" style="v" />pou Israel mua hae, Bawipaw PACHIA bya hynh thaetua oh: Mua hae te sangpyng hae, vawkhu hae te accya hae, po voilu lan um hae paw ccangpaw minphuin hae nynh luadepaw te saryapaw lang a tang vae hae paw arohpaw hmin hae te ccuetawpaw khua hae kalan khe Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a hopya hae: <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw tuh: Ccangpaw minphuin hae te Edom hae balyn tungvaw khe eiung thinriate bya ka ho cih, Edom hae nynh myarya lungtuakhaekute theihryanaw byaho hae zah ka ram kha luadete mimaw ram lang a lawku hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel ram konglangte profehbya ho lah, mua hae te sangpyng hae, vawkhu hae te accya hae kha hopya tua hae, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Nanning tuh minphuin ccangpaw hae nynh saryakunaw kha na teing oh keiccuze eiung thinriate bya ka ho cih; <verse number="7" style="v" />tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Na pepan po voilu lan um hae paw minphuin hae toulou kha saryakunaw a teing cih hae cite bya ka kinku.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama, pou Israel mua hae, na karan hae tuh atoih cih zah, ka ccungccaw Israel hae hanlan na thingthae tuh athae cih; pawccecize minmin tuh aro mawze inn lang oun ki cih hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Dotua oh, kae tuh nae hanlan nynh ka thua; nae kalan ka maeleihkuh cih zah nanning tuh loo lang pho na thua cih oh zah ccacii tu na thua cih oh; <verse number="10" style="v" />nanning Israel hae balyn kha milu kae pungzaesah cih oh; khua hae kya ccungccaw a um cih zah arohpaw hmin hae kha raethui athua cih. <verse number="11" style="v" />Nae tungvaw khe ccungccaw te sahiinpaw hae kha ka pungzae sah cih hae. Minmin tuh a lungthung cih hae zah a pungthung cih hae; alia vae paw nae ccyh lya hawte kae umsah cih oh zah, langmawlya laeze ahoy huapaw kha kae raepah cih oh. Tetuh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka ccungccaw Israel hae kha nanning vawlan khe ka cciakhae cih hae, nanning tuh minmin kya-e na thua cih oh zah, mih rho na thua cih oh. Mih ccaaw hae kha na theih vae lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Minmin nynh nang kha, “Nang nynh ccungccaw hae kha na ae hae, na minphuin athuapaw imua hae kha na chia hae,” cite ae ci hae; <verse number="14" style="v" />tukeiccuze nang nynh ccungccaw hae kha na ae vae lan khyh hae zah, na minphuin athuapaw imua hae kha na theih vae lan khyh hae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci; <verse number="15" style="v" />minphuin ccangpaw hae nynh saryakunaw bya kha kae thaesah vae lan khyh zah, ccungccaw hae nynh theihryakunaw kha na teing vae lan khyh; na minphuin kha na thy na pawsakuh vae lan khyh, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Israel kha Thawsahthuinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Israel hae nynh mimaw laephi kya he a um hae te, mih hiinzia te mih cyisahnaw khate ram kha a thusah hae; ka muihnaw kya mih ozia tuh nopi nynh nopiny a ny lya-e nungsikunaw te nynh aloku. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin nynh ram lungkhu kya a luasah hae paw chiise keiccu te ram a thusahnaw hae paw zohtuh hae keiccuze mih tungvaw kya ka thinrianaw ka bunua hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Minphuin hae laku kya phiariphiarae ka nung hae zah ram hae kya ka phiasaku hae; mih ozia te mih cyisahnaw thyhte bya ka pia hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama minphuin hae kya he a thua hae te, a thuanaw takyh hae kyakhe ming hae nynh, “E hae hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccungccaw nynh thua hae, tuhzemah a ram kyate a pou vae hae,” cite a ho hae keiccuze, minmin nynh athyaapaw ka min kha a thusah hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuasalama Israel hae nynh a thuanaw hae minphuin hae laku kya a thusah hae paw ka min athyaapaw hanlan ka thinphang.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel hae kha hopya tua hae, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Pou Israel hae, e ka cyipaw hynh nanning hanlan thua khyh, thuasalama na thuanaw oh minphuin hae laku kya na thusah vae oh paw ka min athyaapaw hanlan nynh thua. <verse number="23" style="v" />Minphuin hae laku kya na thusah oh zah athu vae paw ka min alesaepaw kha ka thyaasah cih; ka thyaanaw kha mih malang khe nanning liate he ka langsakuh te, minphuin hae nynh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. <verse number="24" style="v" />Minphuin hae kyate nanning kha kae ko cih oh, ram takyh kyate kae suelua cih oh zah, naemaw ram lang kae cciakhae cih oh. <verse number="25" style="v" />Nanning kha tui ccipaw te kae hei cih oh zah nae nungsikunaw balyn kyate na thyaa cih oh, nae zohtuh balyn kyate kae thyaasah cih oh. <verse number="26" style="v" />Thinlung thawpaw kae pya cih oh zah, nae lungkhu kya tuanaw thawpaw kae sang cih oh; nae pyn kyate lung thinlung kha ka lah cih zah, ngesaw thinlung kha kae pya cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36.26-28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:19-20">Eze 11.19-20</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka muisaw kha nae lungkhu kya ka sang cih, ka phungbya hae kha kae zuisah cih oh zah ka phungzae hae kha raeringkute na zui cih oh. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tetuh nae minpaaw hae ka pya hae paw ram kya na um cih oh; nanning tuh ka ccungccaw hae na thua cih oh zah, kae tuh nae Pachia ka thua cih. <verse number="29" style="v" />Na nungsikunaw oh balyn kyate kae khum cih oh, ccathae kha ka ko cih zah patae ka voisah cih, nae kya ccakannaw ka umsah lan khyh. <verse number="30" style="v" />Thingthae kha patae ka thaesah cih zah loo kyate looh patae ka voisah cih; tuhteze nynh minphuin hae laku kya ccakanccite maethyanaw kha papin bua na teing vae lan khyh oh. <verse number="31" style="v" />Tetuh ahoy leipaw nae ozia athahpaw te ahoy leipaw nae cyisahnaw kha na liathui cih oh zah, nae hoyleinaw te anungsikuhpaw nae cyisahnaw keiccuze naemaw toulou nae luathuakuh cih. <verse number="32" style="v" />E ka cyi lanpaw hynh nanning hanlan thua khyh cipaw nyh oh, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. Pou Israel hae, nae maethah sah lah, lungrote um oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Nae hoyleinaw balyn kyate he kae thyaasah oh nin khe, khua hae kya ccungccaw ka umsah cih zah arohpaw hmin hae kha raethui athua cih. <verse number="34" style="v" />Po a cceih hae paw balyn nynh a muihnaw hae khe vua athua vae paw ram tuh, vuapaw ram thua vae leite, loo lang pho athuathui cih. <verse number="35" style="v" />Tetuh minmin nynh, “Vua athua vae paw e ram tuh Eden khokhu hawte nynh athua vae; alakawpaw, vuapaw te aroh vae paw khua hae tuh atu ccungccaw um vae hae zah rhawlungrua mah a um vae,” cite a ho cih hae. <verse number="36" style="v" />Tetuh kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aroh vae paw hmin hae kha ka raethui zah, vua athua vae paw loo kyakhe ccacii ccouthui athua vae cipaw kha nae pepan po voilu lan um hae paw ccangpaw minphuin hae nynh a nyh cih hae; kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh phe ka ho vae zah, ka cyih cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: E hynh Israel hae hanlan cyipya khylan ngiakunaw kaw ka ua ung cih hae: Tuuphu hawte milu ka lungsah thung cih hae. <verse number="38" style="v" />Silawnaw hanlan mangpaw tuuphu hawte thuasah, poitua lyaze Jerusalem e tuuphu hawte, arohpaw khua hae tuh ccungccaw zapi khate phe abeih cih. Tetuh minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ru Roupaw Umnaw Accya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih tuh ka tungvaw yn um, te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muisaw nynh yn cciakhae zah, ru phe beihpaw accya ngaelung khe yn nung. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuh-e ru hae balyn kyakhe po voilu lan yn cciakhae; tuh-e accya kyakhe ru patae um zah, tuh-e ru hae tuh karae arou hae. <verse number="3" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, “Ccungccapaw, e ru hae hynh a hiin kho cih hae tou?” cite yn khia zah kae nynh, “Pou Bawipaw PACHIA, namaw nynh phe na ny,” ka cipya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha yn hopah zah, “E ru hae hynh profehbya hopya tua hae: Pou aroupaw ru hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh thaetua oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />E ru hae kha Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a hopya hae: Nae lungkhu lang hy kha ka teesah cih zah na hiin cih oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Nae kyakhe tharui ka saesah cih, ngesaw ka thuasah cih zah ving te kae bong cih oh, nae lungkhu kya hy ka nung cih zah na hiin cih oh; te kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih oh,” a ci. <verse number="7" style="v" />Kaw yn pya thyhte kae nynh profehbya ka ho; profehbya ka ho lyakhe vaekheihmawte roi tuh myarya yn ccae, te ru hae tuh sueluakuh hae zah ccangkheit te ccangkheit oun tungkuh vae hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka do zah minmin kya tharui yn um, ngesaw mah yn um zah ving nynh minmin kha a bong hae; thuasalama minmin kya hy um khyh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha yn hopah zah, “Ccungccapaw, hy kha profehbya hopah, hy kha profehbya hopya tua: Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Pou hy, teitei langte balyn yn thua lah, e michi hae hynh a hiin ccaw hae, mih hysuesah tua hae,” a ci. <verse number="10" style="v" />Aning nynh kaw yn pya thyhte profehbya ka ho, te hy tuh mih lungkhu lang tee zah a hiin hae, mih ccu te thadyn hae zah myarya lungpaw rhawkawphu zeih acih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:11">Bya 11.11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, “Ccungccapaw, e ru hae hynh Israel hae balyn kha nynh thua hae. Minmin nynh, ‘Aening ru tuh karae rou vae zah aening ngaehoinaw tuh phe zo vae; aening tuh khaleih mawte vua ah thua vae oh,’ a ciku hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin kha profehbya hopah hae, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Pou ka ccungccaw hae, nae shawku hae kha ka hung cih zah, nanning kha poh kae thuaa cih oh; te nanning kha Israel ram lang kae kikhae cih oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Pou ka ccungccaw hae, nae shawku hae kha ka hung zah nanning kha poh he kae thuaa oh te, kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih oh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Nae lungkhu khe ka muisaw kha ka sang cih zah na hiin cih oh, te naemaw laephi kya kae nung cih oh; tetuh kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh phe ka ho vae zah ka cyih cih cipaw kha na nyh cih oh,” cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Ccungngue Ccangning</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="16" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, ccungngue ccangkheit kha lawkuh lah, a vawlan khe, “Judah te a ruiban Israel hae hanlan,” cite zeitua; tukoute ccangpaw ccungngue kha lah lah, a vawlan khe, “Josef (Efraim ccungngue) te a ruiban Israel hae balyn hanlan,” cite zeitua; <verse number="17" style="v" />khah-e ccungngue hae kha na kuih kya ccungngue ccangkheit lang a tang nawlan, piade hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Na ccungccaw hae nynh nang kha, “E hynh paw suilan mou athua cipaw nae langsapakuh lan khyh tou?” cite he ae khia hae te, <verse number="19" style="v" />minmin kha hopya tua hae, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Josef ccungngue (Efraim kuih kya umpaw) te a ruiban Israel minphuin hae kha ka lah vae cih hae; te khah-e ccungngue te Judah ccungngue kha ka pyde cih zah, ka kuih kya ccungngue ccangkheit lang a tang ccaw hae cite ccungngue ccangkheit lang ka rae cih hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ccaw na zeinawpaw ccungngue hae tuh minmin nynh a muihnaw hae na kuih kya he a um hae te, <verse number="21" style="v" />minmin kha hopah hae, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Israel ccungccaw hae kha a thuanaw hae minphuin hae laku kyate ka ko cih hae, mih umnaw takyh kyate ka suelua cih hae zah mimaw ram lang ka cciakhae cih hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuh-e ram lungkhu Israel mua hae vawlan khe minphuin phuin kheit lang ka rae cih hae; minmin balyn kha siapharan lu kheit nynh a uk cih hae. Minphuin ccangning lang papin tang vae lan khyh hae zah peenaw ccangning lang papinmaw phiakuh thui vae lan khyh hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Mih zohtuh hae, anungsikuhpaw mih uccaw hae te mih seinaw hankhakheit khate mimaw toulou kha papin thusakuh thui vae lan khyh hae. A khuliakunaw hae zynseinaw balyn kyate ka khum cih hae zah ka thyaasah cih hae. Tetuh minmin tuh ka ccungccaw hae athua cih hae zah, kae tuh mih PACHIA ka thua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka ryalahtu David tuh minmin a uktu hae siapharan athua cih; mih balynte tuurin lu kheit rou kha a hoi cih hae. Ka phungzae hae kha a zui cih hae zah ka phunglang hae kha raeringkute a zui cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:24">Eze 34.24</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka ryalahtu Jakob ka pyapaw ram, nae minpaaw hae nynh a umnaw hae ram kyakhe a um cih hae; minmin, mih ccaaw hae te mih mintaw hae tuh tuin kya zungzae a um cih hae; ka ryalahtu David tuh mih uktu bawi athua zungzae cih. <verse number="26" style="v" />Minmin ryte daenaw byakinnaw kha ka rae cih; tuh-e tuh minmin ryte ka raepaw zungzae tynpaw byakinnaw athua cih; minmin kha hythua ka pya cih hae zah ka pungzaesah cih hae, ka beikinnthyaa kha minmin laku kya ka nung zungzae cih. <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka umnaw hmin tuh minmin kya a um cih; kae tuh mih Pachia ka thua cih zah, minmin tuh ka ccungccaw hae athua cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:16">2Ko 6.16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:3">Bya 21.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuhcite ka beikinnthyaa tuh minmin laku kya zungzae he a um te, minphuin hae nynh kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel kha ka thyaasah cipaw a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Gog nynh Doukunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Magog ram umpaw Meshek te Tubal uktu bawi Gog kha na mae hawinua lah, profehbya honua tua:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:8">Bya 20.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Pou Meshek te Tubal uktu bawi athuapaw Gog, nang kha kae rawse. <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang kha kae maeleihsakuh cih, na khaw kha bawnawpaw te kae baw cih zah, na rhawkaw hae balyn, marang hae, marang rhawkaw hae, rhaw uccaw phe ccing lan a lawkuh hae paw tuh-e rhawkaw hae balyn, te khawriaphua, khawriaphua dihpaw te thaloi ccyngkuh hae paw ccungccaw zapi patae ryte nang kha kae cciakhae cih oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Persia, Kush te Put minphuin hae mah a umbua hae, tuh-e hae balyn tuh khawriaphua te sivawlukhung ccarou a hoi hae; <verse number="6" style="v" />Gomer te a rhawkaw hae balyn, thahlang adianaw umpaw Beth-togarmah te a rhawkaw hae balyn—ccungccaw patae tuh na kya a cceihbua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang te na kya a pumkuh hae paw zapi balyn tuh raeringkuh oh lah, paccynkute um oh, minmin hanlan rintu lang umtua. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ninsaw patae aro koute nang kha sueluabua na thua cih; nyalang kum patae aro te, rhaw kyate muethui koute raethuipaw ram kha na ccianua cih, tuh-e ram tuh minphuin patae kyate sueluapaw ccungccaw hae a umnaw hae ram, khaw cia ccungccaw adae vae paw Israel mua hae vawlan umpaw ram nynh thua; tuh-e hae tuh minphuin hae kyate poukhaepaw ccungccaw hae thua hae zah, atu tuh mih balynte khyndadyh lan a um vae hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang tuh khise hawte malang na cceih cih; nang, na rhawkaw hae balyn te na kya umbua hae paw ccungccaw patae tuh ram a bongpaw maeking hawte na thua cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Tuin nin vae tuh na lungkhu kya tuanaw patae yn thungkuh cih zah, ahoy leipaw paccynnaw kha na paccyn cih. <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang nynh, “Khualungrua koihkuh leipaw khua taraw hae umnaw ram kha ka ccianua cih; khualungrua, koikua khyhze koikua ccong um leite khyndadyh lante daebabi lan um hae paw kha ka tuk cih hae,” na ci; <verse number="12" style="v" />mih uccaw kha luadete lawku lan thuasah, langmawlya tuh la roh zah atu ccungccaw a um vae paw hmin hae, minphuin hae kyate suelua thua hae zah, sahiin te uccaw a hoi hae paw te laephi angaelung um hae paw kha tuk lan thuasah na tuakuh cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Sheba hae, Dedan hae, Tarshish kungku hae te arawthungpaw a ngawphue hae balyn nynh nang kha, “Uccaw luadete cciakhae khylan nae thua vae tou? Luadepaw uccaw hae, sui te ngun, sahiin te uccaw hae, luadepaw uccaw patae kha cciakhae khylan tou na ccungccaw zapi hae kha na pum hae?” ae ci cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, ccungccapaw, profehbya ho lah, Gog kha hopya tua: Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Ka ccungccaw Israel hae tuh ngaengante a um nin hae khe, nang nynh nae thokuh cih zah, <verse number="15" style="v" />nang te ccungccaw patae tuh marang ccikuh hae paw, zapi patae, athungpaw rhawkaw hae ryte thahlang asaw huanaw na hmin kyate nae thua cih oh; <verse number="16" style="v" />maeking nynh ram kha a bong hawte ka ccungccaw Israel hae kha na ccianua cih hae. Nyalang ccyh kya ka ram dou khylan nang kha kae cciakhae cih, tuhteze nynh, pou Gog, minphuin hae malang khe ka thyaanaw kha nang na liate he ka langsakuh te, minphuin hae nynh kae kha yn nyh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Gog kha Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Israel hae dou khylan nang kha kae cciakhae cih, cite langmaw lyaze profehbya ho hae paw ka ryalahtu Israel profeh hae kyate bya ka la honuathepaw kha nang na thua khyh tou? <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw tuh: Gog nynh Israel ram kha ccianuate he yn tuk nin khe, myaryamaw ka thinria cih. <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka thinrianaw tuh maee lang ruate bya ka ho: Tuin nin khe Israel ram kya innry thawte asuekuh cih; <verse number="20" style="v" />rili kya-e ngasaw hae, vaawlang e pavaw hae, ramkaw e sarangpaw hae, lae vawlan avawpaw balyn te laephi vawlan e ccungccaw hae balyn tuh ka malang a thyngkuh cih hae, mua hae tuh a ting cih hae, theihpang hae tuh a khuliakuh cih hae zah khualungrua miakaw tuh a ting cih hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka mua hae balyn vawlan khe Gog kha rawsete thaloi kha ka konua cih; ccungccaw hae tuh lu kheit te lu kheit thaloi te a baekuh cih hae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA hynh a ho. <verse number="22" style="v" />Shethya te chiise luanaw khate Gog kha bya ka pia cih; amaw, a rhawkaw hae te amaw kya umbua hae paw ccungccaw patae tungvaw khe thawte arahpaw khuaa, hya, maee te kemaee kha ka ccawsah cih. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuhcite ka lesaenaw te ka thyaanaw kha ka langsakuh cih zah minphuin patae malang khe kamaw kha ka nysakuh cih hae. Tetuh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Gog Rhawkaw hae Ronaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Gog kha rawsete profehbya hotua, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Meshek te Tubal hae uktu bawi Gog, nang kha kae dou! <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang kha kae maeleih cih zah kae dee cih, thahlang asaw huanaw kyate kae cciakhae cih zah Israel mua hae kalan khe kae cciakhae cih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Na ranglang kuih kya-e na li kha ka khya cih zah, na voilang kuih kya-e na the kha ka ccawsah cih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Namaw, na rhawkaw hae balyn te na umkheih oh paw ccungccaw hae tuh Israel mua hae vawlan khe na chih cih oh; nang kha saw aepaw pavaw aphuinphuin te loramsaw hae kalan khe looh lang kae pya cih. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ramkaw huataw kya na chih cih; pawccecize kae nynh phe ka ho vae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. <verse number="6" style="v" />Magog ram te ngaengante um hae paw rili kin e ram hae kha maee ka sawnua cih hae; tetuh minmin nynh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Athyaapaw ka min kha ka ccungccaw Israel hae kya ka nysah cih hae; athyaapaw ka min kha thethyasah lan ka ua vae lan khyh; te Israel hae kyakhe kae tuh Bawipaw, Athyaapaw Pachia ka thuapaw kha minphuin hae nynh a nyh cih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh a thua vae! Tuh-e tuh acyihkuh vae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. E nin hynh ka ho vae paw nin nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Te Israel khua hae kya um hae paw tuh a pou cih hae zah rhawtuknawpaw zunghe hae—khawriaphua dihpaw te khawriaphua lepaw, the te li, ccong te ccoi hae kha kum sari lungkhu maee te a soi cih hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Minmin nynh loo kya-e maeething kha lawku ho lan khyh, ramkaw e thingku kha mah nge ho lan khyh, pawccecize zunghe hae kha maeetua nawlan a mang cih hae; minmin a la luadetu hae kha a luaderu cih hae zah, mih uccaw a ccuekhaetu hae kha a ccuekhaepah ru cih hae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Gog Rhua Uunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuin nin khe Gog kha Israel ram, rili nithua lang Khuaccongtu hae Accya kyakhe uukunaw hmin ka pya cih; tuh-e hmin nynh khuaccong hae paw ccianaw kha a khaw cih, pawccecize tuin kyakhe Gog te a ccungccaw hae balyn kha uu athua hae; tuh-e hmin tuh Hamon-gog Accya cite minphu athua cih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ram kha thyaasah khylan Israel hae nynh michi rhua kha sawpaw sah sari lungkhu a uh cih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Ramccungccaw balyn nynh minmin kha a uh cih hae; tuh-e ryalaw nynh minmin kha ka phu-enaw ka langsaku nin khe sawtuanaw a ccousah cih hae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. <verse number="14" style="v" />Ram kha athyaa ccaw cite, ram lungkhu kya po cciate a uu loh lei hae paw rhaw hae rhua miakaw kha uu khylan pise hae kha taekhiate a nung cih hae; tuh-e hae nynh sawpaw sah sari lungkhu a ccung cih hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ccungtu hae nynh ram lungkhu po a ccia lya hae khe, lukhakheit nynh ccungccaw ru kha a muih lanze, tuh-e ru tuh rhua uhtu hae nynh Hamon-gog Accya kya a uu mawlaezung hae, tuh-e ru a muihtu nynh tuh-e ru pe khe syntawnaw a rae cih. <verse number="16" style="v" />(Hamonah khuapi mah tuin kya a umbua.) Tuhcite ram kha a thyaasah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Ccungccapaw, pavaw phuin miakaw te loramsaw balyn kalan khe hopah hae: Sueluakuh oh lah rang oh, Israel mua vawlan nanning elang ka paccynpaw silawnaw poi pi kalan khe teitei langte balyn yn sueluakuh oh lah, asaw te achii kha na ae na neih cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39.17-20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:17-18">Bya 19.17-18</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Athungpaw ccungccaw hae saw kha na ae cih oh zah laephi uktu bawi hae chii kha na neih cih oh—Bashan ram e athopaw tuutepaw hae, tuutaw hae, miaatepaw hae te tangnuapaw hae saw te chii kha na ae na neih cih oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Nanning elang ka paccynpaw silawnaw poi kyakhe na byn makhia oh atho kha na ae cih oh zah, na rui makhia oh achii kha na neih cih oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Te marang hae, marang rhawkaw hae, rhawkaw hae te rhawkaw aphuinphuin hae kha ka ccaboi kya phe byn lan na ae cih oh, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Kithuinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka phu-enaw kha minphuin hae laku kya ka langsakuh cih; ka raepaw ka byapianaw te mih tungvaw ka khangpaw ka kuih kha minphuin balyn nynh a muih cih hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuin nin te tho zah malang vae tuh, Israel hae nynh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia ka thuapaw kha a nyh vae cih hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel hae tuh ka tungvaw mih lungzi khyh keiccuze mih hoyleinaw hanlan kyngte ramccang lang cciakhae athua hae paw kha minphuin hae nynh a nyh cih hae. Tukeiccuze ka mae ka retawku hae, mih rhaw hae kuih kalan ka pya hae zah, thaloi te marya a chih hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Mih nungsikunaw te mih seinaw thyhte mih tungvaw rya ka lah zah, ka mae kha ka retawku hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Atu tuh Jakob kha hoynaw ka pyathui cih zah, Israel hae balyn tungvaw thawccinaw ka hoi cih; athyaapaw ka min kha ka thungkhaw cih. <verse number="26-27" style="v" />Humhung nynh mah rinaw pya leite mih ram kya ngaengante he a um hae te thuasah, minphuin ccangpaw hae kyate minmin kha kikhaete mih rhaw hae ram kyate ka suelua hae zah, minphuin patae muihnaw khe ka thyaanaw kha minmin liate he ka langsakuh te thuasah, mih maethyanaw te ka tungvaw mih lungzi leinaw balyn kha a ning cih hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Minmin kha minphuin hae laku kya see lang tang khylan ka saw hae zah, tukoute mimaw ram lungkhu lang ka suelua hae keiccuze kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae. Minmin kha lu kheit sanmah nulang ka nungsya lan khyh hae; <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel hae tungvaw ka muisaw kha he ka bu te, minmin kha papinmaw ka mae ka retawkuh vae lan khyh hae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beikinn Kong Vizin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />See lang kae tangnaw kum kuin lae pangawnaw, masaty sawpaw nin haw nin, Jerusalem khuapi a lawnaw hae te kum haw lae pali accing nin ccaccei khe, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih tuh ka tungvaw yn um zah, tuh-e khuapi kalan khe yn cciakhae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Pachia kya-e vizin kyakhe aning nynh kae kha Israel ram lang yn cciakhae zah, myarya hangpaw mua vawlan khe yn nung, tuh-e mua vawlan alia langkhe khuapi te alokuhpaw inn hae a um hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:10">Bya 21.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuh-e khuapi kalan khe he yn cciakhae tuh, sohin hawte a muinsan phaephae akpaw ccungccapaw lu kheit a um, a kuih kyakhe laawrui te tounawpaw ccungngue ccyngkuh zah koikua kya phang a thadyn.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:1">Bya 11.1</ref>, <ref loc="REV 21:15">21.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh-e paw nynh kae kha, “Ccungccapaw, hoyte do lah, pekite ngaetua, kae muihsah cih paw balyn kyakhe na thinlung kha nungtua, pawccecize tuh-e tuh nang kha muihsah khylan nynh hynhlang kae cciakhae; na muihpaw balyn kha Israel hae kya na ho cih,” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Beikinn atolang khe po voilu lan lungrua a um. Ccungccapaw kuih kya umpaw tounawpaw ccungngue tuh dong taruh asae, tuh-e dong tuh asaepaw phuin thua zah, tuh-e dong kheit tuh dong kheit te zong kheit asae; aning nynh a toupaw lungrua tuh ccungngue ccangkheit thaaw zah ccungngue ccangkheit ahang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40.5—42.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:1-38">1Si 6.1-38</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:1-9">2Sh 3.1-9</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Te nithua lang hawipaw sakoih kalan khe cceih zah, a nawkui kyate a kae koute teenaw sakoihzung kha tou zah, ccungngue ccangkheit acih. <verse number="7" style="v" />Akhaan hae um zah, khaan kheit ze tounawpaw ccungngue ccangkheit cci ko zah asae; akhaan hae laku kya tuh dong pangaw cci asawkuh; teenaw sakoihzung te alungkhu lang umpaw tee takawnaw akhaan tuh tounawpaw ccungngue ccangkheit asae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te aning nynh sakoih tee takawnaw akhaan alungkhu lang kha tou zah dong kheit acih. <verse number="9" style="v" />Sakoih tee takawnaw akhaan kha tou zah dong tarya acih; a tung hae tuh dong ning cci ahang hae; thuakaw tee takawnaw akhaan tuh thuakaw alungkhu lang nynh a um. <verse number="10" style="v" />Nithua lang e sakoih voikheih langkhe akhaan khaan thum um zah akopaw phe lokuh hae; voikheit langsang e tung hae mah ahangpaw phe lokuh hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te aning nynh teenaw sakoih kha tou zah dong haw acih; sakoih akopaw kha tou zah dong haw lae thum acih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuh-e akhaan hae malang khe voikheit langkhe pang anepaw dong kheit cih paw a um; akhaan akopaw te asaepaw tuh dong taruh cci acih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Oute akhaan khaan kheit nulang e pang te ccangpaw khaan kheit nulang e pang kha tou zah akopaw dong kuin lae pangaw acih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tee takawnaw akhaan kha mah tou zah dong kuin acih; te voidu po voilu lan umpaw tung hae koute sakoih a um. <verse number="15" style="v" />Teenaw kya a umpaw sakoih malang kyate alungkhu lang e tee takawnaw akhaan tuh dong sung pangaw asawkuh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Akhaan hae te sakoih alungkhu langte po voilu lan umpaw mih tung hae kyakhe thanlan-aw hae a um hae, tee takawnaw akhaan hae mah alungkhu langte po voilu lan thanlan-aw hae a um; tung hae kyakhe ungcci ku azuh kha a soi hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Te aning nynh kae kha atolang e voidu lungkhu langkhe yn cciakhae; tuin kya akhaan hae a um hae, voidu po voilu lan lung phaekuhpaw a um; tuh-e lung phaekuhpaw vawlan khe akhaan sung thum a um. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuh-e lung phaekuhpaw tuh sakoih po a um thyhte po a um; tuh-e tuh ane huapaw lung phaekuhpaw nynh thua. <verse number="19" style="v" />Te aning nynh ane huapaw sakoih alungkhu langte alungkhu lang e voidu atolang amalang kha tou zah dong za kheit asawkuh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Te aning nynh thahlang hawipaw atolang e voidu sakoih ahangpaw te akopaw kha a tou. <verse number="21" style="v" />Akhaan hae tuh voikheit langte khaan thum cci um hae zah, tung hae, tee takawnaw akhaan hae tuh masaty e sakoih kya-e hae te phe lokuh hae; ahangpaw dong sung pangaw cih zah akopaw dong kuin lae pangaw acih. <verse number="22" style="v" />A thanlan-aw hae, tee takawnaw akhaan hae, a ungcci ku hae tuh nithua lang hawipaw sakoih kya-e hae te alokuh hae. Tuh-e sakoih kalan kaenaw tuh nawkui thyh sari um zah, tee takawnaw akhaan tuh alungkhu langkhe nynh a um. <verse number="23" style="v" />Nithua lang hawte, niccaw lang e sakoih te arawsekunaw khe alungkhu lang e voidu kalan teenawpaw sakoih ccangkheit a um; aning nynh sakoih te sakoih laku kha tou zah dong za kheit acih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Te aning nynh alia langkhe yn cciakhae zah, alia lang tuin sakoih ccangkheit a um; aning nynh tung hae te tee takawnaw khaan hae kha tou zah, tuh-e hae tuh ccangpaw hae te adi-ale phe lokuh hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuh-e sakoih po voilu lan thuasah, tee takawnaw akhaan kya thuasah ccangpaw hae hawte thanlan-aw hae um zah, asaepaw dong sung pangaw, akopaw dong kuin lae pangaw acih. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuh-e kalan kaenaw tuh nawkui thyh sari um zah, tee takawnaw khaan tuh alungkhu langte nynh a um. Tung voikheit voikheit langkhe ungcci ku azuh kha a soi hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Alungkhu lang e voidu alia langkhe sakoih ccangkheit a um; sakoih ccangkheit te ccangkheit kha alia langkhe po toubung zah dong za kheit acih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Alia lang e sakoih kyate alungkhu lang e voidu kalan khe yn teekhae zah, alia lang e sakoih kha a tou; tuh-e tuh ccangpaw hae te ako aby phe lokuh. <verse number="29" style="v" />A khaan hae, a tung hae te tee takawnaw akhaan hae tuh ccangpaw hae te adi-ale phe lokuh; te tuh-e sakoih po voilu lan thuasah, tee takawnaw akhaan kya thuasah thanlan-aw hae a um; tuh-e tuh dong sung pangaw sae zah dong kuin lae pangaw ako. <verse number="30" style="v" />Dong kuin lae pangaw sae zah dong pangaw akopaw tee takawnaw akhaan hae tuh po voilu lan a um hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Tee takawnaw akhaan tuh atolang e voidu kalan hawi zah, a tung hae vawlan khe ungcci ku zuh asoikuh, te nawkui tuh thyh tarya acih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Te nithua lang umpaw alungkhu lang e voidu kalan khe yn cciakhae, sakoih kha tou zah ccangpaw hae te adi-ale phe lokuh. <verse number="33" style="v" />A khaan hae, a tung hae te tee takawnaw akhaan hae tuh ccangpaw hae te adi-ale phe lokuh; te tuh-e sakoih po voilu lan thuasah, tee takawnaw akhaan kya thuasah thanlan-aw hae a um; tuh-e tuh dong sung pangaw sae zah dong kuin lae pangaw ako. <verse number="34" style="v" />Tee takawnaw akhaan tuh atolang e voidu kalan hawi zah, voikheit voikheit langte a tung hae vawlan khe ungcci ku zuh asoikuh, te nawkui tuh thyh tarya acih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Te thahlang e sakoih kalan khe yn cciakhae, te tuh-e sakoih tuh tou zah ccangpaw hae te adi-ale phe lokuh. <verse number="36" style="v" />A khaan hae, a tung hae te tee takawnaw akhaan hae tuh ccangpaw hae te adi-ale phe lokuh zah, po voilu lan thanlan-aw hae a um; tuh-e tuh dong sung pangaw sae zah dong kuin lae pangaw ako. <verse number="37" style="v" />Tee takawnaw akhaan tuh atolang e voidu kalan hawi zah, voikheit voikheit langte a tung hae vawlan khe ungcci ku zuh asoikuh, te nawkui tuh thyh tarya acih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Sakoih tee takawnaw akhaan kyakhe akhaan khaan kheit um zah, tuin kyakhe maee-ute silawnawpaw kha a sing hae. <verse number="39" style="v" />Te sakoih tee takawnaw akhaan voikheit voikheit langkhe ccaboi ccangning um zah, tuh-e hae vawlan khe maee-ute silawnawpaw, seithyaanaw silawnawpaw te cyiseinaw silawnawpaw kha chia athua hae. <verse number="40" style="v" />Thahlang sakoih teenaw kya umpaw tee takawnaw akhaan atolang khe ccaboi ccangning a um; sakoih tee takawnaw akhaan voikheit lang raw khe ccaboi ccangning a um. <verse number="41" style="v" />Sakoih atolang te ccaboi ccangpali, alungkhu langte ccaboi ccangpali, abalyn ccangtarya um zah, tuh-e hae vawlan khe silawnawpaw hae kha chia athua. <verse number="42" style="v" />Maee-ute silawnaw lanpaw a-awkuhpaw lungphe ccaboi ccangpali a um, tuh-e hae tuh asaepaw dong kheit lae angankuh, akopaw dong kheit lae angankuh, ahangpaw dong kheit acih hae, tuh-e hae vawlan khe maee-ute silawnaw te silawnaw hanlan mangpaw uccaw hae kha a nung hae. <verse number="43" style="v" />Ccaboi rae vawlan khe zapae akopaw khate po voilu lan a heede hae. Te tuh-e ccaboi hae vawlan khe silawnawpaw saw kha a nung hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Alungkhu lang e sakoih atolang kya alungkhu lang e voidu kyakhe hlawsahthya hae paw elang akhaan hae a um, khaan kheit tuh thahlang e sakoih pe khe um zah alia lang a hawi, khaan kheit tuh nithua lang e sakoih pe khe um zah thahlang a hawi. <verse number="45" style="v" />“Alia lang a hawipaw hynh-e akhaan tuh beikinn kya ryalahpaw ranpibawi elang thua zah, <verse number="46" style="v" />thahlang a hawipaw akhaan tuh silawhang kya ryalahpaw ranpibawi elang nynh thua; e ranpibawi hae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ryalawpya khylan a kalan a naekuh cih hae paw Levi phin kya-e Zadok ciihan hae kyalya kha nynh athua hae,” cite yn hopya. <verse number="47" style="v" />Aning nynh voidu kha tou zah, asaepaw dong za kheit, akopaw dong za kheit, asaepaw te akopaw phe lokuh; silawhang tuh beikinn malang khe a um.</para>
  <para style="s1">Beikinn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Te beikinn tee takawnaw akhaan kalan khe yn cciakhae, tee takawnaw akhaan kya-e tung hae kha tou zah, dong pangaw cci athaaw; thuakaw tuh dong haw lae pali ko zah, thuakaw voikheit lang tuh dong thum cci athaaw. <verse number="49" style="v" />Tee takawnaw akhaan tuh dong kuin sae zah, dong haw lae ning ako; nawkui kaenaw tuh thyh haw acih; thuakaw tung hae pe khe voikheit voikheit langte tung hae a um.</para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te inn khaanpi lungkhu lang yn teekhae zah, tung hae kha a tou hae; tung voikheit lang tuh dong taruh cci athaaw. <verse number="2" style="v" />Teenaw tuh dong haw ako; voikheit lang te voikheit lang a umpaw teenaw tuh dong pangaw cci ako. Hminthyaa tuh tou zah asaepaw dong sung pali, akopaw dong kuin acih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te akhaan lungkhu lang a tee, teenaw kya-e tung hae kha tou zah dong ning cci acih; teenaw tuh dong taruh ako; teenaw voikheit lang te voikheit lang umpaw pang hae tuh dong sari cci acih hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Hminthyaa athangnaw umpaw akhaan tuh tou zah, asaepaw dong kuin, akopaw dong kuin acih. E hynh hmin thyaa huaccepaw, cite yn hopya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Te beikinn pang kha tou zah dong taruh athaaw; beikinn po voilu lan umpaw akhaan hae tuh dong pali cci ako hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuh-e akhaan hae tuh khaan kheit vawlan khaan kheit cite khang thum lante um hae zah, khang kheit cci kya akhaan taraw sung thum cci a um. Beikinn po voilu lan umpaw pang hae kyakhe akhaan hae kha dounawpaw hae a um, tetuh tuh-e akhaan taraw hae tuh beikinn pang nynh dou ho vae khyh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Beikinn po voilu lan umpaw akhaan hae tuh khang kheitnaw kyate khang ningnaw kalan, khang ningnaw kyate khang thumnaw kalan a kaeku thyhte, beikinn po voilu lan umpaw akhaan hae tuh houhouh ako hae. Alia khang kyate palung khang lang kha angaelung e laanpi kyate kae athua. <verse number="8" style="v" />Beikinn po voilu lan kaenawpaw kha mah ka muih; akin lang e akhaan hae athonaw aleihpaw tuh dong taruh asaepaw ccungngue ccangkheit cih ako hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Akin lang umpaw akhaan hae atolang e pang tuh dong pangaw athaaw; beikinn akin lang umpaw akhaan hae te <verse number="10" style="v" />voidu kya-e akhaan hae laku e accawnghannaw hmin tuh beikinn po voilu lan, teitei langte balyn dong kuin ako. <verse number="11" style="v" />Akin lang e akhaan hae tuh accawnghanpaw hmin kalan khe hungkuh hae zah, thuakaw ccangkheit tuh thahlang khe hawi zah ccangpaw thuakaw ccangkheit tuh alia langkhe a hawi; te accawnghanpaw hmin tuh po voilu lan dong pangaw ako.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Beikinn voidu kalan hawite niccaw langsang a umpaw inn tuh dong sung sari ako; tuh-e inn pang tuh po voilu lan dong pangaw thaaw zah, dong sung takua asae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Te beikinn kha tou zah dong za kheit asae; voidu te koihnawpaw a umbia lante inn tuh dong za kheit acih; <verse number="14" style="v" />beikinn malang nithua lang te voidu tuh dong za kheit acih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Niccaw lang e voidu kalan a hawipaw inn, voikheit voikheit lang umpaw zekaw taraw hae ryte dong za kheit acih.</para>
  <para style="p">Beikinn lungkhu e hminthyaa, alungkhu lang e akhaan te atolang e tee takawnaw akhaan tuh thingphe te a ccaan hae, <verse number="16" style="v" />te tuh-e akhaan ccangthum kya po voilu lan a umpaw abypaw thanlan-aw hae kha thing te po voilu lan a raede hae. Laekhu kyate thanlan-aw kyacia (thanlan-aw hae kha phe bong lante), <verse number="17" style="v" />thuakaw aluki cia, alungkhu lang e akhaan te atolang cia beikinn kha thing te po voilu lan a ccaan hae. Te alungkhu lang umpaw akhaan te hminthyaa kya-e pang vawlan balyn khe azuh kha a soi hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuh-e azuh tuh cherubim zuh te ungcci ku hae zuh thua zah, cherubim ccangning laku khe ungcci ku kukheit cci kha po a soi hae. Cherub ccangkheit nynh mitmae ccangning cci a hoi hae: <verse number="19" style="v" />ccungccaw mae tuh ungcci ku kalan khe hawi zah, chindeih mae tuh ccangpaw ungcci ku kalan khe a hawi. Tuhcite beikinn balyn tuh po voilu lan azuh karynte a soi hae; <verse number="20" style="v" />laekhu kyate thuakaw luki cia beikinn pang kyakhe cherubim zuh te ungcci ku zuh kha karynte a soi hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hminthyaa thuakaw tung hae tuh asaepaw te akopaw phe lokuh hae. Hmin thyaapaw malang khe thing te raepaw silawhang alopaw a um, <verse number="22" style="v" />tuh-e tuh dong thum ahang, dong ning sae zah dong ning ako; apaki, a ccusy te a pang hae tuh thingphe te araekuhpaw nynh thua. “E hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang a umpaw ccaboi nynh thua,” cite yn hopya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Hminthyaa te hmin thyaa huapaw kya tuh thuakaw ccangning cci a um. <verse number="24" style="v" />Thuakaw hae tuh thuakawphe phe ning cci um zah, thuakaw ccangkheit hanlan kangzae ccangning cci a um. <verse number="25" style="v" />Beikinn pang kya azuh kha karynte a soi hae hawte, hminthyaa thuakaw hae kyakhe cherubim zuh te ungcci ku azuh hae kha karynte a soi hae; atolang umpaw tee takawnaw akhaan malang khe thing te raepaw dawkupaw a um. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tee takawnaw khaan pang kyakhe voikheit voikheit langte abypaw thanlan-aw te ungcci ku azuh hae a um.</para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Athyaapaw Akhaan hae te Atolang e Pang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te thahlang umpaw atolang e voidu kalan yn cciakhae zah, beikinn voidu te hawiliakuh zah, thahlang e inn te arawsekuhpaw akhaan hae kalan yn cciakhae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuh-e Thahlang umpaw inn tuh dong za kheit sae zah dong sung pangaw ako. <verse number="3" style="v" />Alungkhu lang voidu kya-e ahmin dong kuin lungkhu khe atolang voidu kya-e lung phaekuhpaw te ahawiliakuh lante innkhaan khaan thum a um. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh-e akhaan hae malang khe alungkhu langte laanpi ccangkheit um zah dong haw ako, dong za kheit sae zah thuakaw hae tuh thahlang khe a um hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />E inn kya-e palung khaan hae tuh alia khaan te angaelung khaan laeze adihhua hae, pawccecize tuh-e khaan hae tuh nulang asungkuh hua hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawccecize tuh-e akhaan hae tuh khang thum lante um hae zah, atolang e voidu tung hae hawte tung hoi khyh hae; tukeiccuze palung khaan hae tuh alia khaan te angaelung khaan laeze adihhua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuh-e akhaan hae atolang voikheit voikheit langkhe, atolang e voidu kalan ahawipaw pang tuh dong sung pangaw asae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Atolang e voidu kya-e akhaan hae tuh dong sung pangaw asae hae, beikinn te a hawiliakuh hae paw akhaan hae tuh dong za kheit asae hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />E akhaan hae ccusy khe atolang e voidu kyate teethya nawlan, nithua langte teenawpaw laanpi ccangkheit a um. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuh-e laanpi akopaw tuh voidu pang te phe ccawkuh.</para>
  <para style="p">Alia lang mah, accawnghannaw hmin te ahawiliakuh lante, inn te ahawiliakuh lante akhaan hae um zah, <verse number="11" style="v" />tuh-e akhaan hae malang khe laanpi ccangkheit a um; tuh-e hae tuh thahlang e akhaan hae te phe lokuh hae, asaepaw te akopaw mah alokuh hae, teenaw, pounaw, accinccang te thuakaw hae mah phe lokuh hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze alia lang umpaw akhaan hae lungkhu langkhe, nithua langte, laanpi athangnaw khe teenaw a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Te aning nynh yn hopah zah, accawnghanpaw hmin kalan ahawipaw thahlang e akhaan hae te alia lang e akhaan hae tuh athyaapaw khaan thua hae zah, tuin kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan a naekuhpaw ranpibawi hae nynh athyaa huaccepaw silawnawpaw hae kha a ae cih; tuh-e hmin tuh athyaa keiccuze athyaa huaccepaw silawnawpaw hae—ccathae silawnaw, seithyaanaw silawnaw te cyiseinaw silawnaw kha tuin kya a nung cih hae, pawccecize tuh-e hmin tuh athyaapaw nynh thua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae nynh hmin thyaa lungkhu lang he a tee vae hae ze, tuin kya rya a lawnaw hae paw boeining hae kha khahku leite, tuin kyate atolang e voidu kalan pou lan khyh hae, pawccecize tuh-e boeining hae tuh athyaapaw nynh thua hae; atolang e ccungccaw hae kalan a pou maw hae khe, ccangpaw boeining khate a liakuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aning nynh beikinn hmin alungkhu lang kha he a tou koute nithua lang a hawipaw koikua kyate kae kha yn poukhae zah, beikinn hmin kha po voilu lan a tou. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tounawpaw phaeku khate nithua langsang kha tou zah, tounawpaw phaeku thyhte dong za pangaw acih. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te aning nynh maekute thahlang sang kha tou zah tounawpaw phaeku te dong za pangaw acih. <verse number="18" style="v" />Te aning nynh maekute alia langsang kha tou zah, tounawpaw phaeku te dong za pangaw acih. <verse number="19" style="v" />Te aning nynh maekute niccaw langsang kha tou zah, tounawpaw phaeku te dong za pangaw acih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Aning nynh san pali mawte a tou. Dong za pangaw sae zah dong za pangaw akopaw pang tuh po voilu lan thungkuh zah, tuh-e tuh athyaapaw hmin te huatawpaw hmin kha phiathya nawlan nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia Phu-enaw Beikinn kalan Kinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te nithua lang a hawipaw koikua kalan khe kae kha yn cciakhae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel Pachia phu-enaw tuh nithua langte yn cceih zah, a roi tuh tui alepaw roi te nynh aloku; laephi tuh a phu-enaw khate phaephae a ak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:3-4">Eze 10.3-4</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 10:18-19">18-19</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 11:22-23">11.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:15">Bya 1.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka muihpaw vizin tuh aning nynh khuapi kha ro khylan yn ccia lyaze ka muihpaw vizin te nynh aloku; Kebar vawkhu kin ka muihpaw vizin te lokuh zah, ka mae kha ka tebung. <verse number="4" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phu-enaw tuh nithua lang hawipaw koikua kyate beikinn lang a tee lyakhe, <verse number="5" style="v" />muisaw nynh kae kha yn hangthung zah, alungkhu lang e voidu lungkhu lang yn cciakhae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phu-enaw tuh beikinn kya phe abeih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ccungccapaw tuh ka pe a thadyn lyakhe lukhakheit nynh beikinn kyate bya yn hopyapaw kha ka thae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Aning nynh kae kha: Ccungccapaw, e hmin tuh ka bawitungkhung a umnaw hmin, ka ccu ka synaw hmin, Israel ccungccaw hae kya zungzae ka um cihnaw hmin nynh thua. Israel hae te mih siapharan hae nynh mih ohhuakunaw khate thuasah, a chi hae ze mih siapharan hae rhua khate thuasah athyaapaw ka min kha thusah vae lan khyh hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Mih thuakaw kha ka thuakaw pe nungte mih thuakaw tung kha ka thuakaw tung pe bing hae zah, kae te minmin laku kya pang ccangkheit kyalya he a um tuh, a cyisei hae paw mih nungsikunaw khate ka min thyaapaw kha a thusah hae; tukeiccuze ka thinria zah ka ro hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Atu tuh, mih zohtuh beiknaw kha vua hae sah lah, mih siapharan hae rhua kha kae te asawkunaw langkhe vua hae sah, te kae tuh minmin laku kya zungzae ka um cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ccungccapaw, Israel hae kha beikinn muihsah hae lah, beikinn pungsan kha tou hae sah; te mih hoyleinaw keiccu mih maethah sah. <verse number="11" style="v" />A cyi hae paw balyn keiccuze mih mae he thah te, beikinn pungsan te beikinn uccaw hae, teenaw te pounaw thuakaw hae, beikinn accinccang balyn, a phungzae balyn te beikinn saknaw paccynnaw miakaw te aphunglang balyn kha na nysah cih hae; beikinn saknaw paccynnaw te a phungzae balyn kha minmin nynh muihthyate a zuithya nawlan hae, mih muihnaw khe na zeipah cih hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />E hynh beikinn phunglang nynh thua: Beikinn umnaw mua dung balyn tuh po voilu lan athyaa huaccepaw athua cih. E hynh beikinn phunglang nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Silawhang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />E hae hynh silawhang adi-ale kha dong te toupaw nynh thua (e dong tuh dong kheit zapae acih): Silawhang accusy tuh dong kheit hang zah dong kheit ako, po voilu lan arae tuh khaw kheit ako. E hynh silawhang ahangpaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43.13-17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 27:1-2">Exo 27.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 4:1">2Sh 4.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Silawhang tuh laekhu umpaw accusy kyate ane huanaw adung tuh dong ning sawkuh zah dong kheit ako; adih huapaw adung te ale huapaw adung tuh dong pali sawkuh zah dong kheit ako; <verse number="15" style="v" />silawhang tuh dong pali ahang; silawhang ahangnaw kyate aki ki pali tuh asaethung. <verse number="16" style="v" />Silawhang tuh asaepaw te akopaw alokuh cih, dong haw lae ning asae cih zah dong haw lae ning ako cih, po voilu lan arae tuh khaw ning ako cih. <verse number="17" style="v" />Adung tuh asaepaw te akopaw alokuh cih, dong haw lae pali asae cih zah, dong haw lae pali ako cih, po voilu lan arae tuh khaw ning ako cih, silawhang po voilu lan accusy tuh dong kheit acih cih. Silawhang kya-e kaenawpaw tuh nithua lang a hawi cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Te aning nynh kae kha yn hopah zah: Ccungccapaw, Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: E hae hynh silawhang hanlan phungzae hae nynh thua: Maee-ute silawnawpaw kha a vawlan pyanaw hanlan te sachii kha hei khylan silawhang kha he na rae nin khe, <verse number="19" style="v" />ka rya kha lawpya khylan ka kalan a naekuh hae paw Levi phin ranpibawi Zadok ciihan hae kalan khe seithyaanaw silawnaw hanlan tangnuapaw taraw kha na pya cih hae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. <verse number="20" style="v" />Te sachii abang kha na lah cih zah, silawhang a ki kipali, adung lang e apaki ccangpali te po voilu lan arae kha na noi cih; tuhcite silawhang kha na thyaasah cih zah seishawnaw na raepah cih. <verse number="21" style="v" />Seithyaanaw silawnaw lanpaw tangnuapaw kha na lah cih zah hmin thyaapaw atolang, beikinn voidu lungkhu nungpyapaw hmin kyakhe maee te u athua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nin ningnaw khe douccahpaw miaatepaw khate seithyaanaw silawnaw hanlan si na law cih; silawhang kha tangnuapaw te thyaasah athua hawte silawhang kha miaatepaw chii te na thyaasah cih. <verse number="23" style="v" />Silawhang kha he na thyaasah koute, douccahpaw tangnuapaw taraw te sahiin phu kya-e douccahpaw tuutepaw khate si na law cih. <verse number="24" style="v" />Khah-e hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang na pya cih, te ranpibawi hae nynh khah-e hae kha loi a phing cih hae zah, maee-ute silawnaw lante <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan a pya cih hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Nin sari lungkhu nin takyhte seithyaanaw silawnaw hanlan miaatepaw sa kheit kha na pya cih, sahiin phu kya-e douccah hae paw tangnuapaw taraw sa kheit te tuutepaw sa kheit kha mah na pya cih. <verse number="26" style="v" />Nin sari lungkhu silawhang hanlan seishawnaw a raepah cih hae zah a thyaasah cih hae, tuhcite silawhang kha thyaasah oh. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuh-e nin hae tuh he alia te, nin taryanaw te vae tuh ranpibawi hae nynh silawhang vawlan khe nae kya-e maee-ute silawnaw te ccawkunaw silawnaw hae kha a rae cih hae; te nanning kha kae ccou cih oh, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:35-37">Exo 29.35-37</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Khawpaw Sakoih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te aning nynh kae kha beikinnthyaa atolang e sakoih, nithua lang a hawipaw kalan khe yn cciakhae; tuh-e sakoih tuh phe khawkuh. <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha yn hopah zah: E sakoih hynh khaw athua cih zah hung thua lan khyh, e kyate lu kheit nynh sanmah tee lan khyh; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia tuh tuh-e sakoih kyate a tee vae keiccuze khaw athua cih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Uktu bawi rou nynh uktu bawi athua keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang looh ae khylan tuin kya a haung cih; aning tuh sakoih tee takawnaw akhaan kya-e laanpi kyate a tee cih zah tuin kyamawte a pou cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Beikinn lungkhu lang Teenaw Kaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Te thahlang e sakoih kalan cceihpaw laanpi kyate beikinn malang khe aning nynh kae kha yn cciakhae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phu-enaw te phe abiapaw kha ka muih; te ka mae ka tebung. <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha yn hopah zah: Ccungccapaw, hoyte yn do lah, syntawku tua, kae hopah cih paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn a phungzae balyn te a phunglang balyn konglang kha hoyte ngaetua; beikinn lungkhu lang tee lan ua athua cih hae paw te beikinnthyaa lungkhu lang tee lan ua athua cih lei hae paw balyn kha hoyte syntawku tua. <verse number="6" style="v" />Rhawtho a mangpaw Israel phin kha hopya tua, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Pou Israel hae, nae nungsikunaw balyn kha zaw ccavae sah, <verse number="7" style="v" />ka looh, atho te achii kha he nae pya vae oh ze, thinlung kya te ngesaw kya vingdungawkuh lei hae paw ramccang hae kha ka beikinnthyaa kya um lan na ua oh zah, ka beikinn kha na thusah oh, nae nungsikunaw balyn khate ka byakinnaw kha na ro oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka kya-e athyaapaw silawnaw hae kha na zui khyh oh; ka beikinnthyaa kya ramccang hae kha nae hanlan ryalahtu lang na nung oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Israel hae laku um hae paw ramccang hae balyn kyaze thinlung kya te ngesaw kya vingdungawkuh leipaw ramccangpaw nynh ka beikinnthyaa lungkhu lang tee lan khyh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama Israel hae nynh he a cceihsei hae te, mih zohtuh hae nulang zuikute ka kyate cceihsei hae zah ka kyate asawkuh hae paw Levi phin hae tuh detahnaw a teing cih hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Minmin nynh beikinn sakoih hae kha do-oihte beikinn kya rya a lah cih hae zah, ka beikinnthyaa kya ryalahtu athua cih hae; maee-ute silawnaw te ccungccaw hae nynh silawnaw hae paw kha a theih cih hae, ccungccaw hae hanlan rya a lawpah cih hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Minmin nynh ccungccaw hae hanlan mih zohtuh hae malang khe ryalawpah hae zah, Israel hae kha hoyleinaw lungkhu lang a khuliasaku hae, tukeiccuze minmin tuh detahnaw a teing cih hae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh minmin konglangte bya ka kinku a ci. <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka rya kha lawpya khylan ranpibawi lante ka kalan naekuh lan khyh hae; athyaa huaccepaw uccaw hae, ka kya-e athyaapaw uccaw hae pe lang naekuh lan khyh hae; maethyanaw a ccou cih hae zah a cyi hae paw nungsikunaw hanlan a teing cih hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuhzemah beikinn do-oih khylan a lungkhu kya ryalaw lanpaw balyn kha law khylan minmin kha ka nung cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ranpibawi Phin Levi hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel ccungccaw hae nynh ka kyate a cciasei lya hae ze, ka beikinnthyaa a do-oih hae paw Levi phin, Zadok ciihan ranpibawi hae nynh ka rya kha lawpya khylan ka kalan a naekuh cih hae; kae kha atho te achii pya khylan ka malang a thadyn cih hae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka ryalaw khylan te ryalaw ka naw hae paw kha law khylan ka beikinnthyaa lungkhu lang a tee cih hae paw te ka ccaboi kalan a naekuh cih hae paw tuh minmin nynh athua hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Alungkhu lang e sakoih hae lungkhu lang he a tee hae ze, laphan laaw te kuakuhpaw boeining kha a lawkuh cih hae; alungkhu lang e voidu sakoih hae kya te alungkhu kya rya a law lya hae khe tuuming boeining kha lawkuh lan khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44.17-18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:39-43">Exo 28.39-43</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 16:4">Lev 16.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Mih lu kya laphan laaw te kuakuhpaw pungde kha a khungkuh cih hae zah mih tae kya laphan laaw ccuhoih kha a hoihkuh cih hae; vaesaw a pousah thyapaw boeining kha lawkuh lan khyh hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Minmin nynh ccungccaw hae a umnaw hae atolang e voidu lungkhu lang he a pou hae te, rya thyaapaw a lawnaw hae paw boeining hae kha a khahkuh cih hae zah, athyaanaw khaan kya a nung cih hae; te ccangpaw boeining kha a lawkuh cih hae, tuhteze nynh athyaapaw kha mih boeining khate ccungccaw hae kalan cciakhaesei lan khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:23">Lev 16.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Mih sang kha ngokuh lan khyh hae zah, sae mah saesakuh lan khyh hae; azawnaw te a ngokuh cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 21:5">Lev 21.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Ranpibawi nynh alungkhu lang e voidu lungkhu lang he a tee ze, misutui kha neih lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:9">Lev 10.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Nomaenung kha thuasah, vawpaw te a mahkuh hae paw nopi kha thuasah zu lang dykuh lan khyh, Israel phin liaccady khyhze ranpibawi nynh a chitawpaw nomaenung kha zu lang a dykuh cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 21:7">Lev 21.7</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 21:13-14">13-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" />Minmin nynh ka ccungccaw hae kha athyaapaw te athyaa leipaw laku alaenaw kha a ccangpah cih hae zah, athyaapaw te athyaa leipaw laku phiathyanaw kha a muihsah cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:10">Lev 10.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Pekumaekunaw a um ze, byapiatu lang a tang cih hae zah, ka phungzae thyhte bya a pae cih hae. Ccyh khyapaw ka poi hae balyn te asekuhpaw ka kawbya hae te ka phunglang hae kha a zui cih hae zah, ka sabbath hae kha thyaararih lan a sung cih hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Michi rhua kalan naekute mimaw toulou kha thusakuh lan khyh hae; tuhzemah nung, paaw, ccapaw, ccanung, u te neitaw, vawpaw a hoi leipaw ccianung hanlan kha tuh a thusakuh kho hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 21:1-4">Lev 21.1-4</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v" />Mithyaapaw lang a tang koute amaw hanlan nin sari a riapah cih hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Hminthyaa lungkhu kya ryalaw khylan alungkhu lang e voidu lungkhu, hminthyaa lungkhu lang a tee nin khe, a seithyaanaw silawnaw kha a rae cih, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />E hynh mih rho athua cih: Kae hynh mih rho nynh ka thua; Israel ram kya ccoupaw rho kha minmin na pya lan khyh oh; kae hynh mih ccoupaw rho nynh ka thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:20">Nam 18.20</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v" />Minmin nynh ccathae silawnawpaw, seishawnaw silawnawpaw te cyiseinaw silawnawpaw kha a ae cih hae; Israel ram e athyaapaw uccaw miakaw tuh mih kya-e athua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44.29-30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:8-19">Nam 18.8-19</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v" />Aphuinphuin kya-e thaety hae balyn kya-e masaty huapaw, na hlu oh paw aphuinphuin balyn kya-e ahlu miakaw tuh ranpibawi hae kya-e athua cih; nae inn kya hythuanaw a um nawlan sanlou lang nonpaw vaekhui kya-e masatypaw vaekhui kha mah ranpibawi kalan na pya cih oh. <verse number="31" style="v" />Amaw chi lan chihpaw khyhze loramsaw nynh a teipaw pavaw thuasah, sarangpaw thuasah ranpibawi hae nynh ae lan khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:8">Lev 22.8</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Athyaapaw Loram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ram kha rho lang he na neekuh oh te, athyaapaw loram ramkheit kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> elang na phiapah cih oh, tuh-e loram tuh dong thong kuin lae pangaw asae cih zah, dong thong kuin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gk: Heb </char><char style="fq" closed="false">haw</char></note> ako cih; tuh-e loram pynpi tuh athyaapaw loram athua cih. <verse number="2" style="v" />E loram lungkhu hin dong za pangaw sae zah dong za pangaw akopaw, asaepaw te akopaw phe lokuhpaw kha beikinnthyaa hanlan athua cih zah, po voilu lan dong sung pangaw accawnghan cih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Athyaapaw loram lungkhu khe dong thong kuin lae pangaw sae zah dong thong haw akopaw hmin hminkheit kha na tou cih zah, alungkhu khe beikinnthyaa, hmin thyaa huaccepaw a um cih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh-e loram tuh ram lungkhu ze athyaapaw loram athua cih zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ryalawpya khylan amaw kalan naekuh hae zah, beikinnthyaa kya ryalah hae paw ranpibawi hae hanlan athua cih; tuh-e loram tuh ranpibawi hae inn hanlan te beikinnthyaa elang athyaapaw hmin athua cih. <verse number="5" style="v" />Dong thong kuin lae pangaw sae zah, dong thong haw akopaw ccangpaw hmin kha beikinn kya ryalah hae paw Levi phin hae mih umnaw lanpaw khua athua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Athyaapaw loram te po piakuh lante, dong thong pangaw ko zah dong thong kuin lae pangaw asaepaw hmin kha khuapi hanlan na ia cih oh; tuh-e tuh Israel phin balyn kya-e athua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Athyaapaw loram hanlan te khuapi hanlan ia athuapaw hmin kalansang tuh uktu bawi kya-e athua cih zah, tuh-e ram tuh athyaapaw loram te khuapi hanlan iapaw hmin kalan a hawipaw athua cih, niccaw lang athangnaw ramri cia aphah cih, te nithua langkhe a maeleihkuh cih zah athangnaw ramri cia athua cih. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh Israel ram kya aning nynh a hoipaw athua cih. Ka kya-e uktu bawi nynh ka ccungccaw hae kha tuaasah boi vae lan khyh hae; thuasalama Israel phin hae kha mih phin raveih thyhte ram kha na nee cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Pou Israel uktu bawi hae, zaw ccavae sah! Puathonaw te tuaasahkunaw kha vua oh lah, adingpaw te akyhpaw kha cyih oh. Ka ccungccaw hae kha dee nan vae oh, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Khinlung te Zawccu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahmepaw zawccu te khinlung, ahmepaw ephah te ahmepaw bath kha na mang cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:36">Lev 19.36</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Ephah te bath tuh tounaw kya phe lokuh cih hae, bath ccangkheit tuh homer pumhaw pumkheit athua cih zah, ephah ccangkheit tuh mah homer pumhaw pumkheit athua cih; homer tuh ccungccaw zapi nynh mang huapaw tounawpaw athua cih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Shekel ccangkheit tuh gerah kuin lae pangaw te alokuh cih. Shekel sung taruh tuh nanning hanlan mina ccangkheit te alokuh cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Silawnawpaw hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />E hynh na rae lan oh paw silawnaw nynh thua: chanvuih thuasah, barli thuasah homer ccangkheit kyaze ephah pum taruh pum kheit, <verse number="14" style="v" />chitui tuh kor kheit kyaze bath pumhaw pumkheit (kor kheit tuh bath ccanghaw nynh thua); <verse number="15" style="v" />te Israel hae a umnaw hae kyate tuu za ning umpaw aphu kyate tuu sa kheit athua cih. E hynh minmin hanlan seingaethyanaw raenaw lanpaw ccathae silawnaw, maee-ute silawnaw te ccawkunaw silawnaw hanlan nynh thua hae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci. <verse number="16" style="v" />E ram kya-e ccungccaw balyn nynh hynh-e silawnawpaw hae hynh Israel uktu bawi kalan a cciakhae cih hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Uktu bawi ryalaw tuh beiknaw poi hae, sawpaw sah leihpaw, sabbath hae, Israel phin kya-e accyh khyapaw poi hae kyakhe maee-ute silawnaw, ccathae silawnaw te niapaw silawnaw hae kha a rae cih: Israel phin hanlan seingaethyanaw rae khylan seithyaanaw silawnaw, ccathae silawnaw, maee-ute silawnaw te ccawkunaw silawnaw hae kha a rae cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Beiknaw Poi hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Exo 12.1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:33-43">Lev 23.33-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Masaty sawpaw, nin kheit nin khe douccahpaw tangnuapaw taraw sa kheit kha na lah cih oh zah beikinnthyaa kha na thyaasah cih oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Ranpibawi nynh seishawnaw silawnawpaw sachii abang kha a lah cih zah, beikinn thuakaw tung hae, silawhang apaki ki pali te alungkhu lang e voidu sakoih tung hae kha a noi cih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Cyiseinaw khyhze sawphahkunaw keiccuze a seipaw miakaw hanlan tuh-e sawpaw nin sari nin khe tuhcih maminte na cyipah cih oh; tuhcite beikinn elang seingaethyanaw kha na rae cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Masaty sawpaw, nin haw lae pali nin khe kawtaw poi kha na tua cih oh, nin sari lungkhu ransi phing leipaw sanlou kha na ae cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Exo 12.1-20</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 28:16-25">Nam 28.16-25</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuin nin khe uktu bawi nynh amaw te ram lungkhu e ccungccaw balyn elang seithyaanaw silawnaw hanlan tangnuapaw taraw khate si a law cih. <verse number="23" style="v" />Poi nin sari lungkhu nin takyhte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan maee-ute silawnaw lante douccahpaw tangnuapaw taraw sa sari te tuutepaw sa sari khate si a law cih; seithyaanaw silawnaw hanlan miaatepaw sa kheit khate nin takyh si a law cih. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tangnuapaw sa kheit hanlan ephah ccangkheit, tuutepaw sa kheit hanlan ephah ccangkheit, ephah ccangkheit hanlan chitui hin kheit khate ccathae silawnaw kha aning nynh a rae cih. <verse number="25" style="v" />Sawpaw sah sarinaw, nin haw lae pangaw nin kyate poi nin sari lungkhu seithyaanaw silawnaw, maee-ute silawnaw te ccathae silawnaw te chitui silawnaw kha uktu bawi nynh tuhcih maminte a rae cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:33-36">Lev 23.33-36</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 29:12-38">Nam 29.12-38</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Phunglang Aphuinphuin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Nithua lang a hawipaw alungkhu lang e voidu sakoih tuh ryalaw nin nintaruh lungkhu khaw athua cih; thuasalama sabbath nin te sawpaw sah leihpaw nin kya tuh hung athua cih. <verse number="2" style="v" />Uktu bawi tuh atolang te tee takawnaw akhaan thuakaw kyakhate a tee cih zah, thuakaw tung pe khe a thadyn cih. Ranpibawi hae nynh uktu bawi kya-e maee-ute silawnaw te ccawkunaw silawnaw kha a rae cih hae, te aning tuh teenaw sakoih kyakhe a bakhung cih. Te aning tuh a pou cih, thuasalama sakoih tuh zete cia khaw thua lan khyh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ram lungkhu e ccungccaw hae tuh sabbath nin hae te sawpaw sah leihpaw nin hae kyakhe tuh-e teenaw sakoih kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe a bakhung cih hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Uktu bawi nynh sabbath nin kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan a raepaw maee-ute silawnaw tuh douccahpaw tuutaw sa taruh te douccahpaw tuutepaw sa kheit athua cih hae; <verse number="5" style="v" />te ccathae silawnaw tuh tuutepaw sa kheit te vaekhui ephah ccangkheit, tuutaw ryte a ry zeihte a pya cih, te vaekhui ephah ccangkheit cci kyaze chitui hin kheit a umbia cih. <verse number="6" style="v" />Sawpaw sah leihpaw nin khe abalynte douccah hae paw tangnuapaw taraw sa kheit, tuutaw sa taruh te tuutepaw sa kheit kha a pya cih; <verse number="7" style="v" />ccathae silawnaw tuh tangnuapaw te vaekhui ephah ccangkheit, tuutaw ryte a ry zeih a pya cih, te vaekhui ephah ccangkheit cci kyaze chitui hin kheit a umbia cih. <verse number="8" style="v" />Uktu bawi tuh he a tee vae ze, tee takawnaw akhaan thuakaw kyate a tee cih zah, a pou zemah tuin kyate a pou cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ram lungkhu e ccungccaw hae tuh accyh khyapaw poi kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang he a ccia vae hae ze, beik khylan thahlang e sakoih kyate a teepaw miakaw nynh alia lang e sakoih kyate a pou cih; te alia lang e sakoih kyate a teepaw miakaw nynh thahlang e sakoih kyate a pou cih: a teenaw hae sakoih laanpi kyate ki leite malang lawbabin lan cciate a pou cih hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Minmin a tee hae ze uktu bawi tuh a teebua cih zah, a pou hae ze a poubua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Beiknaw poi te accyh khyapaw poi kyaze ccathae silawnaw hanlan tangnuapaw taraw sa kheit te vaekhui ephah ccangkheit, tuutepaw sa kheit te vaekhui ephah ccangkheit, tuutaw ryte a pya ry zeihte a pya cih, te vaekhui ephah ccangkheit te chitui hin kheit a umbia cih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Lungthote silawnaw thuasah, maee-ute silawnaw thuasah, ccawkunaw silawnaw thuasah uktu bawi nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan lungthote silawnaw kha he a rae vae ze, nithua lang hawipaw sakoih kha hungpya athua cih; amaw kya-e maee-ute silawnaw khyhze ccawkunaw silawnaw kha sabbath nin kya a rae hawte a rae cih. Te a pou cih zah, a pou koute sakoih kha khaw athua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maee-ute silawnaw hanlan douccahpaw, kum kheit acihpaw tuutaw sa kheit kha nin takyhte awkhua takyh kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan a pya cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuh-e tuutaw ryte ccathae silawnaw hanlan ephah pum taruh pum kheit, vaekhui nonnaw hanlan chitui hin kheit kya-e pum thum pum kheit kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan ccathae silawnaw tuh awkhua takyh a rae cih, e hynh zungzae hanlan phungzae nynh thua. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuhcite awkhua takyh kya tyty raepaw maee-ute silawnaw tuh tuutaw, ccathae silawnaw te chitui kha pya athua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Uktu bawi nynh a rho kha a ccapaw lukhakheit kalan lasung lang a pya ze, tuh-e tuh a ccapaw kya-e athua vae cih zah, rho lang a muepaw nynh thua vae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama a rho kha a ryalahtu lukhakheit kalan lasung lang a pya ze, a lue kum kyacia rou nynh a kya-e lang a tang cih; te tuh-e tuh uktu bawi kalan a kithui cih; a ccaaw hae rou nynh a rho kha a ccou kho hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:10">Lev 25.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Uktu bawi nynh ccungccaw hae rho hankhakheit kha nangsete lawkude lan khyh; amaw a uccaw lungkhu e kha nynh a ccaaw hae kha rho lang a pya cih hae, tuhteze nynh ka ccungccaw hae tuh mih uccaw kha shung lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Te aning nynh kae kha sakoih kalansang umpaw teenaw kyate yn cciakhae zah, thahlang hawipaw, ranpibawi hae kya-e athyaapaw khaan lungkhu langkhe yn teekhae; te tuh-e akhaan hae niccaw lang athangnaw kya umpaw hmin hminkheit kha ka muih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Aning nynh kae kha, “E hmin tuh ranpibawi hae nynh cyiseinaw silawnaw te seithyaanaw silawnaw kya mangpaw saw kha a thung cihnaw hae hmin te ccathae silawnaw lang pyapaw kha maee te a rua cihnaw hae hmin nynh thua, ccungccaw hae kha thyaasah khylan tuh-e uccaw hae tuh atolang e voidu kalan na poukhae lan khyh oh,” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Te atolang e voidu kalan yn cciakhae zah, tuh-e voidu apaki ki pali kyakhe yn cciakhae; te tuh-e voidu apaki ccangkheit cci kyakhe voidu adihpaw ccangkheit cci a um, <verse number="22" style="v" />tuh-e voidu adihpaw hae tuh dong sung pali cci sae hae zah, dong sung thum cci ako hae, asaepaw te akopaw phe lokuh hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuh-e apaki ki pali hae alungkhu langte po voilu lan lung te raepaw pang ccarou um zah, tuh-e pang hae ccusy khe po voilu lan takua hae a um. <verse number="24" style="v" />Te aning nynh kae kha, “E hmin hae hynh ccungccaw hae kya-e silawnawpaw hae kha beikinn kya ryalahtu hae nynh a thungnaw hae anghyngnaw hmin nynh athua hae,” yn cipya.</para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beikinn kyate Aluapaw Tui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te aning nynh kae kha beikinn thuakaw kalan khe yn kikhae; tuin kyakhe beikinn thuakaw zakaw kyate tui tuh nithua langkhe alua (pawccecize beikinn tuh nithua langkhe a hawi); beikinn thuakaw alia lang athangnaw akawlan, silawhang alia lang kyate tui tuh aluabung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Zek 14.8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 7:38">Joh 7.38</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:1">Bya 22.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Te thahlang sakoih laanpi kyate kae kha yn poukhae zah, nithua lang hawipaw atolang umpaw sakoih atolang khe yn voilukhae zah yn cciakhae; te alia langsang khe tui tuh pou zah alua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ccungccapaw tuh a kuih kya arui ccyngkute nithua lang cceih zah, dong thong kheit a tou koute kae kha tui tuh po yn kesah, tuh-e tui tuh ka ccumali kyacia akhu. <verse number="4" style="v" />Dong thong kheit bua tou zah, tui kha bua yn kesah, tuh-e tui tuh ka ccukharu cia akhu. Dong thong kheit bua tou zah, tui kha bua yn kesah; tuh-e tui tuh ka cce kyacia akhu. <verse number="5" style="v" />Dong thong kheit bua tou zah, khuraw lang ka zua kho leipaw vawpi nynh thua vae, pawccecize tui tuh akhu vae; tuh-e tui tuh zua kho um leipaw vawpi, ohku khinpaw nynh thua vae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Aning nynh kae kha, “Ccungccapaw, e hynh na muih vae khaw?” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">Te aning nynh vaw kin dykyhte po yn kikhae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka ki lyakhe vaw kin dykyh kya thingku lepaw patae kha sirawkhuraw po ka muih. <verse number="8" style="v" />Aning nynh kae kha, “E tui hynh nithua lang lua zah Arabah lang aluabung; te rili kya he apyakuh te, a-yhkuhpaw rili tuh tui thawpaw lang a tang cih. <verse number="9" style="v" />E tui aluanaw miakaw kyakhe ahiinpaw ahysuepaw miakaw tuh ahiin cih, e tui nynh aluanaw kya tuh ngasaw patae a um cih. Tuh-e tui tuh tui thawpaw lang a tang cih zah, vaw nynh aluanaw kya tuh atyn-are ahiin cih. <verse number="10" style="v" />En-gedi kyate En-eglaim kyacia rili kin khe ccungccaw hae tuh thadynte ngasaw a baw cih hae; tuin kya tuh paih a rawnaw hae hmin athua cih; tuin kya-e ngasaw aphuinphuin tuh Rili Lepaw kya-e ngasaw hae hawte myarya alung cih hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama kuatui te tuinoh kya-e tui tuh tui thawpaw lang tang lan khyh; tuhcihmawte loi lang a um cih hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Vawpi sirawkhuraw te akin khe thingku phuinccing tuh looh lang apo cih. Tuh-e thing anaw hae tuh naan lan khyh zah athae hae tuh thuh lan khyh, sawpaw sah takyhte thae hoypaw kha athae cih hae, pawccecize tuh-e hae elang beikinnthyaa kyate aluapaw tui nynh thua. Tuh-e thingthae hae tuh looh lang a tang cih hae zah, thingnaw hae tuh dannaw lang a tang cih hae,” yn cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:2">Bya 22.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Ramri Thawpaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: E hynh Israel phin phinhaw lae ning nynh ram kha rho lang na neeku nawlan oh paw ramri hae nynh thua. Josef nynh loram ram ning a ccou cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Ram hynh phe ngankuh lante na neekuh cih oh; e ram hynh nae minpaaw hae kha pya lan bya ka kinpyaku vae hae, te e ram hynh nae rho lang a tang cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />E hynh ram a ramri athua cih: Thahlang tuh Rili Lepaw kyate Hethlon laanpi pe, Lebo-hamath te Zedah kyacia, <verse number="16" style="v" />Berothah, Sibraim (e hynh Damaskas ramri te Hamath ramri laku a umpaw nynh thua), Hauran ramri pe umpaw Hazer-hattikon kyacia athua cih. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ramri tuh rili kyate Damaskas ramri thahlang umpaw Hazar-enon, te thahlang tuh Hamath ramri cia athua cih. E hynh thahlang sang nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nithua lang ramri tuh, Hauran te Damaskas laku athua cih; Gilead te Israel loram laku Jordan vaw thyhte athua cih; nithua lang e rili te Tamar kyacia athua cih. E hynh nithua langsang ramri athua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Alia lang ramri tuh, Tamar kyate Meribath-kadesh tui kyacia athua cih, tuin kyate Izip Accya dykyh thyhte Rili Lepaw kyacia athua cih. E hynh alia langsang ramri athua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Niccaw lang ramri tuh, Rili Lepaw athua cih zah, Lebo-hamath te arawsekunaw cia athua cih. E hynh niccaw langsang ramri athua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuhcite e ram hynh Israel phin hae nynh ccarou na neekuh cih oh. <verse number="22" style="v" />E ram hynh naemaw te nae kya umbua hae zah ccaaw a saah vae hae paw ramccang hae kha rho lang na neekuh cih oh. Minmin tuh Israel ramccungccaw hawte athua cih hae; minmin tuh Israel minphuin hae kya rho kha neebua athua cih hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Ramccang hae tuh a umbuanaw hae phin miakaw kya mih rho kha na neebua cih oh, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ram Neekunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />E hae hynh Israel phin hae min nynh thua: Thahlang ramri tuh Hethlon laanpi, Lebo-hamath kyate Hazar-enon kyacia (tuh-e tuh Damaskas ramri, thahlang Hamath kyacia), nithua langte niccaw lang cia tuh Dan loram athua cih. <verse number="2" style="v" />Dan ramri te kyngkuh zah, nithua langte niccaw lang cia, Asher loram athua cih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Asher ramri te kyngkuh zah, nithua langte niccaw lang cia, Naftali loram athua cih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Naftali ramri te kyngkuh zah, nithua langte niccaw lang cia, Manasseh loram athua cih. <verse number="5" style="v" />Manasseh ramri te kyngkuh zah, nithua langte niccaw lang cia, Efraim loram athua cih. <verse number="6" style="v" />Efraim ramri te kyngkuh zah, nithua langte niccaw lang cia, Reuben loram athua cih. <verse number="7" style="v" />Reuben ramri te kyngkuh zah nithua langte niccaw lang cia, Judah loram athua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah ramri te kyngkuh zah nithua langte niccaw lang cia, taekhiate na nung oh paw loram athua cih, tuh-e loram akopaw tuh dong thong kuin lae pangaw athua cih zah, asaepaw tuh nithua langte niccaw lang cia, Israel phin hae kya-e loram hae te alokuh cih, tuh-e loram angaelung khe beikinnthyaa a um cih. <verse number="9" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> elang taekhiate na nung cih oh paw loram tuh dong thong kuin lae pangaw asae cih zah dong thong kuin ako cih. <verse number="10" style="v" />E hae hynh athyaapaw loram lante neekupaw athua cih zah: ranpibawi hae hanlan tuh thahlang khe dong thong kuin lae pangaw, niccaw langkhe dong thong haw ako cih, nithua langkhe dong thong haw ako cih zah alia langkhe dong thong kuin lae pangaw asae cih, tuh-e loram angaelung khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinnthyaa a um cih. <verse number="11" style="v" />E athyaapaw loram hynh Israel hae nynh a cciasei lya hae ze, Levi phin hae nynh cciasei leite ka rya a lah hae paw Zadok ciihan, thyaasah athua hae paw ranpibawi hae hanlan athua cih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuh-e loram tuh loram kyaze hmin thyaa huaccepaw thua zah, Zadok ciihan hae hanlan taekhiate a nung hae paw loram athua cih zah, Levi phin hae ramri te akyngkuh cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae kya-e loram te akyngkuhpaw Levi phin hae loram tuh dong thong kuin lae pangaw sae zah dong thong haw ako cih. Asaepaw abalynte dong thong kuin lae pangaw athua cih zah, dong thong kuin ako cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuh-e laephi tuh zua lan khyh hae, hankhakheit te mah rulae lan khyh hae; ram kyaze ahoy huaccepaw e laephi tuh lukhakheit min lante paleih lan khyh hae, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> elang athyaapaw loram nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A laehypaw loram, dong thong pangaw ko zah dong thong kuin lae pangaw asaepaw tuh khuapi hanlan mang lanpaw huatawpaw laephi athua cih zah, zapi umnaw hanlan te khuapi rae nawlan athua cih. Tuh-e loram angaelung khe khuapi a um cih; <verse number="16" style="v" />khuapi ako-aby tuh: thahlang tuh dong thong pali za pangaw, alia lang tuh dong thong pali za pangaw, nithua lang tuh dong thong pali za pangaw, niccaw lang tuh dong thong pali za pangaw athua cih. <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuapi tuh zapi hanlan laephi a hoi cih zah: thahlang tuh dong za ning sung pangaw, alia lang tuh dong za ning sung pangaw, nithua lang tuh dong za ning sung pangaw, niccaw lang tuh dong za ning sung pangaw athua cih. <verse number="18" style="v" />Athyaapaw laephi te akyngkuh lante po saepaw laephi tuh nithua lang dong thong haw, niccaw lang dong thong haw athua cih zah, athyaapaw laephi te po akyngkuh cih. Tuin kyate apoupaw ccathae tuh khuapi kya-e ryalahtu hae elang looh athua cih. <verse number="19" style="v" />Khuapi kya-e ryalahtu hae, Israel phin hae balyn nynh tuh-e laephi kya looh a ccou cih hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Akopaw te asaepaw phe lokuh lante dong thong kuin lae pangaw acihpaw, taekhiate na nung cih paw laephi balyn tuh khuapi laephi ryte athyaapaw laephi athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Athyaapaw laephi kalansang te alaepaw laephi te khuapi laephi kalansang te alaepaw laephi tuh uktu bawi laephi athua cih. Athyaapaw laephi kyate nithua lang ramri kyacia dong thong kuin lae pangaw, niccaw lang tuh niccaw lang ramri kyacia dong thong kuin lae pangaw, Israel phin hae kya-e laephi hae te ngingrarih lan a umpaw laephi tuh uktu bawi laephi athua cih. Athyaapaw laephi tuh angaelung umpaw beikinn kya-e beikinnthyaa ryte, <verse number="22" style="v" />te Levi phin hae laephi te khuapi kya-e laephi tuh uktu bawi kya-e laephi angaelung khe a um cih. Uktu bawi laephi tuh Judah ram te Benjamin ram laku khe a um cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Israel phin hae tuh: nithua langte niccaw lang cia Benjamin loram athua cih. <verse number="24" style="v" />Benjamin ramri te kyngkuh zah, nithua langte niccaw lang cia, Simeon loram athua cih. <verse number="25" style="v" />Simeon ramri te kyngkuh zah, nithua langte niccaw lang cia, Issakhar loram athua cih. <verse number="26" style="v" />Issakhar ramri te kyngkuh zah, nithua langte niccaw lang cia Zebulun loram athua cih. <verse number="27" style="v" />Zebulun ramri te kyngkuh zah, nithua langte niccaw lang cia Gad loram athua cih. <verse number="28" style="v" />Gad loram alia lang ramri tuh Tamar kyate Meribath-kadesh tui kyacia, tuin kyate Izip Accya dykyh thyhte Rili Lepaw kyacia phe a thua. <verse number="29" style="v" />E ram tuh Israel phin hae kha rho lang na nee lan hae paw ram thua zah, e hae hynh mih loram nynh thua hae, cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />E hae tuh khuapi kya-e pounaw nynh thua hae: Thahlang sang tuh dong thong pali za pangaw ko zah, <verse number="31" style="v" />Reuben koikua, Judah koikua te Levi koikua cite koikua ccangthum a um cih, Israel phin hae min thyhte khuapi koikua hae min kha bing athua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48.30-34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:12-13">Bya 21.12-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="32" style="v" />Nithua langsang tuh dong thong pali za pangaw ko zah, Josef koikua, Benjamin koikua te Dan koikua cite koikua ccangthum a um cih. <verse number="33" style="v" />Alia langsang tuh dong thong pali za pangaw ko zah, Simeon koikua, Issakhar koikua te Zebulun koikua cite koikua ccangthum a um cih. <verse number="34" style="v" />Niccaw langsang tuh dong thong pali za pangaw ko zah, Gad koikua, Asher koikua te Naftali koikua cite koikua ccangthum a um cih. <verse number="35" style="v" />Khuapi tuh po voilu lante dong thong haw lae tarya acih cih. Tuh-e ccyh kyate khuapi min tuh Tuin kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a um, ci athua vae cih.</para>
</usx>